window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":5401,"title":"Chapter 5401: The Hunt","paragraphs":["But the hotel staff supporting Noah were also heading toward the fire exit staircase; the entire hotel was operated by the country behind Noah, yet not all hotel staff were loyal to that country—most of them served as waitstaff.","Because waitstaff could easily monitor anywhere in the hotel and gather intelligence without raising suspicions.","The waitstaff supporting Noah clashed directly with Cyril’s men in the hotel corridors, bullets whizzing past like rain, hitting the wallpapered walls, ceilings, and floors, creating uneven pockmarks.","Cyril was surprised to find supporters on Noah’s side. His investigations had not revealed many Caucasians; why were there still Caucasians he wanted to capture alive in the hotel?","Cyril, who had made a name for himself in Molaban without incurring the local police’s wrath, was not only brutal and cunning but also quite intelligent. The moment a suspicion arose, Cyril immediately recalled the lobby manager who had opened fire earlier. An idea flashed through his mind, but Cyril gradually dismissed it.","He must be overthinking it; the hotel couldn’t possibly belong to a Caucasian.","That could only mean he had not fully investigated and had thought there were only a few Caucasians.","Now that the Caucasians had support, he shouldn’t waste any more time; he should capture the person and leave immediately.","\"Push to the fifth floor,\" Xia Jinyuan’s cold and resolute voice came over G3’s earpiece. G3 glanced at the number above the fire exit sign and reported a series of digits in English.","Four, they were now on the fourth floor.","As the gunshots grew closer, Ye Jian began to count down silently in her heart, from ten to one.","The success of the plan hinged on this one move.","To force the enemy to reveal themselves rather than killing them outright—this approach, unexpectedly, was shared by both Xia Jinyuan and Cyril’s arrangements. Therefore, Cyril’s men didn’t intend to actually shoot to kill those trapped in the stairwell; they only needed to force them into a state of helplessness.","Both parties had this intention, which, in turn, facilitated the actions of Snow Region Brigade’s comrades.","However, G3 was unaware that Cyril intended to capture them alive; on his end, someone had already been shot dead. While Noah’s side dragged their comrade back, they launched an even more frenzied counterattack.","Cyril’s men suffered heavy casualties. Fortunately, reinforcements could fill in; otherwise, Noah’s ferocious combat team would have indeed spilled blood to carve out an escape path.","The target was getting closer and had already reached the fifth floor—now was the Xueyu unit’s time to act.","\"Open fire!\" Xia Jinyuan’s deep voice came through the intercom to Ye Jian’s ears, who was hidden in the first hotel room just outside the fire exit on the fifth floor and exhaled very softly.","She was guarding the first room on the fifth floor, while V8 was on the fourth. Noah’s team had no chance to advance beyond the fifth floor, but T6 was on standby on the sixth.","Thus, the fourth, fifth, and sixth floors were all secured by the Snow Region Brigade. As long as Alice Cheng was alone, they had the opportunity to rescue Alice Cheng from Noah’s grasp.","Now it couldn’t really be considered a rescue—Alice Cheng hadn’t needed saving from the start.","It would be more accurate to say they had invited her, inviting Alice Cheng to return with them to the Chinese side.","The gunfire grew more intense, and chaotic footsteps came from above and below, everywhere. All of the hotel rooms’ doors were tightly shut; only the corridors, stairwells, and lobby echoed with the sound of gunfire.","The rooms had good sound insulation; guests on higher floors hadn’t heard any gunfire due to the sudden blackout. They had called the front desk to inquire about the reason, but the phone lines had been severed long ago, and picking up the handset yielded no sound at all."]},{"number":5402,"title":"Chapter 5402: Contact","paragraphs":["Some guests sat in their rooms waiting, slowly sipping wine from opened bottles, anticipating a call. Those more impatient opened their room doors, intending to go downstairs to inquire. Although they hadn’t heard anything walking down their floor hallway, as they reached the stairwell, they suddenly heard \"bang, bang, bang\" as if something was continuously impacting, and the more alert guests instantly realized what the sound meant and, frightened, hurried back to their rooms, daring not to come out while notifying their companions staying in the hotel but in different rooms.","The local police in Molaban had also received emergency calls. Upon hearing that someone had entered the hotel and started shooting, the police, struck by a headache, had to deploy officers while advising the callers to stay in their rooms and think of ways to use movable items like mattresses and sofas to block their doors to prevent mishaps.","The entire hotel was actually in chaos at this time, but it seemed relatively calm on the surface since everyone was staying inside their rooms without running about.","Since the shooting intentionally avoided Alice Cheng, it gave her a chance to escape. The fire door on the fifth floor was right in front of her; all she needed was to open it and she could get away.","This was an extremely clever woman. Although she was willing to act as a bait, she did not wish to be left behind. Discovering that she had a chance to escape, Alice Cheng began shooting while heading towards the fire door.","Noah and his team planned similarly.","At the same time, the entire power supply in the hotel was cut off, plunging the once brightly lit hotel into darkness within seconds.","Alice was already close to the fire door, her chest heaving rapidly as she took deep breaths. At the same time, her hand slowly found the handle of the fire door.","God bless...","She whispered softly, then vigorously pulled open the fire door. Expected light did not flood in from the corridor outside the door; when she opened it, it was also pitch black outside.","That meant Alice Cheng was safe and had not exposed herself by the action of pulling the door.","Sweating profusely, Alice Cheng, overjoyed, stepped into the darkness outside as if she had been reborn.","Almost simultaneously as she opened the fire door, Ye Jian too darted from inside a room, having been keenly monitoring Alice Cheng’s every move with his G3, enabling him to react timely.","Darting out, he attacked from behind Alice Cheng, grabbing her neck with his elbow, pulling her into the room with motions as swift as lightning, just like dragging a rag doll.","Inside the room was a male guest, but he was currently unconscious, lying on the bed. Ye Jian incapacitated him further to prevent any loud outcries.","Although always on guard, Alice Cheng, never expecting to be ambushed immediately upon stepping out, lost her initial chance to retaliate when she heard the attacker whisper in her ear that he was a Chinese. Alice instantly ceased struggling, allowing herself to be dragged in.","A Chinese, she had been waiting for them to arrive but had not anticipated encountering them at such a time.","They must have been here for a long, long time, with Noah remaining oblivious.","Shocked, Alice ceased struggling. At this moment, she didn’t want to struggle anymore. She needed to survive and get out. Since Noah and his team could no longer manage that, she would have to rely on the Chinese who had come to rescue her.","\"OK, I understand; I won’t make a fuss, I will cooperate with you fully.\" The situationally aware Alice spoke calmly, sensing her body gradually relaxing, believing with the arrival of the Chinese, she might actually make it back safely.","God, she definitely would leave safely."]},{"number":5403,"title":"Chapter 5403: Retreat","paragraphs":["Ye Jian did not immediately release Alice Cheng; she first took the pistol from Alice’s hand and searched her for any other dangerous weapons. Only after confirming there were no threats did Ye Jian speak calmly, \"It’s very chaotic outside right now, someone wants to kill the person who has been following you. I can let you go, and you can call for help, but I can assure you, if you do call out, the result will not be what you want.\"","A smart woman would surely make the smartest choice.","Alice Cheng, with sweat trickling down her neck, nodded with some difficulty. Her neck was tightly clamped by Ye Jian’s bent elbow, and her head could hardly move. Even the nod was minimal.","\"Of course I know that,\" she said. \"Right now, I want to get out alive, and you all are my best option.\"","Ye Jian slowly loosened her elbow but remained on guard. She pressed her earpiece and spoke softly, telling all her comrades, \"Target successfully rescued.\"","\"Retreat!\"","Xia Jinyuan didn’t plan to go head-to-head with Noah to the bitter end and immediately began to retreat. Only Noah continued to exchange fire with Cyril’s men, holding Cyril back so they could retreat more smoothly.","Trapped from above and below, Noah and his team were cornered with no way out.","Ye Jian was on the fifth floor while Xia Jinyuan and his team were on the sixth floor; it was time to regroup.","But this was not the right moment to do so. Cyril had no intention of letting anyone leave the hotel; he needed to capture Noah and his men before he could leave.","When would it be possible to capture Noah?","Naturally, it would be when Noah was out of ammunition and supplies.","They didn’t have to wait long, about fifteen minutes later, the gunfire in the stairwell began to subside until both sides finally ceased firing.","The gunshots in the stairwell stopped, but the hotel lobby and several other areas were still rife with continuous gunfire. Several undercover hotel staff members tried to break through but were suppressed by Cyril’s firepower each time.","At that moment, Noah realized that Alice Cheng was no longer by his side. Facing dozens of guns pointed at him and with a gunshot wound in his right leg, Noah covered his wound and spoke calmly, \"I need to see Cyril. I have very important information to tell him.\"","He needed to see Cyril now to tell him precisely who had interfered with his underground drug factory.","Alice had disappeared—it must have been those damned mercenaries who rescued her!","G3, who had not yet left, narrowed his gaze slightly and, in front of everyone, pulled open the fifth-floor fire door and stepped out into complete darkness. He blended in seamlessly, undetected by anyone, and they assumed he was going to inform Cyril.","G3, who walked out composedly, immediately reported in a low voice, \"Noah is very likely to tell Cyril about the operation we conducted a few days ago. None of these men can be allowed to stay.\"","\"Head to the room and regroup with Ye Jian,\" Xia Jinyuan said, unruffled. They were in the shadows, and there were many ways to deal with Noah. Noah thought he could calculate against them? Heh, let him taste the flavor of his own medicine.","On the fifth floor, there were already Cyril’s men. Ye Jian, Alice Cheng, and G3 were temporarily trapped, but their comrades on the sixth and fourth floors could move. Taking advantage of the power still being out, Xia Jinyuan, Z7, and White Crane quickly moved towards the lobby.","Meanwhile, V8 and K7 headed to the hotel’s central electrical control room to prevent the power from suddenly coming back on and exposing themselves.","In the lobby, Cyril sat waiting for his subordinates to bring the Caucasian he wanted to catch, ready to show these Caucasians his might."]},{"number":5404,"title":"Chapter 5404: Captured","paragraphs":["Cyril, sensing something might be amiss at the hotel, didn’t stand in the center of the lobby as he had before, treating the place as if he owned it. Instead, he sat on a sofa in the hotel’s resting area, the spacious and brightly-lit French windows behind him had been shattered earlier, and the cool night breeze poured in, fluttering the heavy curtains.","Seated on the sofa, Cyril was extremely vigilant, intentionally breaking the French windows so that if anything unusual happened, he could leave immediately without having to go around to the hotel’s main entrance.","The injured Noah was brought down from the fifth floor to the first, passing through the dark lobby and standing in front of Cyril.","He wanted to stand, but Cyril’s subordinates pressed him to kneel. Noah, wounded in the thigh by a bullet, resisted angrily; he was a soldier, and even now, as a captive, a soldier’s pride did not allow him to kneel to a notorious drug trafficker.","\"You should have told everyone in the hotel to stop struggling and obediently lay down their arms. Instead of standing in front of me while still trying to maintain your dignity in defiance,\" Cyril said, his voice chilling like a snake slithering through a drain, sending shivers down one’s spine, \"you’d better kneel before me to talk, and perhaps then you’ll have the chance to speak to me.\"","No sooner had he finished speaking than Noah’s agonized screams filled the entire hotel lobby as someone cruelly dug their fingers into his gunshot wound...","The pain swept over him, causing Noah to break out in a cold sweat as if doused with water.","He still chose not to kneel, instead collapsing to the ground in pain.","The gunfire in the hotel didn’t stop, and Noah, his body convulsing in agony, knew that they had exposed themselves for his sake and the sake of his soldiers. But even if he now ordered them to cease firing, Cyril would not let them go.","No, he could not let them all be exposed; they still needed to remain in the hotel to continue gathering intelligence useful to the country!","Ever since the terrorist attack that happened in September three years ago, their country had been striving to preemptively be aware and prevent such incidents. In a country like Molaban, treasured by terrorists, they must have an intelligence network.","The hotel was their intelligence network, and even if he died, it must not be exposed!","Curled up, Noah desperately clutched his bleeding thigh, pressing down his fear with all his perseverance, gasping for breath, and using all his strength to vocalize his pain, almost bellowing, \"Mr. Cyril, there is a great misunderstanding between us. I still don’t understand why Mr. Cyril would target me, unless someone said something to make you mistake me for someone else!\"","\"Misunderstanding? No, no, no, it’s not a misunderstanding. You are Caucasian, I know exactly what you want from me. So! There is no misunderstanding between us,\" Cyril retorted with a cold smirk.","Will, the \"someone\" Noah thought of must be Will; it had to be him saying something in front of Cyril that put him and his soldiers in danger.","Cyril spoke slowly with a sinister smile, \"It’s unfortunate for you, but I will not give you what you want, unless you can buy them all back. But then again, I don’t want to sell to you; you’ll have to take them from me by force.\"","\"It’s Will, isn’t it? I know, it must be Will.\" Noah scoffed coldly, \"He wanted to use Mr. Cyril to get rid of me, that must be his plan. Mr. Cyril, you’ve been deceived, he’s deceived you!\"","Will, that damned guy, made him trust him over four damned paintings!"]},{"number":5405,"title":"Chapter 5405: Hidden Pistol","paragraphs":["Cyril’s loud \"haha\" laughter followed, \"Of course I know what Mr. Will wants to do, but what does it matter. Between you and Mr. Will, Mr. Will is obviously more important. I helped him remove you, the guy who approached him right from the start; we are in a partnership, there’s no deception.\"","\"We...\"","Before he could finish, a dull sound came from the dark, and Cyril’s face changed drastically as he clutched his painfully wounded arm.","The bodyguards protecting Cyril also realized something had happened, shielded him even more tightly, and swiftly retreated outside.","Someone had fired a shot from the shadows, and Cyril was hit by a bullet!","The wounded Cyril, erupting with anger as he evacuated the hotel, roared, \"Kill him, kill all the Caucasians associated with him!\"","Noah had no chance or time to explain further; when he heard the pained noise from Cyril’s throat, he knew things had worsened significantly.","He resisted, reacting extremely quickly.","As a well-trained soldier, Noah constantly sought opportunities to escape. He had been curled up on the ground when Cyril retreated after being shot. In just those few seconds, he grabbed the pistol that was pressed against his forehead, shouted loudly, sprang up, and elbowed his attacker in the jaw. At the same time, he snatched the assailant’s submachine gun and swept it toward Cyril’s direction.","\"Kill them all, all of them!\" The furious shout seemed almost to burst from Cyril’s throat; he was not afraid to escalate the situation, now even contemplating blowing up the entire hotel.","With Cyril’s order, the hotel was nearly enveloped by gunfire, with bursts of shots and screams echoing incessantly.","The resisting Noah hid behind a sofa, continually firing. He did not know how long he could hold out, but he was certain he would not survive the night.","Someone shot at Cyril, but who?","Was it one of theirs?","Or someone else?","The sofa, peppered with bullets, broke open, revealing chunks of foam; with doubts and wounds, Noah rolled several times, took advantage of the darkness to leave the sofa, and headed toward the elevator.","He was very cautious, ensuring he could stay alive to report the situation in his hotel back to his country.","Meanwhile, amidst the chaos, Xia Jinyuan headed to the fifth floor. He aimed and shot based solely on sounds and intuition; he didn’t need to kill Cyril with one shot, it was enough to make Cyril believe the shooter was one of Noah’s people, someone from within the hotel.","Alice Cheng sat quietly on the bed, taking a rest. Ye Jian stayed in the fifth-floor room without leaving, occasionally glancing at the woman standing beside her. Alice pressed her lips tight, her eyes shadowed and unclear.","These Chinese... when did they arrive in Molaban? When did they enter the hotel? And how did they find her so quickly, taking the chance to \"rescue\" her during the firefight between Noah and Cyril?","Did they know her identity?","Did they know why she was in Molaban?","Sitting still, Alice’s mind was anything but quiet.","After a while, she suddenly spoke up, \"Is my husband still okay?\"","With so many doubts, Alice chose to start by asking about her husband, indirectly obtaining information that could benefit her.","With a G3 guarding the door, Ye Jian, watching Alice, calmly said, \"Sorry, we are not aware of your husband’s situation.\""]},{"number":5406,"title":"Chapter 5406: Ceasefire","paragraphs":["Ye Jian regarded Alice with caution. As a woman who infiltrated a scientist’s life as his wife and had a child with him, and could still report so calmly to her superiors about the scientist’s unusual behavior after having their child, such a woman must be enduring, calm, and strong-willed. Therefore, every question she asked was undoubtedly purposeful.","Asking how her own husband was doing... it sounded normal, but it wasn’t.","What she should be most concerned about at the moment was the child who had never been by her side. As for her husband, the scientist who was placed under house arrest by her country, she should be the clearest about whether he was doing well or not.","The clever Alice, having heard Ye Jian’s response, realized she couldn’t get any information from her, so she stopped asking and sat quietly on the bed, waiting for the Chinese side to act.","There had been no movement from Xia Jinyuan’s end, and Ye Jian slightly adjusted the volume of her earpiece, her lips pressing together faintly, her expression growing somewhat grave.","She had no idea how things were on his end or whether he had dealt with the problem of Noah.","The G3 standing behind the door had also been attentive to the noises outside. After waiting about ten minutes or so, he lightly opened the door to check, but the pitch-black corridor was devoid of even a ghostly shadow, no sign of Cyril’s men or the disguised hotel staff.","After closing the door, G3 walked over to Ye Jian and whispered, \"No one’s outside; they’ve all retreated.\"","They’ve all retreated?","Ye Jian raised her eyes, \"Is the crisis resolved?\"","\"Unclear, but their withdrawal is good news for us,\" G3’s tense expression eased a bit, \"We wait for news.\"","Now each on their own, all having separated, operatives four, five, and six each had their comrades. Apart from Xia Jinyuan, who had cut off communication, the other comrades would contact them if anything happened.","Z7’s voice came through, \"Don’t worry, brothers, there’s a major situation outside the hotel.\"","\"Spit it out quick,\" T6 said in a suppressed voice. \"There’s not a ghost in sight here, they’ve all cleared out.\"","After saying this, T6 turned back to look at the family of three standing inside the room, who had been curiously staring at him, and he sighed sadly, his voice even tighter, \"This room is occupied by a family of three, Chinese people, and now the three of them are still staring at me, I’m about to go weak at the knees.\"","...","Ye Jian held back her laughter; she was lucky to have encountered her country’s people.","\"They’ve even called the embassy; we should be able to leave tonight,\" T6 had just finished when the child, hugging their father’s neck, spoke up in a crisp voice, \"Daddy, is the uncle who’s protecting us going to leave soon?\"","\"The police are here, the military is here; Cyril must be pulling out,\" Z7 said in a low voice, keeping watch outside. \"Just wait a bit longer, King Q; White Crane is dealing with Noah. Once they take care of business, it won’t take us long to evacuate.\"","So it was dealing with Noah, Ye Jian let out a quiet breath, and T6, who was sweating bullets while staying with the family of three, silently wiped his forehead. They really were about to leave.","The child’s intuition could sometimes be terrifyingly sharp; T6 didn’t make a sound anymore.","Time passed extremely slowly, so slow it seemed to have stopped altogether, and the hotel, with its electrical systems sabotaged, remained pitch-dark. The only difference was that the Molaban police had finally arrived at the hotel entrance.","They really didn’t want to come, but when foreigners living in the hotel sought help from their respective country’s embassies, several embassies immediately called the presidential office and startled the president. The police had no choice but to intervene despite their reluctance.","Fortunately, Mr. President sent the military, and it was no longer the police facing Cyril."]},{"number":5407,"title":"Chapter 5407: Evacuation","paragraphs":["Cyril, who was injured in the arm and sitting in the car bandaging himself, received a phone call. After listening, his face twisted several times as he grinded his teeth, extremely reluctant to evacuate the hotel.","The army had arrived, and he did not want to make enemies with the military.","Cyril’s car was the first to leave the hotel, driving away right under the noses of the police and the army. His hundreds of armed subordinates also evacuated one after another.","Neither side fired easily, each gripping their guns tightly, ready to open fire immediately if the other showed any unusual signs.","The hotel was full of guests, and the military also did not want to engage Cyril in this kind of place, because President feared that the maniacal Cyril would have his subordinates slaughter the hotel guests, and then the incident would have escalated significantly.","As Cyril’s men evacuated the hotel, the police and army entered and quickly took control of the entire hotel, and the shadow of fear that had hung over the hotel for two full hours finally began to dissipate slowly.","Ye Jian, G3, and Alice left the room and met up with T6 and V8, while Z7 continued to keep a close watch outside; Xia Jinyuan and White Crane were blocking Noah, who was struggling to move with an injured leg.","With the dim green light of the floor sign lamps in the stairwell, Noah looked at the man standing in front of him, his face slowly losing its shock, \"You, you must not be mercenaries.\"","The tone was very certain.","Xia Jinyuan smiled, \"No, of course we are mercenaries. Mr. Will needed our help, and for the sake of money, we were very willing to help him.\"","\"We are mercenaries, but obviously Mr. Noah is not Mr. Will’s bodyguard.\"","He was like a cat leisurely toying with a mouse trapped in a corner.","Noah sneered. They might not admit it, but he knew these guys were definitely not mercenaries, \"Was it you who rescued Alice?\"","\"Mr. Will asked us to come here specifically to rescue Alice, and now that we have rescued her, it’s not surprising.\" Xia Jinyuan’s fingers slowly squeezed the pistol trigger, \"You are the person Mr. Will needs dealt with, and we follow Mr. Will’s orders.\"","Noah’s hands trembling lightly on the stair railing, this time, he genuinely heard the call of the God of Death, \"Before you kill me, please tell me, are you Chinese soldiers?\"","He wanted to know if he had been doomed from the start, beaten by the Chinese army, which he had always looked down upon.","\"We are mercenaries.\" With a small smile at the corner of his mouth and a cold look in his eyes, Xia Jinyuan pulled the trigger. The gunshots echoed in the narrow stairwell, not loud enough to be heard through a wall.","Sliding down the handrail and tumbling down the stairs, Noah fell in the corner, dying without ever getting an answer.","White Crane confirmed Noah’s death, and came up the stairs smiling, \"We should also retreat.\"","Turning on the closed radios, Xia Jinyuan’s low voice transmitted into the ears of all his comrades, Z7 retreated from the lobby. Ye Jian, who had already met up with T6 and V8, murmured an \"Mm,\" her voice pleasantly filled with laughter.","They could now leave Molaban.","The staff of the Chinese Embassy arrived at the hotel as quickly as possible, with the first room they visited being the one T6 had stayed in; they spoke with a family of three, and Alice saw her child in a hotel room, literally separated by just one wall.","At two in the morning, the Chinese Embassy arranged for vehicles to take all the Chinese guests staying at the hotel to another hotel, where Alice and her two children were handed over to the Chinese Embassy."]},{"number":5408,"title":"Chapter 5408: Gathering Together","paragraphs":["The Chinese Embassy’s action was very efficient; the entire process from driving over to boarding the vehicle took only about ten minutes. Inside a T6 room, a family of three, except for the clueless child, the two adults went from nervousness to seriousness, and finally felt a heavy sense of responsibility. They were just shy of swearing an oath to the heavens that they would never speak of tonight’s events.","When boarding the vehicle, the couple still wore serious expressions, fearing that the embassy staff might not consider them reliable and trustworthy.","Although they were ordinary citizens, they were absolutely patriotic and loyal. How could they possibly do anything to harm their country! Absolutely not! They might lack other awareness, but this they surely possessed!","With embassy staff involved, Xia Jinyuan no longer needed to appear personally. He handed the child rescued from next door to Alice, and in response to her apology, Xia Jinyuan calmly stated, \"Miss Alice, the person you need to thank the most is your husband. It was he who protected you and your child.\"","\"Once you are in our homeland, we hope you can forget your previous identity, and our country will also protect you and your child well, ensuring that separation between mother and child, or even eternal parting, doesn’t happen again.\"","The scientist had not yet been rescued, and the Chinese side would absolutely not give up on the rescue mission. Believing that the scientist, who was anxiously concerned for his wife and child now back in the homeland, would hear this news and be overjoyed, further reinforcing his determination to return to his homeland.","Alice embraced her child, whom she hadn’t seen for nearly twenty days, kissing the child’s considerably thinner cheeks repeatedly. Seeing her child’s anxious and scared eyes, Alice, who was also of Chinese descent, closed her eyes, and tears slowly streamed down her face.","She didn’t respond to Xia Jinyuan, only deeply bowed and said \"Thank you\" once more.","Sometimes, it wasn’t that she didn’t want to choose, but rather... she had no choice at all.","Without choice, she had only one path to follow, even if it meant eternal separation from her husband.","Ye Jian glanced at her, a trace of pity flashing through her eyes. Originally placed beside the scientist as a spy, what happened instead was marriage and a child, and nearly ten years of marital affection turned the pretend into reality.","She sighed very softly, feeling somewhat emotional about the challenges Alice would have to face next. Once her husband returned to the homeland, how would she face the husband she had personally doomed to an almost certain dead end?","If forgiveness were possible, it might well be a good ending, but the trust between husband and wife was likely to be somewhat fractured. Even these challenges might have a turnaround, where one could openly face them and accept again.","The biggest challenge was Alice’s identity, and it was unclear what arrangements would be made for her upon returning to the Chinese side.","How to arrange, how to manage her, was not something that Special Forces involved in the rescue could participate in; their mission was solely to successfully rescue Alice back to her country.","From the planning stages to the actual execution of the rescue, several months had passed. The entire plan was cautiously and carefully thought through until the higher-ups believed the time was ripe to carry out the final step of the rescue plan, which at last was successful.","Mr. Will, who had spent a sleepless night waiting for news, learned by the next morning that Alice was about to leave Molaban, as she had personally contacted him.","Mr. Will dialed Xia Jinyuan’s phone again, but the call was disconnected, and though puzzled, he also secretly breathed a sigh of relief.","Mercenaries—if it weren’t for the need to rescue his good friend, he would never have contacted them or dealt with them. Now that they had rescued the people and taken the money to discreetly leave, it was not bad at all."]},{"number":5409,"title":"Chapter 5409: Getting Along","paragraphs":["And Cyril was targeted by Noah’s backing country, listed as a must-solve terrorist on their list.","As the Chinese plane ascended and finally disappeared beyond the clouds, Ye Jian dropped the hand she’d held to her forehead and smiled at the man next to her, \"Captain Xia, are we going to be separated again?\"","His mission was done, and so was hers, and it was time for them to part ways again.","Xia Jinyuan smiled at his girlfriend who liked stating the obvious, \"Not just yet, we need to return to Lyabi first and then head back to our country together. It’ll be time to part ways after we return home.\"","By her calculations, they had at most one more week together.","The comrades standing nearby all pressed their lips together, struggling to keep from laughing aloud.","To Azure Bird, separation was just another familiar face. On the other hand, their King Q had a hint of bitterness in his laughs, tsk tsk tsk, the look of a man bemoaning his fate.","Z7, with twinkling eyes, spoke with a grin, \"Azure Bird, you don’t really plan to stay with the airborne soldiers, do you? Actually, the airborne troops are pretty good, I’ve heard they have especially nice meals. If you really want to stay, just say the word, and they’ll definitely agree!\"","The words were obviously meant to cause mischief, absolutely deliberate in intent.","Xia Jinyuan gave him a glance, a look so cold it was like a sharp knife thrusting straight into Z7’s brow. Z7 wasn’t scared in the least, brazenly continuing his mischief, \"With your abilities, you’d totally rise to the top if you joined the airborne forces!\"","Such fearless behavior led the other comrades to silently light a candle for Z7 in their minds, thinking, Just wait, young man, you’ll get what’s coming for you once we’re back.","Silent prayers were offered up, but no one stepped forward to stop him; everyone sat back with arms crossed, thoroughly enjoying the show.","Ye Jian knew all too well that Z7 was intentionally provoking her man. Only after he finished did she speak up slowly, \"Are you saying you don’t welcome me back to the squad? Do you have a problem with me?\"","Her words were so sharp they made Z7’s face instantly stiffen, as more than just Xia Jinyuan’s gaze pierced him; now it was several icy stares that bore into him.","Z7, who had been awaiting Xia Jinyuan’s embarrassment, was nearly moved to tears, \"Absolutely not! Absolutely not! I swear to heaven, I have absolutely no objections, and I absolutely look forward to your return day and night!\"","He was untouchable, untouchable. From now on, he would rather provoke Xia Jinyuan than ever mess with Ye Jian again.","Such a terrifying person, a single sentence could put him at odds with all his comrades, frightening the stout man nearly to tears.","Watching Z7 swear upon the heavens, Ye Jian felt overjoyed inside and threw Xia Jinyuan several meaningful glances, her expression radiating immense pride.","See, as your girlfriend, I’ve got your back, always ready to protect you and prevent any injustice against you!","To this, Xia Jinyuan expressed extreme, extreme satisfaction.","\"The feeling of being protected by a girlfriend is really nice,\" he said with a sigh, his demeanor as smug as could be.","The second before, his comrades were slicing Z7 with their glares, but in the next second, they quickly shifted their icy stares to \"slice\" towards their captain, who was once again showing off his affection in front of them.","\"I am a man with a wife.\"","\"Ha, I am a man with both a wife and children.\"","The former was T6, the latter was G3.","V8 glanced at K7, needing an ally badly at this very moment!","Because! He didn’t have a girlfriend!","So annoying!","K7 gave him a look, turning his head away with an indifferent expression. Just when V8 thought he was going to stay out of the conversation as usual, K7 suddenly spoke, \"The person I like likes me back.\""]},{"number":5410,"title":"Chapter 5410: Return","paragraphs":["Everyone was shocked—K7 had changed! He had truly changed!","It wasn’t just anger; it was like coughing up blood! V8 clutched his repeatedly stabbed heart and accused bitterly, \"You’re all heartless, picking on us for not having girlfriends!\"","\"Hey, don’t count me in. You were still playing in the mud when I had a girlfriend,\" Z7 raised an eyebrow. Before he enlisted, he was the playboy of the capital city—he had girlfriends!","It’s just that he had broken up with them all!","The girlfriend-less White Crane snorted coldly, coldly declaring, \"I’m going on leave as soon as I get back to the country, and during the holiday, I’ll settle this personal matter.\"","\"I want to take a leave, too!\" V8 cried out in anguish!","Ye Jian glanced at V8 and then at White Crane, tall and jade-like, with handsome and gentle features. She gave her own fair opinion, \"I think that White Crane could find a girlfriend without even stepping foot outside his house.\" That is, if he genuinely wanted to find one.","The continuously wounded V8 didn’t want to talk anymore. Saying he wasn’t as handsome as White Crane... just say it straight, no need to beat around the bush.","Azure Bird, you’ve become bad!","After being with King Q for so long, you’ve turned bad!","Hurt, V8 decided not to talk to these unfriendly comrades anymore. He would heal his wounds in solitude.","After a round of banter, the group of eight left the airport and headed back to the vehicles arranged for them at the embassy.","It was time for them to return to Lyabi.","Lyabi was just as it was before they left, with incessant firefights breaking out in various cities and no signs of a ceasefire. The illegal militants and the Pakistan army continued to clash, and the rebels aimed to seize power to establish a new government. The three-party struggle was unyielding, causing untold suffering to the people and leaving little hope.","Once again stepping onto this land riddled with scars, the expressions on the faces of Ye Jian’s group of eight turned solemn, the lightness they had felt after finishing their mission was no more.","This was a land soaked in blood and tears, where too much sorrow played out every day—separation of life and death, shattered families, displacement, and helplessness... All could be seen in a single day.","The only good news was that the rebels who had been mixed in with the capital city had withdrawn three days prior. Now, only the militants and the Pakistan army confronted each other within the city.","Inside the vehicle, Ye Jian looked out at the moving Pakistan army soldiers, and her furrowed brows finally relaxed slightly. At least the rebels had left, which meant that these government soldiers could concentrate on fighting the illegal militants.","The ride was bumpy, and although they occasionally heard sporadic gunfire, the journey was relatively smooth. They arrived back at the peacekeeping camp around four in the afternoon.","At the camp gate, a woman stood at the checkpoint, speaking animatedly with the stationed peacekeeping soldiers about something. Judging from her silhouette, she was a female, and looking at her equipment, she was a female war correspondent.","The peacekeeping soldiers saw the vehicles stop ahead, and several Chinese peacekeeping soldiers wearing blue helmets got out. He signaled the reporter to step aside, \"Comrade, please step aside. We must verify your identity before you can enter; this is our military camp’s regulation. Please understand, thank you.\"","After speaking, he stepped aside, not allowing the female war correspondent to stand in front of him anymore.","White Crane and G3 were about to reach the camp entrance when they stopped abruptly, both fixing their gaze ahead. G3 said in a low voice, \"Why is it a Wanhai reporter? How did she end up over here?\"","The female war correspondent standing outside, feeling slighted and agitated, was none other than Chen Shuzhen—Reporter Chen from Wanhai—who had been rescued by our forces before."]},{"number":5411,"title":"Chapter 5411: Setbacks","paragraphs":["\"Azure Bird...\" White Crane called out to Ye Jian, who was walking ahead. The three of them whispered for a moment, and Ye Jian glanced subtly at the expressive reporter from Wanhai and nodded slightly, \"Alright, I understand. You guys go back to the car. I’ll go alone.\"","G3 and White Crane, who had previously dealt with Reporter Chen, were worried that she might recognize their voices as their own.","Sitting inside the car, Xia Jinyuan saw G3 and White Crane return and let Ye Jian go alone to verify the identity. He asked, \"What happened? Did you encounter something?\"","The vehicle they were driving was not from the camp, so it could not approach the camp. It had to be parked within a safe area from the crossfire, and only after the identity verification was complete could they drive into the camp.","G3 said, \"The reporter from Wanhai is here again.\"","Upon hearing this, Xia Jinyuan’s lips tightened, and T6 let out a cold laugh, \"A weasel paying a New Year visit to a chicken—never with good intentions. We rescued her, and look at her now, she’s thinking of framing us!\"","Everyone, including Xia Jinyuan, had a very poor impression of Reporter Chen.","\"Just don’t give her the opportunity,\" Xia Jinyuan said indifferently. \"Her identity is sensitive. If you encounter her, just avoid her.\"","\"I truly don’t want to run into her,\" said T6, his eyes filled with coldness. \"She’s hellbent on causing trouble for our military. She goes to Wanhai and extensively reports to tarnish the image of our peacekeeping soldiers, with such a malicious mind!\"","T6 spoke the truth, without a hint of exaggeration. Chen Shuzhen always asked other countries’ peacekeeping soldiers what they thought of the Chinese peacekeepers, even misleading the peacekeepers she interviewed to achieve her agenda.","Yet, she had never succeeded.","\"We have no faults for her to capture; no matter how much she tries, she won’t find any news that could damage the image of our military,\" G3 patted T6’s shoulder, saying with a smile, \"Don’t take it to heart. She’s a rare case, most of the people from Wanhai are very friendly.\"","The cold expression on T6’s face finally eased a lot.","Ahead, Reporter Chen had come to the Chinese peacekeeping camp countless times, but each time she was stopped and never succeeded in entering the camp.","This time, she brought more documents than usual, including a pass that allowed entry into the camp.","Reporter Chen, who was stopped at the gate every time, somehow managed to get a pass for the Chinese peacekeeping camp that allowed her to enter and exit normally as a reporter. Even after the peacekeeping soldiers had checked, they did not immediately let her in; only after re-verification was she allowed to enter.","Reporter Chen was upset.","She was a reporter and had a pass. Why wouldn’t they allow her in?","Was it because she was a reporter from Wanhai, and therefore the Chinese peacekeepers were neglecting her?","This thought made Reporter Chen’s emotions flare dramatically.","Ye Jian approached, handed all her documents to the soldiers for verification, and asked the nearby Reporter Chen, who picked up her camera wanting to take pictures. A peacekeeping soldier, who had been keeping an eye on her, swiftly stepped forward and blocked her lens, \"Comrade, photographing is prohibited in our military camp, and all war correspondents are forbidden from taking pictures of our peacekeeping soldiers.\"","Unable to take pictures and barred from entering, Chen Shuzhen was so angry she was shaking all over. \"I am a war correspondent! You have no right to stop me from taking photos!\"","\"Comrade, our military is not stopping you from taking photos, but the area you are currently in is temporarily managed by our military, and we have the right to stop you,\" the peacekeeping soldier replied firmly, giving no ground. Chen Shuzhen’s press credentials had no effect whatsoever.","Ye Jian did not go back to the car. Instead, she stood at the gate, waiting for Xia Jinyuan to drive the vehicle into the camp.","As the vehicle passed through, Ye Jian was just about to step into the camp when Reporter Chen called out to her."]},{"number":5412,"title":"Chapter 5412: Targeting","paragraphs":["Ye Jian really wanted to pretend she hadn’t heard, but out of politeness, she still stopped and gestured for the car to wait for her nearby—the car couldn’t drive off, as that would take away her excuse to leave immediately.","The sentinel was still verifying Chen Shuzhen’s credentials, and when he saw her calling the peacekeeping female soldier who had just shown him her ID, the sentinel stepped closer and quietly reminded Ye Jian.","Seeing this, Chen Shuzhen’s face grew even more angry, thinking that the sentinel was deliberately making things difficult for her, but she was powerless and could only stand there fuming alone until Ye Jian took the initiative to come over, which slightly improved her expression.","As Ye Jian approached, she saluted Chen and spoke first, \"Sorry, we cannot accept individual interviews from journalists. Please wait here for a moment, once we confirm everything is in order, we will let you through.\"","After speaking, she saluted again, briskly, not even giving Chen Shuzhen a chance to respond, and turned to leave.","\"Hey... you...\"","Chen Shuzhen, who thought she was finally going to interview the Chinese peacekeepers, was stunned, uttering a few bewildered sounds and helplessly watching the peacekeeping female soldier walk away.","She thought that once she obtained a pass, the Chinese peacekeepers would surely treat her with utmost respect, no longer shutting her out like before and taking her pride seriously.","Contrary to her expectations, even with a pass, she was still treated the same way as before: rejected and disregarded, and not treated politely just because she was a Wanhai reporter.","Feeling slighted by the sentinel and treated lightly by the peacekeeping female soldier, Chen Shuzhen was so angry that her hands trembled as she held her camera.","\"Priding yourselves as a nation of etiquette, is this your way of treating guests?\"","As Ye Jian walked away, she heard Reporter Chen Shuzhen’s question from behind and furrowed her brow slightly, understanding somewhat why G3 and White Crane disliked Reporter Chen Shuzhen.","The sentinel strictly enforced the regulations, what did that have to do with the way of treating guests?","Why did that sound so strange?","Why did it sound strange?, Ye Jian quickly figured out while getting in the car, \"A sense of superiority is at play, thinking she’s from Wanhai, we should treat her as a special guest, coddling and adoring her to make her happy and satisfy her sense of superiority in front of us.\"","T6 instantly clarified this for Ye Jian. No wonder she thought her words sounded strange—it really was so!","\"Does she have a problem here?\" Ye Jian tapped her own head, \"Coming in front of Chinese soldiers looking for a sense of superiority, she really has guts.\"","\"People with a disorder in their brain are too foolish, naturally they are bold,\" Z7 sneered lightly, then asked what Chen Shuzhen wanted now that she had come over.","\"She managed to get a pass, the sentinel is still verifying its authenticity, once it’s confirmed to be no issue, you’ll see her around the camp soon,\" said Ye Jian.","V8 sighed deeply, \"It will be a sad story, thinking she could expose a dark side of our army’s peacekeeping soldiers, but in the end, she came boldly and will leave disappointed.\"","At that, everyone in the car laughed softly.","Ye Jian then learned that this reporter from Wanhai, besides covering the situation in Libya, had also taken it upon herself to expose the faults of our country’s peacekeeping soldiers, always following and photographing them, trying to capture their faults.","In addition, she was also adept at researching, when our peacekeeping soldiers patrolled with soldiers from other countries, she would immediately go to interview those soldiers, trying to dig up scandals to sensationalize in her reports in Wanhai, in order to malign our country’s soldiers."]},{"number":5413,"title":"Chapter 5413: Angry","paragraphs":["However, Chen Shuzhen could never have imagined that despite her diligent efforts, she had not unearthed a single piece of incriminating evidence about our army; discontented, she tried every possible way to enter the Chinese peacekeeping camp to look for scandal.","She couldn’t believe that being in such close contact, she couldn’t find any dirt on the Chinese soldiers!","In this regard, Ye Jian stated that even if she entered the Chinese peacekeeping camp and monitored it day and night without rest, she wouldn’t find a single bit of disgrace on the strictly disciplined peacekeeping force.","\"Later, go remind the peacekeeping female soldiers to be careful,\" Xia Jinyuan, who had been sitting in the passenger seat, turned his head and instructed Ye Jian, \"She has a certain reputation in Wanhai, and whenever she reports on something, it sparks a frenzy in Wanhai. Since she has come with a purpose, she will not easily give up, prudence is paramount.\"","With a solemn expression, Ye Jian nodded, \"Okay, I’ll go and remind the female soldiers right away!\"","The sentinel had already verified that Reporter Chen’s pass had no issues and immediately allowed her entry.","Just when Reporter Chen’s mood had slightly improved upon entering the camp, it soured again when the two accompanying peacekeeping female soldiers prevented her from taking photos with a stern and forceful expression.","\"Reporter Chen, the Chinese peacekeeping camp is a military zone, and no one is allowed to take pictures at will. We have designated areas for photography; please come with me.\"","The female soldiers who received Reporter Chen were none other than Qiu Tong and Gao Xiao. The pair, one dynamic and one static, one stern and one friendly, worked in perfect harmony and were highly regarded by the colonels in charge of the camp.","Upon learning that a Wanhai reporter had entered the camp with a pass, the colonels were crystal clear about her intentions and immediately arranged for these two women to meet her.","At that moment, Reporter Chen faced Gao Xiao and Qiu Tong, scowling from start to finish, without even a chance to sneak a photo.","Ye Jian had already met with the female soldiers. Having not seen them for over ten days, they were all grinning ear to ear when they saw Ye Jian, chattering nonstop around her.","They spoke about how a mortar had landed less than two hundred meters away at the southwest corner of the camp, with bomb shards blasting into the camp, putting the entire camp on high alert, ready to open fire at any moment.","They mentioned a group of rebels disguised as the Pakistan army who attempted to drive into the camp to create chaos but were discovered by the sentinel, and the peacekeeping soldiers assembled in thirty seconds, prepared for a full defense.","\"Just the day before yesterday, an engineer squad entered a village to repair and level a blown-up road, ensuring that the villagers cut off from water and food could travel, and children could go to school normally. However, they were surrounded by armed militants, and the situation was extremely tense with some villagers already killed by the militants. The leader of the engineer squad stepped forward to negotiate, and after a fourteen-hour standoff, the militants finally withdrew.\"","\"Yesterday, they came back, and one male soldier said that they were all prepared for the worst,\" said the female soldiers in low voices. In just less than half a month, they had witnessed the most brutal side of war, facing a harsh environment and cruel warfare, their growth was remarkably rapid, their expressions much more resolute than half a month ago.","Peacekeeping Female Soldier Ding Yue’e patted her over twenty kilograms of bulletproof gear and smiled at Ye Jian, \"At first, I wasn’t used to wearing it at all, but now I’ve gotten so used to it that I don’t even feel its weight.\"","\"It’s a lifesaver in critical moments; you must get used to it,\" Ye Jian said and then, as if struck by a thought, her eyes darkened slightly, \"Does this mean you’ve joined the patrol team?\""]},{"number":5414,"title":"Chapter 5414: Hard Effort","paragraphs":["Female soldiers come as logistical support, and they will have bulletproof gear, but since their range of activities is within the camp, they will not be fully armed unless they go out on patrol.","Ye Jian truly hoped the female soldiers could join the patrol team, as it would be a rare opportunity for their growth, but considering safety issues, she did not actively suggest it.","She was reluctant to see them getting into trouble in this dangerous land. While she could accept injuries, the thought of sacrifice was too heavy for her to face.","Squad leader Yang Zhen replied to Ye Jian with a smile, \"Yes, we’ve joined the patrol team. The colonels only agreed after we passed a comprehensive test. Instructor, don’t worry, we will take good care of ourselves!\"","She saw the worry in Ye Jian’s eyes and comforted her at the first opportunity.","\"Your decision is good, but you must remember, when facing any danger, the first thing on your mind should never be sacrifice, but to protect your own and your comrades’ safety. The country trains you not to sacrifice at the drop of a hat. Remember, you have a long, long way ahead of you, and you must walk it well.\"","Once upon a time, Grandpa Gen and Principal Chen told Ye Jian the same, and Xia Jinyuan had said similar words. Now, Ye Jian was passing these words on to the female soldiers, thus continuing a legacy from one generation to the next.","The female soldiers deeply understood Ye Jian’s intentions, taking her advice to their ears and to their hearts.","\"Does the country know that you’ve joined the patrol team? Did they put forward any opinions?\" Ye Jian asked. Battalion Commander Tian was very protective; without his approval, it would probably be a headache for the higher-ups.","Yang Zhen said, \"Yes, the battalion commander agreed, and even stated that he supports our decision.\"","Why did Battalion Commander Tian agree to let them join the patrol team? As the battalion commander, he had multiple considerations.","Actually, the female soldiers’ main duties were logistics, which minimized the risks, while also allowing them to experience the cruelty of the battlefield for the first time. However, experiencing the cruelty of the battlefield from afar was different from directly confronting it, which could lead to rapid growth in the female soldiers.","Because the female soldiers are not just soldiers, they are also our country’s first female special combat team! They must directly confront the brutalities of the battlefield and become more composed, calm, and understanding of the significance of their regular training.","Why did the higher-ups agree as well?","The reason is simple. What Battalion Commander Tian could consider, they could too. In fact, they had been waiting for the female soldiers to volunteer to join the patrol team on their own initiative.","Therefore, when Yang Zhen made the request, the colonels did not refuse, but instead put the female soldiers through a comprehensive test. Once they passed, he reported it to the higher-ups, and the country agreed to let the female soldiers join the patrol mission.","Initially the main force of logistics, the female soldiers could now participate in patrols and face possible combat situations. There could be no better live-fire training for them than this mission.","Having combat experience in Lyabi would greatly help the female soldiers, and even the entire female special forces team’s future development.","The female soldiers were actually very clear about why the country agreed. After communicating with Battalion Commander Tian over the phone, they could better understand his well-meant intentions.","When it was necessary to select female soldiers to go to Libya for peacekeeping, it was Battalion Commander Tian who actively contended and guaranteed that the female soldiers would be up to the task.","Battalion Commander Tian hoped that the female soldiers would achieve great results, allowing the higher-ups to see the growth of the female soldiers and to confidently entrust future missions to them.","Having been established for so long, the female soldiers had to make some significant accomplishments."]},{"number":5415,"title":"Chapter 5415: Pressure","paragraphs":["Ye Jian and the female soldiers were chatting, while Xia Jinyuan was talking to a Peacekeeping Special Police Captain.","Recently, an outbreak had occurred in the refugee camp, and although it was effectively controlled, many follow-up tasks had to be completed, such as gathering and destroying clothes and items worn by infected patients.","Due to limitations, the chosen method of disposal was incineration.","The destruction was carried out by the special police, and Xia Jinyuan happened to arrive just as the Peacekeeping Special Police Captain and a few special police officers were starting the fire for the destruction. Seeing Xia Jinyuan approach, the captain initially paused, then quickly came over.","\"Gone for over ten days, where did you go?\" the Special Police Captain asked as he patted Xia Jinyuan’s shoulder vigorously, his eyes filled with joy, \"How’s it going? Everything smooth?\"","Everyone in the same Peacekeeping Camp knew each other, and they all got along well.","The Special Police Captain’s background was not simple: he came from a city in the northern border area of our country and was a member of the Northern Counterterrorism Special Police. Several years ago, Ye Jian and Weaver had just stepped off a plane when they were kidnapped by an East Turkistan extremist disguised as a taxi driver. Xia Jinyuan took part in the rescue, collaborating with the Northern Counterterrorism Special Police. However, back then the collaboration was with the sixth secret service squadron, while this captain was from the fourth squadron.","A captain who frequently performed counter-terrorism missions on the front lines knew very well that Xia Jinyuan’s sudden disappearance with his soldiers for a few days was definitely for some major operation. Now seeing Xia Jinyuan return safe and sound filled him with genuine happiness.","\"Not bad, it went smoothly. Here I am, visiting you right after,\" Xia Jinyuan extended his fist, and the two men greeted each other by bumping fists, \"The colonel mentioned you’ve been a bit down these past few days. What’s up, family issues?\"","Upon hearing this, the Special Police Captain’s smile lessened slightly, and it took him a while to respond, \"Issues within the squad.\"","Issues within the squad ... Xia Jinyuan’s expression darkened.","They came from the country’s northernmost border, looking for extremists and terrorists who damaged the border, all of whom were armed. When he mentioned issues within the squad... it was mostly related to these individuals.","Seeing the Special Police Captain’s face covered in sadness and enveloped in grief, Xia Jinyuan felt a sinking feeling in his chest.","A mishap equated to... sacrifice.","\"Two comrades died, the incident happened a few days ago, and I only received the news the day before yesterday,\" the Special Police Captain did not hide the truth and found a place to sit down, his head bowed and hands buried in his hair, tears welling in the eyes of the iron-willed officer.","\"Before we left, we had made plans that once I returned to the country, they would pick me up at the airport. They also said that I must keep on living because they were waiting for me to return and fight alongside them once again.\"","\"Now, here I am on an international peacekeeping mission alive, but my comrades back home are... are...\"","He couldn’t continue anymore, his voice so suppressed that it seemed locked in his throat, unable to utter another word.","He was still alive, but they had sacrificed themselves.","Xia Jinyuan fell silent.","At this moment, he could most profoundly understand the Special Police Captain’s feelings for he too had once experienced the death of comrades, the agonizing pain that could shatter what he thought was an indomitable spiritual world.","\"They were both very young, one was 29, the other 31. The younger one wasn’t married, the married one had just had a child at the beginning of the year. He was so busy that he wasn’t there for the birth, only managing to visit once when the child was four months old. And it was... it was only that once, just that once.\"","The Special Police Captain was almost pulling all his hair out, \"The child was born in January, it’s ten months old now, and he... he... he only saw him that one time.\""]},{"number":5416,"title":"Chapter 5416: Man’s Tears (Previous - was mixed up, refresh and check)","paragraphs":["As he spoke, the Special Police Captain couldn’t continue again, resting one hand on his forehead and reaching into his pocket with the other. He pulled out a pack of soft cigarettes that cost no more than five yuan domestically. His hand trembled slightly as he took out a cigarette and reached for his lighter; the lighter dropped to the ground with a \"clatter.\"","Xia Jinyuan, silent, bent down to pick up the lighter. With a slip of his thumb, a flame shot out of the lighter. The captain, with shaking hands, took out a cigarette and lit it with the flame Xia Jinyuan had sparked.","He took several harsh drags, smoking two-thirds of it in one go.","Many of the special police in the north are heavy smokers. The captain of the sixth secret service squadron, who had fought alongside them before, also smoked—a cigarette sometimes truly soothes the pressure.","The captain nearly finished half the cigarette, his gaze vacant as he looked into the distance, \"From the time my child was born to ten months old, my brother only saw him once, just once...\"","\"My child doesn’t recognize his own father, doesn’t even know what he does or what he looks like. In my child’s world, there is no father. What my brother most often said was that he felt most guilty towards his own wife and son.\"","The cigarette was now finished. The captain’s emotions visibly eased a bit, and Xia Jinyuan finally spoke softly, \"The family and the nation, both difficult to protect. It has always been a tough challenge. We all are prepared to make sacrifices, but it’s agonizing when a comrade actually does.\"","\"But, some tasks must be accomplished by someone. In the process of accomplishing them, someone may fall and never manage to rise again to complete them. Those of us who survive can’t linger; we must continue to complete what hasn’t been finished, even if one day we too perish...\"","\"I have faced sacrifice, seen my comrades die in my arms, and those days were nothing but endurance. I had to endure, I had to hold on, I had to live properly for my deceased brothers, continue to fulfill our unfinished cause, carry on their responsibilities and feel as though my departed brothers never left, always by my side.\"","\"Lao Zhao, you now must endure and get through this. If a brother has fallen, you must finish the path he couldn’t. Let his sacrifice not be in vain, let it not be meaningless.\"","\"He’s gone, but he lives on in each of our hearts. As long as you remember him and continue with the cause he left unfinished, you can get through this.\"","Xia Jinyuan’s words resonated deeply with the captain, reaching into his very soul, prompting him to repeatedly wipe the corners of his eyes, drying tears that had yet to fall.","\"You’re right, I mustn’t let the sacrifices of my two brothers be in vain. I must continue on the path they couldn’t finish.\"","\"These past few days I’ve been feeling terrible, so suffocated that even I can tell something’s off. I’ve been longing to return home to track down the ones who killed my two brothers, but with everyone back home and me unable to return, I’m helplessly frustrated to the point I can’t even sleep.\"","\"Every year in our fourth secret service squadron, we make sacrifices. From when I enlisted at eighteen until now at thirty-one, I’ve had to bid farewell to my comrades each year, every year without fail...\"","Every year brings a new ordeal, constantly facing sacrifice, yet the veteran special police never falter, using their lives to protect their comrades.","Blood is shed, lives are given, but they never regret, and they still push forward without hesitation."]},{"number":5417,"title":"Chapter 5417: Narrow-Minded","paragraphs":["The Special Police Captain, who had many thoughts bottled up, found himself in the presence of Xia Jinyuan, someone who spoke his language, and unconsciously revealed his thoughts. The two, situated in a foreign land, sat and talked in the peacekeeping camp until the large fire burning the clothes died out before they eventually dropped the subject.","Feeling relieved, the Special Police Captain stood up and said to Xia Jinyuan, \"Good brother, thank you for today, for especially taking the time to keep me company. When I return to our country...\"","Suddenly, he stopped speaking and showed a bitter smile, \"I hardly dare make any more promises. Next time we patrol together, let’s just as before collaborate well and strive together.\"","Xia Jinyuan felt that they wouldn’t have a chance to patrol together anymore and decided to inform the Special Police Captain in advance, \"Brother, I’m afraid I’ll be returning to our country soon. I’ll wait for you there.\"","\"Returning to our country? Is it time already?\"","Peacekeeping soldiers have a standard time period for their missions, generally a year, yet Xia Jinyuan and his team hadn’t even reached half a year.","\"Yes, our time is short, and it’s very likely that we’ll be returning soon. I wanted to tell you in advance. If one day I suddenly leave, it will definitely be to return home.\"","\"Alright, we’ll meet back home.\"","Just as the Special Police Captain finished speaking, he suddenly noticed a flash of light from the corner of his eye, similar to the flash of a camera.","Xia Jinyuan immediately lowered his blue helmet and said gravely, \"Wanhai reporter, I’ll go ahead. You go check her camera.\" As soon as he finished speaking, he heard a female soldier’s voice, extremely cold, saying, \"Reporter Chen, please hand over the camera to me, thank you!\"","That was Gao Xiao’s voice.","The Special Police Captain, hearing this, knew something was up. He was aware that Xia Jinyuan had participated in rescuing Wanhai reporters and also knew that Xia Jinyuan did not want the other party to know, whispered, \"All right, you go first; I’ll handle this.\"","With the Special Police Captain stepping in, Xia Jinyuan was naturally reassured to leave, no longer paying any attention to Reporter Chen, who was anything but well-behaved upon entering the Peacekeeping Camp.","Reporter Chen didn’t think there was anything wrong with her taking photographs and refused to hand over her camera for inspection. The end result, as one might expect, was that her camera was forcibly taken and all the photographic film within the camp was destroyed.","It’s worth mentioning that Gao Xiao was very astute; after entering the camp, she had asked Reporter Chen to take out the original film in her camera and replace it with a new one, in anticipation of Reporter Chen’s misbehavior and possible aim to cause trouble in the Chinese peacekeeping camp.","\"I knew she wasn’t honest right from the start. When she saw me and Qiu Tong — oh my, those eyes, those nostrils all turned up, acting like a princess, expecting me and Qiu Tong to treat her delicately, like an honored guest.\"","\"At that moment, I was on guard. When inspecting her camera, I directly took out the old film and asked her to put in a new one. Her face then — ha, ha, ha, it turned green instantly.\"","Back in the tent, Gao Xiao sat beside Ye Jian, recounting her battle of wits with Reporter Chen, \"At the time, Qiu Tong didn’t understand why I insisted she switch to a new film. Ha, ha, ha, why, you ask? It’s because I was guarding against her potentially taking prohibited photos that I would need to destroy, and then she could refuse by citing that there were important photos she had taken previously in there, making us passive, right?\"","\"The instructors once taught us that we must always take the initiative, preemptively nip any possible issues in the bud. Ha, ha, ha, ha, now when I think about the expression on Reporter Chen’s face, I can laugh for a year.\"","\"Later, when the Special Police Team was destroying some refugees’ clothing, Reporter Chen said she wanted to capture the scene. After getting permission from the colonels, I took her there. She was very cunning; although her lens was aimed at the big fire, she actually used a shallow focus to pull both the sitting Special Police Captain and Instructor Xia into the frame.\""]},{"number":5418,"title":"Chapter 5418: Ye Jian Made the News","paragraphs":["Gao Xiao kept a close watch on Chen Shuzhen’s every move. When she noticed Chen Shuzhen’s camera lens suddenly shift ever so slightly, she immediately looked up in the direction it pointed and saw two people sitting in front— the Special Police Captain and Xia Jinyuan.","Realizing something was amiss, she didn’t hesitate to demand the camera from Chen Shuzhen.","\"Hmph, who doesn’t understand her little schemes? I knew at a glance what she wanted to report. She’s definitely going to say the Chinese peacekeepers are slacking off.\"","Qiu Tong, seeing her become animated and worried that Ye Jian might think she wasn’t composed enough, quickly intervened, \"Alright, alright, if you keep going on like that, you’ll turn into a fortune teller who knows exactly what Reporter Chen is up to.\"","\"Ugh, being the worm in her stomach would be disgusting. I was just being proactive!\" Gao Xiao raised her eyebrows and grinned at Ye Jian, seeking praise, \"Instructor Ye, you have to admit I did a pretty job this time.\"","Ye Jian smiled and nodded, \"To know your friends and foes is to be undefeated in a hundred battles. Not bad at all, you did beautifully. With you keeping an eye on Reporter Chen, we can all rest easy.\"","Pleased with the praise, Gao Xiao couldn’t help feeling smug, but she tried to act modestly and said pretentiously, \"It was alright, I guess. I just thought we needed to be more vigilant here than usual. Better safe than sorry, right?\"","Qiu Tong raised her hand and gave her a pat on the back, \"Still playing coy after gaining an advantage? Do you think we’re fools?\"","For a while, the entire tent was filled with laughter. Ye Jian, watching the female soldiers, felt the smile in her eyes grow deeper. Conversing and laughing together, they hardly noticed night had fallen.","Come the next day, an article from Wanhai surfaced before Ye Jian in the form of photographs. Seeing the words there, Ye Jian couldn’t help but give a wry smile, \"Distorting right and wrong, it’s all a matter of personal bias. The entire report is filled with conjecture, amplifying subjective thoughts, causing the public to prematurely accept her version of events as indisputably true. This Reporter Chen... is really something else.\"","Ye Jian, commenting on the photographed report, caught Xia Jinyuan’s gaze. He let out a wistful sigh and pointed with his lean fingers to the photo at the top of the report, \"I didn’t ask you to look at the report— we all know it’s false. Look at this here, what’s in the picture.\"","Following his voice, Ye Jian took a glance, then brought the photo closer to take a careful look. She was surprised, \"My silhouette? When did she take this? Didn’t we say we’d destroyed all her photos?\"","\"What Gao Xiao destroyed was the later loaded film roll. The one with the picture of your silhouette was from the previously withdrawn old roll,\" Xia Jinyuan said, tilting his head as they closely examined the photo in Ye Jian’s hands. \"A photo of a silhouette won’t cause any problems. Since it’s not the front, it’s fine.\"","In the Chinese peacekeeping camp, Ye Jian wasn’t the only peacekeeping female soldier. Reporter Chen merely captured a silhouette without a face, so indeed, the problem wasn’t significant.","But there was a line in the report that read, \"The Chinese peacekeeping female soldiers are all beauties, and the peacekeeper woman in the captured silhouette is the most exquisite, rivaling a Wanhai star.\" It seemed like an offhand comment, but when combined with the entire article, it appeared to mislead towards a negative connotation.","At this time, with the internet widespread in Wanhai, various rumors emerged online following the article, ranging from good to bad. The military took note of the article and saw the myriad of rumors on the Wanhai internet. Without saying much else, the noon military news broadcast focused on an incident of a training error within the Wanhai forces, instantly overshadowing Chen Shuzhen’s inaccurate report."]},{"number":5419,"title":"Chapter 5419: Recognized","paragraphs":["And the false reports by Wanhai journalists were just as prominently published, complete with a series of commentaries underneath. Old Master Fu, holding the military newspaper of our country, examined it over and over again, and said to Uncle Fu, who was sitting beside him making tea, \"Little Fu, bring me my magnifying glass. I need a good look at the photograph on it.\"","Referred to as \"Little Fu\" by the Old Man, Uncle Fu set down the teaware and quickly brought the magnifying glass. Old Master Fu took the magnifying glass and enlarged the newspaper featuring the false report from Wanhai and its photograph, not looking at the text but at the people in the photo.","After at least three minutes, Old Master Fu beckoned Uncle Fu and said, \"Come here, look at this figure in the photo, isn’t that our girl? How did she end up on a peacekeeping mission?\"","\"An Jiaxin went on a peacekeeping mission?\" Shocked, Uncle Fu’s hand trembled as he poured tea, and he quickly leaned in to take a close look, staring intently as cold sweat began to form on his back.","That’s right, there’s no mistake, absolutely no mistake.","How did she go on a peacekeeping mission?","This, this, this... how did she end up on a peacekeeping mission?","\"This, this... shouldn’t you ask Commander Xia? This... how did she end up on a peacekeeping mission?\" Uncle Fu was completely unsettled. An Jiaxin was Old Master Fu’s only granddaughter, the only future of the Fu family. How... how could they let her go to such a dangerous country for peacekeeping?","What if... what if something happens? How could the Old Man bear it?","Old Master Fu was actually worried as well. He read reports and watched the news every day, and he was well aware of the current situation in Libya. His only granddaughter had suddenly gone to Libya for peacekeeping. Even though he normally didn’t meddle in the younger generation’s affairs, the Old Man thought it over and still decided to call Commander Xia.","Commander Xia truly hadn’t expected the Old Man to recognize the figure of the Peacekeeping Female Soldier in the photo taken by Wanhai journalists as Ye Jian. After receiving the call, Commander Xia specifically pulled up the photo sent from Wanhai and looked at it carefully. While looking, the commander said to the Old Man with a sigh, \"Old Master, your eyesight is truly remarkable. I really couldn’t tell that the figure of the female soldier in the photo was Ye Jian.\"","Until now... Commander Xia still hadn’t noticed it!","The Old Master wasn’t asking the commander if he recognized who was in the photo; he just wanted to know when his granddaughter would be able to come home.","This question was easy for Commander Xia to answer. He immediately replied with a smile, \"We’re already arranging for An Jiaxin and Little Six to return to the country together. Rest assured, Old Master, Little Six is there to look after An Jiaxin.\"","Fortunately, their mission there was already complete. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have known how to inform the Old Man without causing him unnecessary worry while sitting at home.","Commander Xia was very clear that Old Master Fu had called him because he was worried about Ye Jian going to Libya for peacekeeping.","Upon hearing that Xia Jinyuan would take care of her, the Old Man felt much more at ease, and a smile appeared on his face as he said, \"Then that’s good, that’s very good. I just don’t know if the two of them will have time to visit home after returning to the country, it’s been quite a while since I’ve seen them.\"","The Old Man has been missing his granddaughter and had been anxious in his heart, but he had never spoken about it. Now that a burden was lifted, he couldn’t help but speak out.","After speaking, Old Master Fu immediately realized it was improper and said, \"No, no, no, their time is limited; this old man can’t hold them back. How about this, Xinhui, if the two of them come back to the country, give me a call.\"","Commander Xia Xinhui replied with a chuckle, \"Both of them will indeed come back to the capital city. When they do, I’ll have them come and visit you. It’s just that their leave won’t be long, so please don’t be disappointed.\"","Ye Jian still needs to return to the airborne soldiers, and as the captain of the Snow Region Brigade, Xia Jinyuan must rush back to the brigade to lead the winter training. Therefore, the schedules of both of them are very tight."]},{"number":5420,"title":"Chapter 5420 In a Hurry","paragraphs":["Having a day or two to go home was already the limit, equivalent to using the one or two days of rest and adjustment they’d normally have after returning to the unit on family visits. Once the visit was over, they would have to immediately immerse themselves in their individual training.","Old Man Xia, however, felt very satisfied. Hanging up the phone, he said to Uncle Fu with a smile, \"Little Fu, our girl will be coming home in a couple of days. You should take the opportunity while the snow isn’t too heavy and make a quick trip to the market. Don’t send the guards to shop; we’ll go ourselves. I need to personally pick out some food that our girl loves to eat.\"","What does Ye Jian love to eat? She really didn’t have any particular favorites; she was quite casual about her food, clothing, and general living expenses.","Uncle Fu didn’t dare let Old Man Xia go outside—although the snow wasn’t heavy, it was still snowing, after all, \"Leave it to me. You just got over a cold two days ago; you wouldn’t want An Jiaxin to come back and see you not feeling well, would you? That would make her anxious when she returns to her unit.\"","With just a few words, he persuaded Old Man Xia.","Uncle Fu, equally eager for Ye Jian’s return, instructed the guards to take good care of Old Man Xia. He then took an umbrella, grabbed a vegetable basket, and drove himself to the market.","As the car left Dan Gui Garden, Mrs. Qin, who had come along with Qin Xiu to visit her in-laws, noticed the departing vehicle and said with surprise, \"Isn’t that the Fu family’s car? Where are they rushing off to in such a hurry?\"","Qin Xiu, who was inside the car reading the newspaper, hadn’t paid attention. Hearing this, he looked up from the paper and glanced outside, but the Fu family’s car was no longer in sight. He responded indifferently, \"Perhaps Grandpa Fu had some urgent business to attend to.\"","\"That can’t be right. Old Man Xia caught a cold recently, and it’s snowing outside. He wouldn’t go out in these conditions. I hope nothing untoward has happened.\" Mrs. Qin held Old Man Xia in high regard, so she quickly instructed her driver to speed up and said to Qin Xiu, \"Let’s go check on the Fu family first. I won’t be at ease until I see for myself.\"","Like her own parents, Old Man Xia was an elderly person of advanced age, and the hardest time for the elderly was winter—even in the North, where heating was available, elders struggled with the cold season.","Otherwise, she wouldn’t have come to Dan Gui Garden on a snowy day; it was because she was worried about her in-laws.","Although Mrs. Qin could be domineering, her filial piety was exceptional.","Qin Xiu also couldn’t focus on his newspaper anymore. He folded it neatly and placed it in the storage pocket behind the co-driver’s seat, also instructing the driver to go a bit faster.","The corner of the newspaper peeking out from the storage pocket was identical to the one Old Man Xia read. Qin Xiu had also seen the inaccurate reports about Wanhai, but he didn’t recognize the somewhat blurred image of the Peacekeeping Female Soldier in the report as Ye Jian.","Once they arrived at the Fu family’s house and the car came to a stop, Mrs. Qin didn’t wait for Qin Xiu to offer his help; she quickly opened the door and hurried out to ring the doorbell.","Rushing in the biting cold, the wind carrying snowflakes irritated her throat, and Mrs. Qin coughed uncontrollably. Following her out of the car, Qin Xiu quickly caught up and supported her, \"Mom, if you fall at Grandpa Fu’s place, he won’t be able to forgive himself.\"","After all, she was his mother. Despite his grievances over how she treated Du Jiayi, Qin Xiu couldn’t bring himself to be harsh with Mrs. Qin. Moreover, she hadn’t been pushing him as much this past year, so he had stopped avoiding her.","Seeing that her son was no longer giving her the cold shoulder, Mrs. Qin, slightly fearful in retrospect, had also eased off the pressure.","Of course, the main reason was... she no longer had the energy to keep a constant watch over Qin Xiu. Currently, what troubled Mrs. Qin the most was Qin Ying’s constant attempts to sneak the household registration book out!","Qin Ying was chasing after a poor soldier of her own accord, yet the poverty-stricken soldier not only didn’t accept her but actively avoided Qin Ying... This matter had already spread throughout the capital city. A few young ladies who didn’t look favorably upon Qin Ying even ridiculed her at a gathering, which infuriated Mrs. Qin and gave her another headache."]},{"number":5421,"title":"Chapter 5421: Holding and Twisting","paragraphs":["Mrs. Qin’s heart was filled with worries over her son and daughter’s marriages, but alas, the siblings were more difficult to handle than one another, each more stubborn than the last. Despite all her cunning, Mrs. Qin was powerless against them.","Assisting Mrs. Qin up the steps, Qin Xiu immediately pressed the doorbell. Inside, Old Master Fu, who was happily awaiting his granddaughter’s return, heard the doorbell and came to open the door, leaning on his cane.","Seeing that it was the Old Man who opened the door, Mrs. Qin instantly felt relieved. \"... Xiu and I were just about to enter the garden when we saw your family’s car rushing out, and I was worried something urgent had come up, so I urged Xiu to come over quickly and check. I heard you caught a cold and weren’t feeling well recently. Are you feeling much better now?\"","Old Man Xia, supported by Qin Xiu, slowly settled back into the sofa. \"Yes, yes, all is well. It was just a small cold; I caught a chill admiring the snow, nothing serious. You needn’t worry, I’m quite robust now.\"","\"That’s good to hear. Your guidance is still needed both inside and outside of the home, even for matters concerning my family. You must take good care of yourself,\" Mrs. Qin said sincerely, truly seeing the Old Man as a venerable elder of her own family. When she was indecisive on certain issues, even with Old Madam or Old Master Qin, she would come to seek Old Man Xia’s advice. The Old Man never declined, offering patient guidance and teachings, sparing Mrs. Qin many unnecessary detours.","For this, Mrs. Qin had always been truly grateful.","Speaking of family matters, Mrs. Qin noticed that the old master’s complexion was good and his spirit was strong, which stirred something in her heart; she again felt inclined to chat with the Old Man.","However, she didn’t immediately dive into conversation, instead asking with a smile, \"Seeing that you’re indeed in good health, could it be that there’s some happy news?\"","No sooner had she finished speaking than Old Man Xia laughed heartily, his voice robust and full of vigor, \"There is indeed great joy coming in the next few days. When the opportunity arises, I’ll introduce it.\"","When the opportunity arises, I’ll introduce it?","Qin Xiu’s gaze slightly lifted, his heart, like a mirrored surface, rippled gently.","He thought of someone, a person he had kept and concealed deep in his heart for all these years, unwilling to expose to others and determined not to utter their name again.","Mrs. Qin also looked happy and did not press for details, tactfully steering the conversation away.","Since the old master said he would introduce it when the opportunity comes, it meant that he couldn’t disclose it now. Thus, she couldn’t ask further, or it would show a lack of tact.","The conversation shifted to Qin Ying, and Mrs. Qin wanted to know if the Old Man had any advice, \"What’s with this child, being so headstrong? No matter how I persuade her, she doesn’t listen at all, even more stubborn than Xiu.\"","\"For such a headstrong girl, she might suffer many disadvantages in the future.\"","Discussing their children’s marriages, Mrs. Qin felt a few more strands of her hair were bound to turn white.","Qin Xiu pursed his lips and silently sat down to the side, not joining in.","Whenever the topic of his and his sister Qin Ying’s marriages came up, the atmosphere at home would instantly become explosive, filled with tension, as if a spark could injure the whole family.","He truly didn’t understand why his mother was so obstinate about marriage, not letting him and his sister decide for ourselves and convinced that only her choices were the best.","Good?","Was Du Jiayi good?","Madam Li, who had nearly come to blows with her half-brother, now lived in the Li family’s old residence, purportedly to accompany Madam Li but actually to guard against her half-brother’s return to the Li family, was that good?"]},{"number":5422,"title":"Chapter 5422: Persuasion","paragraphs":["People from the Li family, to put it bluntly, apart from Jinnian, there are no clean ones left.","Though Qin Xiu was somewhat annoyed by Mrs. Qin having complete control over the marriage affairs, he still couldn’t neglect everything because of this. He also couldn’t bear to see Mrs. Qin so worried that she lost sleep over it. Standing to the side, he couldn’t help but whisper to Old Man Xia, \"Grandpa Fu, I’m sorry our family affairs have caused you concern.\"","He was hinting at asking Old Master Fu to give Mrs. Qin some guidance.","Old Master Fu was actually not fond of meddling in other families’ affairs, but as for the Qin family, their relationship was simply too good. Not to mention, he had watched Qin Ying and Qin Xiu grow up, treasuring the siblings as if they were his own grandchildren. Now, seeing Qin Xiu’s earnest request, Old Master Fu really couldn’t bring himself to refuse.","After some thought, Old Man Xia sighed and said, \"Speaking of Qin Ying, she came to visit me a while ago and mentioned her situation with a military officer. Now that you’ve brought it up in front of me, I won’t shy away from meddling in your family matters. I might as well speak frankly.\"","\"You, concerned about your children’s marriage prospects, you hope that one marries well and the other finds a good spouse, hoping that everything turns out well. The family background must be good, character must be good, ability must be good—you aim for the best in all aspects, believing that you’re considering your children’s best interests in every regard, never feeling that there is anything wrong with what you do.\"","\"But as for Dingkang’s wife, have you ever thought that what you’re aiming for, is actually not what your children wish for? You fuss over Qin Ying’s well-being to the point of growing gray hairs and breaking your heart, but I’ve observed just how much Qin Ying herself has worn herself out. It pains my heart to see this child suffer.\"","\"Back in the day, when you were posted abroad with Dingkang and it was inconvenient to take Qin Ying with you, you left her behind, which is why Qin Ying developed a strong sense of independence and autonomy. Now that your daughter has grown up and can make decisions for herself in both small and big matters, your forceful demands on your end are causing you to suffer, and Qin Ying is not feeling great about it either.\"","When Qin Ying’s childhood was mentioned, Mrs. Qin couldn’t help but take out a handkerchief to wipe away her tears, \"Isn’t it because I feel that Dingkang and I owe Qin Ying and want to make it up to her?\"","\"I can understand your intentions. Ultimately, you’re hoping that each of your children ends up well, and I get that. Dingkang’s wife, I watched as you married into the Qin family, saw you bear children for Dingkang and manage the household.\"","\"My old eyes have seen your hardships, your parents-in-law have seen it, Dingkang understands it in his heart, and the whole family knows and appreciates you. That’s why no one has meddled much with the siblings’ marriages; they trust that you will choose well for them, remembering all the good you’ve done.\"","\"But look at what has happened now. Not long ago, out of annoyance for you, Qin Xiu was dispatched abroad for a year. Later, he chased after the Du family’s girl, and abandoned a chance for a promotion, opting to return to work in China from Molaban. His going back and forth cost him a great opportunity.\"","\"Qin Xiu’s matter is in the past, and I won’t bring it up again. With his ability, Qin Xiu can earn back what he has lost. But what about Qin Ying? Her temperament is even wilder than Qin Xiu’s. Remember when you took her to meet potential suitors, and she took off on her own with a passport and camera to travel around the world, not returning to the country for nearly five years?\"","\"Don’t you have any regrets in your heart? Because of your incessant meddling in marriage affairs, your son has cast aside his future. Because of your interference, your daughter has simply left the country and hasn’t returned. Don’t you feel even a bit of regret, or a fraction of fear?\"","Old Man Xia didn’t scold Mrs. Qin, only laid out the facts, hoping to make Mrs. Qin realize the potential harm her actions were causing her children."]},{"number":5423,"title":"Chapter 5423: On Reasoning","paragraphs":["Bringing up past events, Mrs. Qin’s heart fiercely \"thudded\" inside her chest.","Back then, Qin Ying disappeared abroad without a trace because of a blind date, which caused Mrs. Qin unimaginable worry and heartache. It was only after Qin Ying had returned home on her own initiative that they managed to put the matter to rest.","Now... Now if she were to push too hard, then... Thinking about it, Mrs. Qin shuddered violently, fearing that if she pressured her daughter too much, she might flee home for another five years. Then... then... she would nearly become an old maid of forty!","Not to mention getting married, even finding a boyfriend would be difficult!","Mrs. Qin clenched the handkerchief in her hand.","Old Man Xia said again, \"You say you’re doing this for Qin Ying’s good, but do you really know what Qin Ying truly desires in her heart? If you really want to make it up to Qin Ying, shouldn’t you compensate her according to what she thinks and likes? How could you instead be acting in direct opposition? You’re only causing her more trouble and irritation.\"","\"This is not the compensation you speak of from your mouth; it’s inflicting harm on Qin Ying once again. You’ve always claimed to have your children’s best interests at heart, yet you continue to hurt their feelings.\"","\"I...\" Mrs. Qin wanted to defend herself, but Old Man Xia waved his hand, signaling her to listen, \"Don’t explain to me, I’ve told you I can understand your intentions. However, I really don’t understand your actions.\"","\"Once the children are grown, they have their own paths they wish to follow. You’ve been intervening too much, and that needs to change. It’s not too late; change your ways promptly.\"","Mrs. Qin’s eyes reddened upon hearing this; she had wholeheartedly devoted herself to her children, but in the end... in the end... Lowering her head, Mrs. Qin wiped the corners of her eyes with her handkerchief continuously. After a while, she finally said, \"Old Man Xia, the military officer that Qin Ying likes... that officer... he... he...\"","What follows \"he\"? Mrs. Qin was too ashamed to say it herself.","Old Master Fu, however, said it, \"He rejected Qin Ying, saying he didn’t like her. And then, you got angry?\" Taking the small teacup passed to him by Qin Xiu, Old Man Xia sipped the tea before continuing, \"If it were so, do you think Qin Ying would stealthily take the family registry book from home? Would she be so determined to marry him?\"","\"Qin Ying is very clever and has had a strong sense of judgment since she was young, with a piercing gaze to boot. If that officer truly didn’t like her and repeatedly refused her, given Qin Ying’s character, she would definitely let go cleanly, never to force the issue, and would immediately leave!\"","That was true; her daughter was indeed decisively efficient and even more powerful in her actions than many men.","Mrs. Qin gradually stopped her tears, seemingly understanding what Old Man Xia was trying to convey.","\"But now, Qin Ying insists on marrying no one but him and even sneaks the family registry book home. That officer not liking Qin Ying? Impossible! Qin Ying mentioned the nature of the officer’s job; it’s very dangerous, often going for a year or half without being seen, either missing or disappeared. The man directly stated that he didn’t want Qin Ying to worry and fret over him, nor did he wish for her to put her life on hold because of him.\"","\"Listen to that, such an honest officer; he clearly deeply cares for her, yet for Qin Ying’s sake, and fearing she might impulsively marry him, he laid out everything crystal clear, allowing Qin Ying to back away understanding the difficulties.\"","\"In my opinion, this officer is good, far better than sons of rich and noble families – honest, responsible, and very capable. I’ve inquired about his background too; his family background is quite decent, a household of educators.\"","\"They are just ordinary schoolteachers from a small county town.\" Mrs. Qin ran out of arguments as Old Man Xia’s words left her speechless. She could only resort to playing the card of the officer’s family background, \"If it were in a big city, then I could somehow accept it.\""]},{"number":5424,"title":"Chapter 5424: Compromise","paragraphs":["Speaking of family background, Mrs. Qin had a lot to say again, as this was now the only reason she could find to object.","\"But that’s a small county town, extremely remote. If Ying marries there, the man is often not at home, and she, all alone in that unfamiliar place, surrounded either by his relatives and friends or the neighbors, when she encounters difficulties or suffers injustice, being so far away from her family in the capital, there will be no way for us to rush over and back her up immediately.\"","\"Mom, do you think we’re still in the old society where it’s common for a mean mother-in-law to bully her daughter-in-law? Grandpa, grandma, and Grandpa Fu are all from old society noble backgrounds, have you ever seen any of the three elders deliberately making things difficult for their daughters-in-law?\"","\"That’s different.\" Mrs. Qin glared at her son who always seemed to hold her back, \"Your grandparents and Grandpa Fu are all cultured and well-mannered, how could they ever do... \"","Suddenly, Mrs. Qin found herself at a loss for words. When it came to being cultured and learned... those officers from a family of educators, who could surpass them in being cultured and refined?","Qin Xiu whispered something in the Old Master Fu’s ear, which couldn’t help but surprise him a bit.","The officer Ying has taken a liking to is also a Special Forces man?","It seems... since his granddaughter returned, all the young officers he has encountered seem to be Special Forces.","\"Stop pressuring Ying into doing things she doesn’t like, and stop insisting on the man’s family background. Whether they are good or bad, you should meet them first, then express your opinion.\"","\"Qin Ying is free to choose whom to love and whom to marry, so as her parent, you can also voice your opinions and perspectives, helping Ying see more clearly the path she has chosen. If she takes the wrong path in the future, it will be her own choice, and she can’t blame others.\"","\"However, I still believe that Ying’s judgment won’t be wrong, and neither will Xiu’s.\"","Whether his sister Qin Ying’s judgment is good or bad, Qin Xiu doesn’t comment. However, he thinks his own judgment is quite good, liking Grandpa Fu’s granddaughter—truly a great choice.","But what use is good judgment?","In the end, he is a latecomer, and he doesn’t allow himself to do anything that goes against morality, no matter how much he likes her.","It seemed that Mrs. Qin took Old Master Fu’s words to heart, for after they left the Fu family home, she said to Qin Xiu, \"Xiu, do you want to find some time to meet the officer your sister is fond of? I won’t be at ease until I see him for myself.\"","Having spoken, Mrs. Qin showed some indignation, \"Can’t blame me for not agreeing. Initially, I asked your sister to bring the man home so I could see him first. But it’s always the man who has no time, no leave, this and that, not even able to visit his girlfriend’s home. I haven’t even met the person, and my heart is already half cold!\"","There was some softening, but no immediate agreement. Qin Xiu thought this was already excellent news.","\"I’ll talk with my sister to see if we can go for a visit. But don’t get your hopes up too high; he might truly be busy.\"","Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan, both Special Forces, their schedules are so tight it’s not unusual for them not to see each other for a year or even longer.","With no other choice, Mrs. Qin nodded, \"Alright, alright, you go handle this for me.\"","\"Okay.\" Qin Xiu nodded and accompanied Mrs. Qin walking towards the Qin family home.","What neither Mrs. Qin nor Qin Xiu expected was that they’d meet Qin Ying’s alleged busy officer so soon. He was tall and distinguished, indeed a fine figure of a man... just a bit dark.","Hmm, not just a bit dark, he was so dark that he was gleaming!","Two days later, Mrs. Qin looked at the officer her daughter had brought home and almost asked if he was a foreigner!"]},{"number":5425,"title":"Chapter 5425: Tense","paragraphs":["V8, whose real name was Yang Xulin, came from a small county town. His family’s financial situation wasn’t too great, but it wasn’t bad either; they were a household of schoolteachers.","In V8’s own words, his family was determined to turn \"teaching\" into a hereditary profession, passed down from generation to generation.","Only V8 was the exception. He suddenly announced that he wanted to join the military, and before his family could even try to stop him, he had already passed the enlistment registration and medical examination and was just waiting for his induction notice.","It was just one step away from being out of their hands, even if his family had wanted to stop him.","Having been a soldier for many years, Yang Xulin had seldom been home. This time, he was preoccupied with some matters and carefully considered asking Xia Jinyuan for leave.","There wasn’t much time, just five days of leave.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t even ask for the reason, he simply nodded and agreed. Soldiers from the Snow Region Brigade wouldn’t ask for leave without good reason, so a leave request meant there was an urgent matter.","Ye Jian thought V8 had some urgent business too, until the three of them separated from their comrades and got into a taxi by themselves, that was when V8 finally revealed the truth.","After hearing him out, Xia Jinyuan glanced a few times outside the car window and sighed, \"I almost thought spring had arrived.\"","Outside the car window, the vast expanse of white snow stretched as far as the eye could see, and there wasn’t a hint of spring in sight.","Yet one after another, the bachelors in the unit were dropping bombshells about their love lives, one by one catching spring fever—first K7, and then V8.","Good, good, everyone knows to seize the time to settle down with a life partner. As their captain, he wouldn’t have to worry anymore.","V8, who had decided to take care of his lifelong matter, sent a text message to Qin Ying while on the car ride. He himself wasn’t even certain whether Qin Ying was in the capital city or not; his heart was particularly uneasy while sending the message.","Ye Jian saw V8’s fingers trembling as he typed on his phone and whispered to Xia Jinyuan, \"So nervous, his hands are shaking.\"","\"Of course he’s nervous, I was nervous the first time I asked you out as your boyfriend too,\" Xia Jinyuan chuckled in response, quite understanding of V8’s current situation.","Ye Jian didn’t believe it. The Xia Jinyuan who had pursued her so steadily and expertly back then, cornering her until she had no place to hide, nervous? He was never nervous!","Xia Jinyuan then leaned in close to Ye Jian’s ear, \"Later, we should sneakily go see Sister-in-law; that way, I have something to tell my comrades when we get back to the unit.\"","It wasn’t about giving a report, it was about gossiping.","Ye Jian was quite curious too. V8 was so nervous that even she, who was normally unconcerned with such matters, was interested.","Qin Ying, who had stayed behind in the capital city to pilfer a household registry, was accompanying Old Master Qin, Old Madam, Mrs. Qin, and Qin Xiu at Dan Gui Garden. Besides them, there were Qin Xiu’s uncle and uncle’s son, and even Qin Xiu’s cousin, Qin Yi, was there.","At noon, as the whole family was gathered around the table enjoying hotpot, Qin Ying, who had her phone in her pocket, felt it vibrate and took it out to check. After reading it, she didn’t immediately text back V8; in front of the whole family at the dining table, she announced, \"My boyfriend is on his way over,\" instantly turning V8’s solo visit with Qin Ying into a face-to-face with the entire Qin family.","Poor V8 was still in the dark until he received a message from Qin Ying telling him where she was. V8 was initially planning to go to the military district guest house first but upon seeing the address Qin Ying sent, he turned to the pair inside the car, who were whispering into each other’s ears, and passed over his phone, \"Take a look at this place, do you know it?\"","The two whispering to each other looked up at the same time; Xia Jinyuan leaned over to take the phone and glanced at it, quickly and discreetly giving V8 a look. Ye Jian leaned over to take a look and couldn’t help but let out a surprised \"Huh.\"","\"What’s wrong? Is the address incorrect?\" V8 heard the surprise in Ye Jian’s voice, causing his already anxious heart to skip several beats."]},{"number":5426,"title":"Chapter 5426 Shock","paragraphs":["Ye Jian was about to speak when Xia Jinyuan secretly pulled her aside. \"It just so happens that I know the place. Let the driver take you there first.\" He then instructed the driver to change the route to Dan Gui Garden.","The relieved V8 took over the phone, rubbed his palm on his thigh a few times, nervously starting the conversation himself, \"I don’t even know what will happen next. I was only worried about not being able to take good care of her before, desperately thinking I couldn’t delay her. Now that I’m going back to pursue her, I have no idea if she will agree.\"","\"And what if she doesn’t agree? I’m all over the place right now, with no confidence at all.\"","Ye Jian, with her head down and lips pursed in a smile, thought that since V8 was going to Dan Gui Garden to meet her family, how could she not agree?","\"Once you meet, just take it from there. If she doesn’t agree, then chase her until she does. As a man, it’s okay to be a bit thick-skinned,\" she had just finished speaking when Xia Jinyuan silently twisted her thigh, causing his mouth to twitch. He had been telling the plain truth, based on experience no less!","V8 felt that Xia Jinyuan made sense. Clenching his fists and summoning the morale of tough battles from the training ground, he said firmly, \"That’s right, as long as she doesn’t have a boyfriend, I’ll brazenly pursue her.\"","\"It’s always been her making the moves, now it’s my turn to attack!\"","Attack... The driver was so amused by the conversation that he choked on his own saliva and couldn’t stop coughing.","Ye Jian really wanted to remind V8 that the girl he was chasing might very well be taking him to meet her family.","But Xia Jinyuan secretly pulled her back, and she decided, oh well, better not remind him.","The comrades from the Snow Region Brigade loved to play these childish games of tricking each other; she would just go with the flow and not try to be the exception.","Dan Gui Garden, this was quite the coincidence indeed!","She and Xia Jinyuan had planned to drop V8 at the guesthouse first and then go to Dan Gui Garden.","Now, not only could she see Grandpa earlier, but she could also see the sister-in-law who was making V8 so anxious. Great!","V8 had no idea what Dan Gui Garden was. Upon arriving and seeing military police standing guard, he immediately realized this was no ordinary place.","He had thought Dan Gui Garden was a hotel or restaurant of some sort!","Qin Ying had been waiting already and, seeing the man she fancied get out of the car, she approached to greet him, startling both Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian.","It was Qin Xiu’s sister!","Xia Jinyuan didn’t know Qin Ying and they had no interaction, but after learning that Qin Xiu had feelings for Ye Jian, he made an effort to understand the Qin family and had seen photos of Qin Ying, thus recognizing her immediately.","As for Ye Jian, meeting Qin Ying was also unexpected; she had run into Mrs. Qin and Du Jiayi at the airport, then heard Qin Ying call out \"Mom\" to Mrs. Qin. Plus, her resemblance to Qin Xiu’s features made it clear to Ye Jian her relation to Qin Xiu without even guessing her name.","She just didn’t know the name, that’s all.","Qin Ying’s eyes were fixed on V8 as she walked over, and it wasn’t until she was close that she diverted a portion of her gaze to the two standing behind him, recognizing both of them.","What mattered most was that the other... was the girl her brother had a secret crush on.","Beside the girl stood Xia Jinyuan from the Xia family.","The distance that both of them maintained clearly suggested they were a couple, and now they were appearing together with the man she wanted to marry. Qin Ying was far more shocked internally than Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian!","The man she wanted to marry was a member of the Special Forces!!","So that meant... that Xia Jinyuan and the girl her brother secretly admired must be... Special Forces too?!","The inwardly shocked Qin Ying took an extra look at Ye Jian and asked another question on the way home with V8; he didn’t hide anything and confirmed it to Qin Ying, who silently mourned for her brother Qin Xiu in her heart."]},{"number":5427,"title":"Chapter 5427 Facing","paragraphs":["Indeed, the siblings had the same taste in choosing people, both picking partners from the Special Forces.","It’s just that the brother wasn’t very lucky; the girl he fancied had a boyfriend, and not just any boyfriend, but a formidable rival like Little Six from the Xia family. Even if he had the intention of poaching, he stood no chance of winning.","That’s not right.","The Xia family doesn’t live around here, and the Old Master and Old Madam of the Xia family have always resided in the Xia family’s old residence. So where was Little Six taking his girlfriend to?","Where they were going, V8 had no idea; he only knew that ever since he got on the car to the mountains, his heart had been pounding nonstop, never quiet for a moment.","Where exactly is he being taken?","With an uncertain heart, yet vaguely knowing something, V8 refrained from asking or confirming; he was afraid of asking...afraid of deserting.","After listening to her daughter’s introduction, Mrs. Qin looked at the officer who seemed like a foreign friend. It was only because of her good upbringing that Mrs. Qin didn’t ask if V8 was a foreigner.","The girlfriend had done all that was expected of her, and now it was time to see how V8, who was led into the home, would be perceived by the Qin family elders.","On the battlefield, V8 faced life and death calmly but, in front of the Qin family elders, he was sweating from his head, hands, and even the soles of his feet.","He really wanted to remain composed, but...but he just couldn’t manage it. The kind old master who was sitting on the couch and asking him questions was...was the same figure he had seen in his middle school textbooks!","V8, who honestly confessed everything about his background, felt as if he was facing a formidable foe. No, that’s not right! He had never been nervous facing an enemy, but now he truly was!","V8’s honesty endeared him to Old Master Qin and the Old Madam. His family background could be set aside; what mattered most was his good character.","Besides, the young man was tall and handsome with a robust, masculine air, and held the rank of lieutenant colonel. Except for being a bit dark-skinned, he really had no flaws!","He didn’t smoke, didn’t drink, didn’t gamble, hadn’t dated before, and came from a clean family background. How could he be lacking? Not at all! He really wasn’t lacking in anything.","Old Madam Qin truly thought her granddaughter had better taste than her daughter-in-law!","Qin Ying watched the man she fancied facing the Qin family elders’ warm inquiries on his own, and covertly signaled Qin Xiu to step outside and have a few words.","\"Do you know what the girl you like does for a living?\" Qin Ying asked as soon as they were outside. \"Do you know anything at all? Do you just think she’s pretty and like her?\"","Men, first and foremost, look at whether a woman is beautiful or not. Even if Qin Xiu is her brother, he’s still a man, afflicted with the universal weakness all men have by nature.","Women also like handsome men; it’s a universal human flaw, really.","Qin Xiu, with a slight furrow in his brow, didn’t answer the question but instead asked, \"Did you see her just now? Did you notice her when you met your boyfriend?\"","Well...that’s getting straight to the point.","Qin Ying glared at him. \"Don’t try to show off your intelligence in front of your sister. Wait, that’s not right.\" She paused, giving Qin Xiu a thorough once-over before continuing, \"So, you’ve known her identity all along?\"","Both siblings were clever, and not answering was an answer in itself.","\"I need to step out for a bit.\" Qin Xiu suddenly got to his feet. His sister had indeed seen Ye Jian just before. Ye Jian had returned to Dan Gui Garden, and she went back to the Fu family.","Taking a step forward, his strides grew larger and more hurried, as he saw two long legs take two of Qin Ying’s steps at a time, heading out onto the snow-covered path."]},{"number":5428,"title":"Chapter 5428: Going Home","paragraphs":["The room was heated, Qin Xiu thought Qin Ying would only say a few words outside, so he had only worn a dark, figure-hugging suit, with a light gray shirt on top and a dark V-neck woolen vest. Such attire made him look handsome and elegant, but walking in the icy snow made him somewhat cold.","As Qin Xiu’s thoughts were filled with Ye Jian, he didn’t feel the cold at all. Eager to see her, and fueled by a surge of impulse, Qin Xiu darted out of the high-walled courtyard in the blink of an eye.","Qin Ying was dumbfounded. Was her foolish brother really... going to find someone? At least put on some more clothes before going to look for her.","Qin Ying, about to step forward, suddenly retracted her footsteps and stood still, her expression becoming somewhat solemn.","It might be good to let him go and see for himself; seeing Little Six from Xia family with that girl, her foolish brother should realize it’s time to let go.","After all, how many years has it been since he started liking her? Why is he so stubborn?","Instead of being unable to let go, it might be better to experience a swift and intense pain—perhaps then he might forget.","Qin Ying didn’t chase after him. She turned around and went back inside.","She should focus on her own boyfriend who had suddenly shown up in the capital city in the snowy weather to see her, confident that he had thought it through before coming.","Now that he had come to her doorstep, how could she let him slip away again?","As Qin Ying entered the house, Old Master Fu was joyfully holding Ye Jian’s hand on the other side, unable to stop repeating the word \"good.\"","\"I saw your silhouette in the newspaper a few days ago and called Commander Xia right away. That’s how I found out that you went on a peacekeeping mission. With Little Xia taking care of you, my heart was at ease,\" he expressed with concern.","Ye Jian lightly gripped Old Master Fu’s hand and responded obediently, \"I’ve made Grandpa worry again. I wasn’t away for long; it wasn’t even a month.\"","\"A month isn’t necessary for trouble to occur. It can happen in a minute, in a second.\" Seeing his granddaughter safely return home finally set Old Master Fu’s heart at ease.","Regardless of how supportive he was of Ye Jian’s work, going to such a dangerous country was bound to make him worry.","He then kindly said to Xia Jinyuan, \"You’ve taken great care of her outside. Having you by her side comforts me greatly.\"","\"You take care of Ye Jian, and don’t forget to take good care of yourself, too. Both of you need to be well and protect each other, understand?\"","Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian exchanged smiles. Xia Jinyuan said with a smile, \"I will take good care of An Jiaxin; you can rest assured, Grandpa.\"","Ye Jian also answered cheerily, \"I will take good care of Captain Xia.\"","\"Yes, yes, yes, it should be just like that,\" the old man said, laughing heartily.","If his granddaughter and her future son-in-law could maintain a harmonious and beautiful relationship, unlike the rocky road his son faced, he would be utterly reassured.","Hearing Old Master Fu laughing in the kitchen, Uncle Fu couldn’t help but smile himself, even quickening his pace while picking vegetables.","Xia Jinyuan knew how to speak in a way that always brightened the old master’s mood, and seeing this made Ye Jian very happy.","\"Your father is coming home for New Year’s, but it’s a pity that you two won’t be able to meet. Later, I’ll ask if he has enough holiday time to perhaps join you in the military base for the New Year.\"","\"Grandpa, I’ve already met with Dad, and for quite a few days,\" Ye Jian said, referring to the time she met Chief Engineer Fu in the Gobi Desert during the female soldiers’ training, which actually took place last year.","But the old man was unaware and thought it was a recent encounter.","In the midst of a joyful conversation, the doorbell rang at home. The security officer had opened the door, and Qin Xiu, standing at the entrance without having changed his shoes yet, heard Old Man Xia’s laughter first; his lips curved into a slight smile."]},{"number":5429,"title":"Chapter 5429: Let Go","paragraphs":["The guard recognized Qin Xiu, and as usual, invited him inside. Just as Qin Xiu was about to enter, he suddenly heard a young man’s crisp voice coming from inside. The corners of his mouth slowly curled up, and then just as slowly, the smile was suppressed. In the end, his face was left with only the polite coolness he reserved for his work.","He came in too much of a hurry and had forgotten... about Xia Jinyuan’s presence.","No, in fact, he hadn’t forgotten, he just deliberately wanted to forget, it was merely self-deception.","With Ye Jian’s boyfriend there, him showing up would only make Ye Jian uncomfortable, it would also trouble Grandpa Fu, and might even ruin the otherwise peaceful atmosphere and lead to awkwardness because of his arrival.","As Qin Xiu thought this to himself, he began to slowly retreat. The guard inviting him in asked, upon seeing this, \"What happened?\"","Qin Xiu replied in his usual gentle manner, \"I just remembered something I need to take care of at home, I will come back later to visit Grandpa Fu.\"","\"Okay, I will let Old Man Xia know later,\" the guard replied without suspicion, and courteously saw Qin Xiu out.","The snow that had stopped this morning had started to fall again, with the white snowflakes fluttering down, carried by the cold wind and quickly covering his clothes.","In the snowy capital city, the temperature was extremely low. Wearing only a shirt and a wool vest, Qin Xiu suddenly felt the cold, a chill that seeped into his bones and along his muscles into his veins, until even his heart felt icy cold.","Qin Xiu seemed very cold, so cold that his swinging arms during his walk were stiff, and though his arms were stiff, his fingers did not stop trembling, eventually even his steps became somewhat unsteady.","He placed his hands in his trouser pockets to hide their trembling, then straightened his back, walking through adversity like a blind man who, despite the darkness ahead, kept going until he found light, until he reached the sacred ground in his heart.","Up ahead, someone was holding an umbrella, standing there, and as they saw the approaching tall figure through the snow, a deep love filled their eyes.","With a sigh, Qin Ying, with one hand holding an umbrella and the other carrying a coat, walked over and handed over the coat, murmuring, \"Put it on, don’t catch a cold.\"","Qin Xiu, with a face a little pale, took the coat and his handsome face showed a very faint, very shallow smile, as if to tell Qin Ying not to worry about him, he was fine.","The smile was a bit forced, and the hands that were trying to fasten the buttons of the coat were so stiff that he struggled to correctly button it even after several attempts.","\"There, stop trying to look strong in front of your sister. Anyone can see that you have something on your mind just by looking at you; take the umbrella.\" As she spoke, Qin Ying handed the umbrella to Qin Xiu, skillfully fastened his coat buttons with her nimble fingers, and said, \"Fixating on someone you shouldn’t will only wear you out. That girl does seem truly wonderful, one can’t help but like her if not for her looks, then for her temperament.\"","\"But she is already taken, and her partner is an immovable mountain; you don’t stand a chance. I feel for you, but I won’t encourage you to chase after already claimed love. You can’t do it, and I can’t say it, so you’ll just have to heal your own heart.\"","\"You’ve always been obedient growing up, but in truth, you’re the one with the most conviction. You’re lazy when it comes to small matters, but on major issues, no one can sway your decisions.\"","\"You’ve been pining for this girl for four or five years now; I think that’s about enough. Always thinking about someone else’s girlfriend isn’t right, and even if you refrain from disturbing them and don’t express what’s in your heart, you still can’t face her with ease.\"","\"Qin Xiu, you need to let go, only by letting go can you be at ease, can you stand in front of her with a smile, without making her feel awkward, without making yourself suffer.\""]},{"number":5430,"title":"Chapter 5430: Heartache","paragraphs":["She carefully tiptoed and gently brushed off the snowflakes that had fallen but not yet melted on Qin Xiu’s hair, her fingers accidentally touching Qin Xiu’s ears, which were so cold they felt like touching a clump of snow, causing Qin Ying’s eyes to redden with heartache.","Her foolish little brother...","\"Let’s go, let’s go home,\" she said softly, unable to bear watching anymore, and turned to leave first, taking the lead.","Qin Xiu, holding the umbrella, saw this, covered his ears that were nearly numb from the cold, and chuckled bitterly as he quickly caught up with her.","He knew all too well what his sister meant.","Because he knew, he had left before she did, because he knew that was why he had so many concerns, and it was precisely because he knew that when he heard Xia Jinyuan’s voice, his heart surged with warmth that instantly cooled down. Even though he knew that just one more step would let him see the girl he had worked so hard to let go of but never could, he still withdrew his footstep, staying far away from her.","It was exactly because he knew that he just couldn’t.","Catching up with Qin Ying, the two siblings shared an umbrella on their way home, just like when they were children. Whenever the little brother faced grievances outside, the sister was always the first one to stand up for him and make decisions on his behalf.","\"The road ahead is still long, you have to look forward, you know.\"","\"Mhm.\"","\"You’re not any less than Little Six from the Xia family, it’s just late, you know.\"","\"Mhm.\"","\"You can’t hurt others just because you like someone, you know.\"","\"Mhm.\"","\"Your sister found a man well into her thirties, you’re only thirty this year, it’s okay even if it’s a few years later, you know.\"","\"Mhm.\"","\"Tomorrow, your sister will ask around the circle of friends to see which family’s daughter is good and introduce her to you.\"","\"Mhm... no need.\" Qin Xiu, who had nodded subconsciously, found himself caught by Qin Ying’s offer, his handsome face filled with a touch of helplessness, \"I won’t meddle in your lifelong affairs, and you can’t mess with mine.\"","\"Even if there were such an opportunity, I would need to forget the person in my heart first. I can’t be thinking of someone else and go afflicting other girls.\"","Qin Ying was left speechless, indeed, he hadn’t said anything wrong.","After a while, Qin Ying snapped irritably, \"Can’t you be a little less calm and a bit more impulsive? Why have I never seen you act on impulse?\"","From childhood to adulthood, he always analyzed everything carefully, sometimes so calm that it made her, as his sister, feel inadequate.","Qin Xiu smiled without saying a word. His personality was such, impossible to change.","Xia Jinyuan, who was talking with Old Man Xia, had already learned that it was Qin Xiu who rang the doorbell earlier but did not enter. Old Man Xia sighed faintly upon learning it was Qin Xiu and, glancing at his future grandson-in-law, asked the guard, \"He ran over here wearing just a shirt and a vest, then said he had something sudden and had to leave? Did the kid encounter some trouble? Did he say what it was?\"","Old Man Xia asked the guard, and Xia Jinyuan immediately realized how concerned the old man was about Qin Xiu.","Because of this, a sense of relief surged in his heart—he was glad he had acted first on his side, not giving Qin Xiu any opportunity. Otherwise, given Old Master Xia’s fondness for Qin Xiu, it really might have been possible for Ye Jian to be introduced to him.","After all, both families knew each other well and were close. It would be ideal if they could become relatives through marriage.","The guard told Old Master Xia that he hadn’t asked Qin Xiu about the urgent matter, so the old master did not inquire further. His reason for asking was because of Little Six from the Xia family.","Turning to the lover sitting before him with a smile, Xia Jinyuan explained, \"Qin Xiu, Old Master Qin’s grandson, you two know each other. The kid is a good one, often coming over to keep me company. As a child, he especially loved to play at our house and would often say he wanted to be my grandson. Girl, when you see Qin Xiu later on, you could call him ’brother,’ and he’ll surely be happy.\"","The kid, Xiu... It seems he still hasn’t let go of his girl."]},{"number":5431,"title":"Chapter 5431: Feeling Jealous","paragraphs":["Not wanting Xia Jinyuan to notice, Old Man Xia caught his breath with some difficulty, and Ye Jian quickly helped smooth the old man’s back, \"Take your time, no rush.\"","\"Captain Xia and I both know Qin Xiu, and we have worked together a few times. Uncle Fu also told me that when my father and I weren’t around, Qin Xiu often visited you; I really must thank him properly for taking care of you.\"","Ye Jian didn’t say it out loud, but she actually understood why they had suddenly left the door.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t interrupt, just listened with a smile.","Qin Xiu was caring for the old man, which shows Qin Xiu’s benevolent and courteous nature. It was only right that his girlfriend would want to thank him. And the old man seemed utterly unaware of Qin Xiu’s interest in Ye Jian, so there was no need for him to say anything.","Saying too much might only arouse the old man’s suspicion.","Caring for the old man was a commendable act by Qin Xiu, and Xia Jinyuan had to accept it positively, and couldn’t deny it just because he liked Ye Jian. However, Xia Jinyuan was a \"narrow-minded\" fellow; even though he knew the other man was interested in his girlfriend, he couldn’t just stand aside and watch his girlfriend thank Qin Xiu.","And Old Man Xia felt his heart skip a beat when Xia Jinyuan mentioned he knew Qin Xiu too.","Then he heard Xia Jinyuan suggest with a smile, \"Why don’t we invite him to sit with us? I owe him a thanks for helping me out last time.\"","Whether it was killing Cobra or escaping from the Molaban hotel, Qin Xiu had played a part. Coming to the hotel as a diplomat, he didn’t have to come personally, yet he did.","Ye Jian smiled; she could see right through what her man was thinking.","Actually, she was clear that she shouldn’t meet Qin Xiu alone, and seeing her man get jealous and instantly arm himself at the slightest hint of trouble made her feel unexpectedly good.","Damn, hanging around Captain Xia for too long, she noticed she was turning a bit bad too.","The old man, unaware of the young people’s convoluted thoughts, felt slightly reassured by Xia Jinyuan’s proactive invitation; apparently, he didn’t catch on.","He immediately said with a laugh, \"Good, good. While he’s here, let him come over for dinner. The three of you young people can chat together; surely you’ll click well. Excellent people should have common topics to talk about, especially since you all know each other.\"","Xiu needs to back off on his own accord; dragging this out isn’t the solution...","Thus, it was decided happily just like that.","Upon hearing, Qin Xiu was silent for a while before he laughed and promised to come have dinner at the Fu family tonight. When Old Master Qin heard this, he laughed and told the guard who came with the message, \"Go back and tell your master to add another pair of chopsticks tonight; I will also come for dinner.\"","He wanted to discuss with Old Fu about the happy news from home; his granddaughter, Qin Ying, had finally found a boyfriend, who was stable and honest. Each answer showcased his good character, and besides his special profession, there wasn’t a single fault to find.","According to his granddaughter, it suited her better that her boyfriend was often away from home because... she was often away too, so there was no concern about staying alone in an empty house.","The girl was quite bold to speak everything out directly, fortunately, the other party didn’t mind and even agreed that what his granddaughter said made sense.","Thus, they really matched each other perfectly in every aspect.","Old Master Qin wanted to share the happy news from home with Old Man Xia for one, and secondly, since the guard mentioned that the guest from the Fu family seemed in very good spirits, he guessed that the news of his granddaughter’s return had not yet been made public by the Fu family."]},{"number":5432,"title":"Chapter 5432: He is from the Main Palace","paragraphs":["It’s been several years since the granddaughter returned, and Old Fu still hasn’t spoken about it; he couldn’t help wanting to ask what exactly the reason was.","In the afternoon, V8 accompanied Qin Ying and Mrs. Qin to shop for New Year’s goods. In Qin Ying’s words, she could finally rest assured and hand over such an important task, allowing herself to go shopping without having to carry anything.","Mrs. Qin even gave Qin Ying a covert glare, trying to save some face for her daughter so as not to let the man think her daughter was lazy. Little did she know... the man thought his daughter made a lot of sense and treated everything she said as an imperial edict that was completely right. This made her feel, as a mother, whether her daughter was too bossy, manipulating people into putty in her hands.","But then again, she couldn’t deny that it pleased her heart to see this.","With the initial strokes of their relationship character drawn, V8 did not dare take Qin Ying lightly just because she had brought him to meet her family. Moreover, he really felt that listening to Qin Ying... cough, listening to his girlfriend was the right thing to do.","Those in the team who had wives or girlfriends all did the same.","Even their captain, such a formidable figure in his work life, had to obediently listen to Ye Jian in the home life, going east when she said so, never venturing west.","V8 went out shopping, Old Master Qin and Qin Xiu arrived at the Fu family early in the afternoon. With Old Master Qin by his side, Qin Xiu appeared much more natural, except for being wary of having too much eye contact with Ye Jian. Otherwise, it really wasn’t apparent that he harbored feelings for her.","Observing secretly, Old Man Xia noticed nothing obvious on Qin Xiu’s face and saw that he interacted smoothly. Seeing that Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian also interacted naturally and could even engage in conversation together, Old Man Xia truly believed that Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan were unaware of Qin Xiu’s feelings, and the three of them had perfectly deceived him.","Ye Jian, who was helping out in the kitchen, went to the tea room to fetch hot tea for the two elders. Only then did she realize that the two who had been sitting in the living room had left. She wasn’t particularly worried; she casually inquired when the guards had seen them leave and learned that it was only a short while ago. Ye Jian didn’t take it to heart and went on with her own tasks.","She was staying over at the house tonight, so the rooms upstairs needed a thorough clean.","The heavy snow had not stopped outside; the roads that had just been cleared in the morning were once again covered with a layer of snow. The Chinese military police in charge of security at Dan Gui Garden drove snowplows from the bottom to the top of the mountain and also used brooms to sweep the roads clean to facilitate vehicle traffic.","Xia Jinyuan looked at the one clean stretch in the snowy world that resembled a massive black dragon snake coiling on the road and pointed toward a mountain trail, \"Shall we walk the trail? It’s peaceful and offers a view of the snowscape.\"","Xia Jinyuan wasn’t particularly interested in admiring the snowscape; what he wanted was the tranquility to speak freely.","Qin Xiu had no objections and slightly nodded his head, then the two men, both with slender figures, took to the mountain path that could accommodate three people walking side by side.","The mountain path was entirely made of steps, with chains on both sides for support. The two men ascended the steps, engaging in back and forth conversation that appeared to indicate a pretty good relationship.","Both were skilled in public relations and no matter the inner turmoil, it would not show on the surface. They were also both very good at keeping their composure; neither one brought up the topic of Ye Jian first. They discussed national affairs, international conflicts, and by the time they reached the midpoint of the mountain, they had not yet exhausted all topics of conversation."]},{"number":5433,"title":"Chapter 5433: Indignation","paragraphs":["Sitting in his home playing chess, Old Master Qin placed a black piece; Ye Jian, having made tea, retreated from the room. Old Master Qin waited for the chess room door to close and spoke to Old Man Xia, who was contemplating his move, \"I’ve come to like your granddaughter more and more. We are old acquaintances, and it should have been ’the vigilant fisherman who gets the fish,’ but then came a twist of fate! Thinking about it leaves such a bitter taste in my heart.\"","Ye Jian was indeed well-favored by the elder, mainly due to his long military career that endowed him with an upright and commanding presence, brimming with energy and vigor, making one feel comfortable and secure just by looking at him.","Old Master Qin began working in the Ministry of Foreign Affairs in the sixties and didn’t retire until the early nineties, more than a decade ago. Despite his retirement, his sharp eye for judging people, honed by years of experience, had not dulled in the least. He could tell what kind of person someone was, what they would say, and distinguish truth from lies with ease.","Old Master Qin was very clear about the kind of character Ye Jian had and thus always felt a sense of wistfulness upon seeing him.","Why hadn’t he acted sooner?","Why hadn’t he paired his grandson, Qin Xiu, with Ye Jian?","Why hadn’t the two young people seen eye to eye?","How had they let such an opportunity pass them by?","Just the thought filled Old Master Qin with immense regret.","Yet, Old Man Xia viewed things much more calmly, \"Grandchildren will have their own luck; who they end up with is not for us to control. Marriage requires destiny, and without it, even if they grow up together, they cannot become husband and wife; they’ll only be siblings.\"","\"I like Xiu as well,\" he continued, \"but if the two of them do not have the marital bond, then being siblings is also good in my eyes.\"","Although his granddaughter and her future brother-in-law got along well, Qin Xiu, as good as he was, ultimately wasn’t the one Sun Xueqing fancied. Moreover, Dingkang’s daughter-in-law had made some unfavorable remarks during her last visit, which even a trace of fate could not overcome after being so ruffled.","Placing down a white piece instantly blocked Old Master Qin’s escape route. Seeing this, Old Master Qin, holding the black pieces, chuckled and confidently stated, \"Trying to block my way? I don’t have just one path of retreat.\"","After saying this, he promptly placed a black piece, and with a single move, turned the tide of the game that had seemed lost, opening up a glimmer of hope. Old Man Xia picked up his tea cup, smiled, took a sip to moisten his throat, \"The game hasn’t been decided yet, don’t be too smug. You should worry less about Xiu’s marriage. He’s hiding someone in his heart, at least give him some time to sort it out.\"","\"Huh? You’ve noticed too?\" Old Master Qin, who had been handling the chess pieces in the box, stopped his actions and even set the chess box aside, his expression turning serious, \"I’ve always felt that Xiu has someone on his mind, but upon closer observation, it doesn’t seem to fit.\"","\"Since you’ve said as much today, he must indeed have someone, and it’s been for some time. My daughter-in-law is always so assertive, likes to interfere too much. Since Xiu has someone in his heart yet hasn’t confided in the family, I’m afraid...\"","Old Master Qin sighed and even grew somewhat angry, \"I fear it’s because of his mother that Xiu doesn’t dare to reveal the truth to the family, keeping it concealed.\"","Seeing his old friend getting upset, Old Man Xia hastily poured another cup of tea and handed it over, \"Now, now, cool down. I just said that grandchildren have their own blessings, and before you even left the room, you forgot all about it.\"","\"Apart from being rather meddlesome when it comes to Ying and Xiu’s lifelong matters, Dingkang’s daughter-in-law is quite good in other aspects; you can’t be angry just for that.\"","\"Which parent doesn’t hope for their children to marry well? We must understand her worries. You two elders should just stay as usual, there’s no need for you to get involved.\""]},{"number":5434,"title":"Chapter 5434: Persuasion","paragraphs":["\"Look, after so many years of outwitting each other, it’s still Ying who won, bringing back a son-in-law that both of you old folks are satisfied with. This goes to show, Dingkang’s wife can be as stubborn as she wants, but she can’t overcome the will of her children.\"","\"Believe me, she can’t get the better of Xiu either. Xiu is even more difficult to deal with than Ying. If he can debate with the ministers on the diplomatic stage, there’s no way he can’t win against his mother, right?\"","Old Man Xia’s words were all sensible, and Old Master Qin found them quite reasonable as well, but his heart was still somewhat troubled, \"The two siblings have different temperaments. Ying is outgoing and flamboyant. When she sets her mind to something, she’ll just run away from home and that’s how she got Dingkang’s wife wrapped around her finger.\"","\"Xiu is different. Even though he is sharp on the inside, he wouldn’t resort to the extreme measures like Ying, and he is extremely filial. I’m really worried that in order to not make his mother sad, he will sacrifice his own happiness to comply with her wishes. By then, his whole life would be ruined, not to mention family happiness.\"","\"Hahaha, you, you really are getting senile,\" Old Man Xia suddenly burst into laughter. Under the puzzled gaze of Old Master Qin, Old Man Xia took a sip of hot tea before slowly explaining, \"Dingkang’s wife has always wanted to introduce Staff Officer Du’s daughter to Xiu. To force Xiu to agree, she even brought Miss Du to Dan Gui Garden. But what happened? In the end, did Xiu agree?\"","\"You, you worry too much. Even when Dingkang’s wife pushed that hard, Xiu didn’t give in. Do you think he’ll bow down in the future? You still don’t understand how firm Xiu is on the inside, do you?\"","That was indeed the case!","Hitting the nail on the head, Old Master Qin suddenly saw the light and burst into hearty laughter, \"It seems I was indeed foolishly worrying. You see things more clearly than I do.\"","Old Man Xia said, \"Hahaha, hahaha, you say Xiu has already done so much, do you think he’ll listen to his mother? Rest assured, in the future Xiu will definitely marry a good girl.\"","Old Master Qin laughed, \"Hahaha, come on, come on, let’s play chess. Xiu has his own ideas in mind, I’m just waiting for him to bring home the girl he likes.\"","But it definitely wouldn’t be his family’s girl! Old Man Xia thought to himself as he continued to make his chess moves.","\"Just wait and see, it’s only a matter of time. You’re not playing fair, trying to win while I’m not looking? You underestimate me!\" Old Man Xia made his move as the two elders smiled brightly at each other.","What neither of the old men expected was that the girl Qin Xiu was thinking about was busy right under their noses, and Qin Xiu, who Old Master Qin was worried about, was on his way to the Li family.","Xia Jinyuan had just found out that Old Master Li had passed away. Rumors in the capital suggested that he died from anger caused by his second son, Li Ronghuan, and there were also whispers that Li Chuhai’s death somehow involved Madam Li. It was said that Old Master Li passed away due to extreme anger, and soon thereafter rumors spread that Madam Li moved back to take care of Old Madam Li, to prevent Li Ronghuan from taking over the Li family assets. All in all, the biggest scandals in the capital this year came from the Li family.","Having been abroad, Xia Jinyuan had no idea about these events. Commander Xia didn’t inform him, and Li Jinnian wanted to tell him but never got in touch. Messages were sent to his phone, but Xia Jinyuan had left it at the base and didn’t carry it with him, so he only found out today.","Xia Jinyuan wasn’t concerned about other matters, but the one thing that did concern him was... He frowned slightly, his breath visible in the cold air as he asked in a low voice, \"How did the rumors about Li Chuhai’s death being related to Madam Li come about?\"","Catching his breath from the climb, Qin Xiu leaned on the climbing chain and took a moment to regulate his breathing before speaking, \"It’s the Li family taboo; they keep it tightly concealed from top to bottom. Old Master Li died in the hospital, and before his death, Madam Li had all the attending nurses leave the sickroom. Old Master Li, who was awake at that time, nodded his agreement, so the room was left with only Madam Li, Madam Li, Li Ronghuan. However, later I heard that before Old Master Li died, Madam Li suffered a great shock and fainted.\""]},{"number":5435,"title":"Chapter 5435: Sovereignty","paragraphs":["\"With no outsiders around, whether Old Master Li was angered to death by Li Ronghuan or by Madam Li remains a mystery to this day.\"","\"Why do they say Li Chuhai’s death is related to Madam Li? There’s a lot of rumors flying around. Some say Li Chuhai had already committed a crime when he fled abroad, and it was because Madam Li asked him to return to face legal punishment. Others say Li Chuhai did something heinous back in the day, and was targeted upon his return, reported to the authorities, and then shot dead by police while trying to flee the country.\"","Xia Jinyuan listened, his gaze dark and inscrutable. They could call it rumor, but trim off some edges and you find the truth of the matter.","If that’s the case, the one who spread these rumors must know some inside information, so... Xia Jinyuan felt a sudden chill in his chest and said to Qin Xiu, \"Let’s plan another day for mountain climbing and enjoying the views. That’s enough for today.\"","He had to ask his old man immediately. Rumors were messy, but his old man would have definitely found out the truth by now!","Qin Xiu’s invitation for Xia Jinyuan to take a walk was just a pretext; his real intention was to discuss Ye Jian. However, before they even got to that topic, Xia Jinyuan was already anxious to leave. Qin Xiu lifted his hand and grabbed the snow-covered iron chain, his movement a bit exaggerated. The iron chain, connected to the stone pillars on both sides, shook, causing strips of snow to flutter down and revealing the entire rusty chain.","\"When do you plan to marry Ye Jian?\" he suddenly asked, his jawline slightly tensed, his elegant and handsome features appearing calm, yet his heart twisted in pain as he spoke.","Asking when the girl he liked would marry someone else was truly cruel to himself.","And yet, Qin Xiu wanted to use this very cruelty to end his yearning for Ye Jian. It had been too long, really too long, so long that he’d gotten used to silently loving Ye Jian, to the habit of looking at her photo every night before sleep, so long... that he’d started to believe he would likely spend his life loving only her.","As his sister had said, loving a girl who’s already taken is too painful. He had loved her for so long, it was time to let go. He really, really wanted to let go and was ready to try.","Even if it was cruel to himself, he had to do it.","Xia Jinyuan, who was preparing to descend the mountain, truly hadn’t expected Qin Xiu to ask when he and Ye Jian would marry. Had it not been for the sudden visit and hasty departure that morning, which informed him of Qin Xiu’s continued affection for Ye Jian, he might have been fooled into believing Qin Xiu had moved on from her.","Questioning himself with a query that would cause him great harm, Xia Jinyuan at this very moment felt admiration for Zou Xiu’s gentlemanly demeanor. Knowing the other party had eyes for his girlfriend, Xia Jinyuan couldn’t muster a hint of disgust for Qin Xiu.","From the beginning, Qin Xiu had been a gentleman.","If the roles were reversed, Xia Jinyuan doubted he could act as Qin Xiu did.","He answered with a smile, \"She just graduated last year and is currently working hard for her career. There’s no rush, marriage will probably take a few more years.\"","A few more years...","Qin Xiu’s eyes hid his raw emotion as he looked down, \"Why not marry earlier? After marriage, one can still work hard for their career.\"","After marrying, he should be able to more resolutely cut off his own yearnings.","\"An Jiaxin wants to marry later, and I respect her wishes. Waiting a few more years to marry won’t affect our relationship, so let’s wait a bit longer. I don’t want marriage to bring her unhappiness. Whatever makes her happy, I will go along with.\"","Although he admired Qin Xiu’s gentlemanly qualities, Xia Jinyuan thought it was still necessary to be on guard and not become complacent."]},{"number":5436,"title":"Chapter 5436: Domineering","paragraphs":["Indeed, the rival was formidable; he couldn’t give him even the slightest opportunity to take advantage.","Qin Xiu released the ice-cold chain, his hand’s strength tight, gripping until deep impressions of the chain were left in his palm. He withdrew his hand, slowly slipping it into his coat pocket, and looked up at Xia Jinyuan with a slight raise of his eyebrow, softly saying, \"Xia Jinyuan, I know you have always been very good to her, and your family has been very good to her too. Grandpa Fu is also very satisfied with you and sees you as the future grandson-in-law.\"","\"You must always treat her very well, never give me a chance. I’ve had my eyes on her for five years, not a single day have I let her go, forgotten her.\"","\"I’ve tried countless times to forget her, but never succeeded, so, you must never give me an opportunity. Because, once I seize the chance, I will definitely...\"","Qin Xiu, speaking softly, paused in the midst of Xia Jinyuan’s cold glare; his gaze sharp as he stared directly, \"Once I get the chance, I will definitely hold on to her firmly, occupy her completely, even if I have to face severe injuries, I will definitely pursue her, leaving you no chance to win her back.\"","\"Remember my words, I mean what I say, so please, don’t give me any opportunity!\"","Having finished his speech, Qin Xiu’s gaze remained steadfastly on Xia Jinyuan. Facing the sudden ferocity from Xia Jinyuan, Qin Xiu confronted it calmly without any hint of fear.","Xia Jinyuan, having survived the battlefield, returned home bearing the aura of blood and violence. But Qin Xiu was no different; though his battlefield held no smoke, a slight misstep would result in being devoured down to his bones. He served his country, braving all dangers fearlessly, facing assassinations without a scare. He cultivated not the actual bloodshed of the battlefield, but an air of quiet strength that frightened his enemies.","Neither servile nor overbearing, composed and elegant, he carried amid his laughter the semblance of numerous flashing blades.","Facing Qin Xiu’s challenge, Xia Jinyuan slightly hooked his lips, saying lightly, \"I spent several years pursuing her, strategizing every step until she nodded in agreement. From the second she agreed to be my girlfriend, I never gave myself a chance to fail her, nor anyone else the opportunity to take advantage.\"","\"So, rest assured, I will definitely treat her well, spending all the sunshine of my remaining life on her. And you, throughout the rest of your life, will absolutely not have even the slightest chance to succeed, you will never have that chance.\"","Qin Xiu looked at him intently for a moment, then nodded, \"Good, I believe you can do it.\"","Don’t give him a chance, he will certainly end his longing for her; but when exactly he can end it, he didn’t know.","Maybe soon, or maybe it will take the rest of his life to break free from those thoughts.","To see her married, see her have children, see her surrounded by her offspring, to think about it... is actually quite beautiful, actually quite willing.","In a pristine white world, a man as elegant as the wind and water stood amid the vast snow suddenly breaking into a smile; that smile, with a gaze clear as the spring light, that smile, made the best scene in this winter’s day.","A gentleman as pure as jade, refined and substantial, that was Qin Xiu.","The two men descended the mountain having never mentioned Ye Jian again, the conversation was ended and there was no need to bring it up again. Xia Jinyuan returned to the Fu family home and immediately went upstairs to the guest room.","The guest room had a landline; he needed to contact Commander Xia to inquire thoroughly what the matter was.","Commander Xia had known that Xia Jinyuan went to the Fu family and had been waiting for him to call. The call coming now made Commander Xia think it was rather late; he should have called in the morning."]},{"number":5437,"title":"Chapter 5437: Tense Suspense","paragraphs":["The father and son duo didn’t stand on ceremony with each other, and Xia Jinyuan had wanted to ask how his old man had been doing lately, as well as the health of the old masters and the Old Madam back at home. Before he could finish his inquiry, Commander Xia had answered all at once.","Holding the telephone handset, Xia Jinyuan’s expression grew pensive and cold for a moment. Sometimes it truly wasn’t that he didn’t want to have a good chat with his old man, it was that his old man really didn’t want to have a good chat with him.","The conversation hadn’t even started before he found himself at an impasse, unable to continue the chat.","So, he moved on to more serious matters.","Commander Xia didn’t realize he had cut the small talk short. Whether things were good at home, whether the elders were fine—if things weren’t alright, the son in the military wouldn’t be able to rush back anyway, so it was better to just say all was well to prevent him from worrying.","This sort of concern was just that rigid.","When it came to the Li family and the many rumors surrounding them, the most pressing issue was whether there were any problems on Ye Jian’s end.","And the problems were indeed massive.","Commander Xia then informed Xia Jinyuan that Ye Jian had been exposed. Listening intently, Xia Jinyuan’s handsome face instantly turned icy, \"How did the investigation lead to Ye Jian? How could military secrets be so easily leaked? Could there have been some mess inside?\"","\"No, there’s no issue on this end. The problem lies with someone else,\" Commander Xia’s face also grew cold, \"Li Ronghuan has some skills; he found out about Martyr Sun Xueqing’s old comrades. Some comrades lost contact after leaving the military and had no way of knowing the twists and turns inside, much less that Li Chuhai had committed crimes. When Li Ronghuan inquired, Ye Jian’s name came up.\"","\"Li Ronghuan is now full of regret. He originally planned to bring the Li family down and then flee the country right away, but now due to Ye Jian, he has stayed to keep a close watch on Madam Li.\"","\"There’s not much of a problem on Madam Li’s side. Out of Old Master Li’s former subordinates who stood at the top of the pyramid and were caught, three are clean and above board, unable to find any wrongdoing with two of them. They are still in their original positions, clean as a whistle. Only those two remain. One of them was also your sister’s former superior, and he turned out to be the deepest hidden subordinate of Old Master Li. Before a thorough investigation, we truly had no idea that he was personally groomed by Old Master Li.\"","Xia Jinyuan’s eyebrows twitched slightly, and his thin lips tightened a little, \"The one from Southern Province before?\"","\"Yes, that’s him.\" Although it’s been over a month since the discovery, Commander Xia still felt shocked. Old Master Li truly had deep roots and lush leaves. If it hadn’t been for Li Chuhai implicating him back then, the current political landscape would probably be very different. With Old Master Li’s vision and strategy, he would have held significant power, not the situation we see today.","Old Master Li’s early retirement was the only good thing Li Chuhai ever did.","Xia Jinyuan fell silent for a while before asking, \"Very clean? Did they talk to my sister?\"","Commander Xia laughed softly before answering, \"They did twice, and your sister said she was clean, with nothing to talk about. Hou Zi, however, ran into a bit of trouble. But luckily, Hou Zi is clever. Apart from mixing up with the underworld in the past, he hasn’t touched drugs or bribery—no such things. He is a smart man, handled his affairs cleanly without leaving any traces, and considering so many years have passed and he’s successfully transformed himself, he was taken in for a few days of ’tea-drinking’ and came out safe and sound.\"","\"Knowing his relationship with the Xia family, they informed the family before bringing him in, without alarming the two elders. Even your sister wasn’t told. To this day, the two elders are still unaware, though your sister knows and isn’t worried about it.\""]},{"number":5438,"title":"Chapter 5438: Be on Guard","paragraphs":["Hou Zi had indeed been involved in the underworld; his actions were more or less unclean, but fortunately, when he was young, he had found Xia Yiwei. Coming from the Xia family, Xia Yiwei imposed many constraints on him. Whenever she saw Hou Zi about to mix with trouble, she immediately reminded him, thereby preventing him from causing serious disasters.","Now, Hou Zi who had been \"invited for tea\" for a week treated Xia Yiwei with the reverence due to an ancestor. The once awe-inspiring Hou Zi, who made both the underworld and lawful society tremble with a mere shake of his foot, now held little status at home. He might appear powerful and commanding outside, with an unknown number of billions in family wealth, but at home, he was willingly subservient as both a wife-worshipper and a doting parent.","Xia Jinyuan was somewhat relieved to hear that Xia Yiwei was not implicated.","\"So now, the Li family is no longer capable of stirring up trouble? Staff Officer Du must be aware of this and has placed a lot of restrictions on Madam Li, right?\"","\"Little Madam Li had initially harbored some thoughts, but alas, when the tree falls, the monkeys scatter. The Li family is in the midst of troubled times, the Li faction is severely damaged, and not one person dared to step forward to promise Little Madam Li. Because of this matter, Little Madam Li ended up so mad that she had to be hospitalized for half a month.\"","Commander Xia frowned at the mention of Little Old Madam Li. This old lady had been a handful in her younger days and, lacking the steadying presence of Old Master Li, she had started causing trouble again with the same energy she had in her youth.","Who would go to such lengths to argue with an elder? No, out of respect for her being a bereaved widow of Old Master Li, they wouldn’t.","But this old lady was truly formidable, taking hold of the fact that people would not hold her accountable, turning it into her license to be troublesome, constantly in motion without a moment of stillness.","In the end, Li Ronghuan stepped in, moving directly back to the Li family’s old residence. The energetic Little Old Madam Li, seeing her family’s backyard unguarded, rushed back to the old residence out of fear that the family business would be taken over. She has since been engaged in a battle of wits with Li Ronghuan.","\"Madam Li is restrained by Staff Officer Du and doesn’t dare to get overly involved. She’s pretty much trapped in the Li family now. The only trouble is the son and daughter of Li Chuhai. National Security has found some traces, and I’m afraid both siblings are up to no good.\"","That Li Chuhai had a son and daughter was no secret; when he returned to the country, he even brought them back, but sadly, it was a ruse. The real ones stayed in Molaban and have never showed their faces, their existence hidden even from the Li family, with no one knowing what they look like.","\"His son, Li Jun, has been back to the country, and National Security here has a photograph of him. As for his daughter, there’s been no news, only that she’s apparently always been in Molaban and hasn’t left.\"","Over the phone, Commander Xia laid out in detail every little thing that Xia Jinyuan wanted to know, including that Li Jun was aware of Ye Jian’s existence, clearly informing Xia Jinyuan of everything.","Now it wasn’t the Li family that Ye Jian needed to be wary of, but the son and daughter of Li Chuhai.","Xia Jinyuan, who had just hung up the phone, sat on the edge of his bed for a long time without getting up.","Molaban, yet again Molaban, the country he had visited most often in recent years. Now, with these lingering ties to Molaban, it seemed likely he would have to go back.","After sitting in his room for a while, Xia Jinyuan collected his thoughts before opening the door and going downstairs. It was not yet dinner time, and there was no one in the living room. Even Qin Xiu, who had returned, was not there. Glancing into the kitchen, he saw Ye Jian and Uncle Fu busy cooking and laughing together.","Just as Xia Jinyuan was about to go in and help, Uncle Fu, who was picking vegetables, immediately smiled and said, \"No, no, don’t come in, go check out the tea room instead. Old Master Qin loves having his grandson as his chess aide. You’d better go and be Old Man Xia’s aide, we can’t afford to lose.\"","Ye Jian also urged him to go, \"Hurry and take a look. I’m not familiar with Go at all, so I can’t be any help. I was quickly chased out by Grandpa Gen when I went in.\""]},{"number":5439,"title":"Chapter 5439: Tenderness","paragraphs":["Qin Xiu, who had come back cold, went straight to the tea room, while Xia Jinyuan first stopped by the kitchen to exchange a few words with Ye Jian before going upstairs. Ye Jian brought the fruit plate to the tea room, actually not intending to stay and watch the game of chess; Old Man Xia then let her go out to continue assisting Uncle Fu.","She faintly sensed... Grandpa, who seemed to be in a hurry to send her out, might have known something.","Xia Jinyuan, whom she pushed along, deliberately stood still. Ye Jian had to nudge him to take a step, and only when she had pushed him out of the kitchen, out of Uncle Fu’s sight, did Xia Jinyuan suddenly embrace Ye Jian’s waist tightly and, with a swift turn, pressed her against the wall, which was already warm from the heating. He enveloped her completely in his embrace, shielding her from any draft, surrounded by his breath alone.","Ye Jian had experienced Xia Jinyuan’s boldness in the bedroom, but but but... this was in the living room, and he he he... he actually... actually took her by surprise like a little white rabbit. She wanted to jump away, but the skilled hunter trapping her didn’t give her a chance to bounce. He easily blocked her path of escape.","Even though Ye Jian progressed each year and didn’t suffer too much whenever she crossed paths with Xia Jinyuan, the fact was, as she improved, so did Xia Jinyuan. His skills grew increasingly profound, easily trapping Ye Jian and leaving her with no way out.","Ye Jian, cornered in the living room, panicked, fearing Uncle Fu from the kitchen might see them, and also fearing the two elders playing chess might come out and bump into them. Her hands hurriedly pressed against Xia Jinyuan’s chest, and she stuttered in a fluster, \"Let go of me quickly. Someone might see us.\"","\"I’m not afraid if they see us.\" Xia Jinyuan was fearless, his arms tightly encircling Ye Jian’s slender waist. While speaking, his handsome face came close enough for his dignified nose to touch Ye Jian’s, \"Do you know what Qin Xiu and I talked about outside? Do you want to know? Hm?\"","Comrade Xia Jinyuan, who wouldn’t give a love rival the slightest chance, now came to his girlfriend to act aggrieved. They say a crying child gets the most milk, a truth... let’s just say that Xia Jinyuan has known it since he was a child.","If he didn’t know it, how could he have ever escaped from beneath Commander Xia’s belt? That was because he knew how to cry. When other kids faced the descending belt, they would stiffen their necks and stubbornly refuse to bow and admit their mistakes. Xia Jinyuan was different; Commander Xia’s belt hadn’t even touched him when he would start howling so pitifully, it startled everyone in the courtyard.","The lesson he learned in childhood was not forgotten as he grew up; on the contrary, he applied it even more adeptly.","Hearing this, Ye Jian felt uneasy in her heart and asked in a barely audible voice, \"What did he say? Are you angry? He shouldn’t... He shouldn’t have said anything, should he?\"","Ye Jian truly believed in Qin Xiu’s character; if Grandpa said he was good, he must be good.","No sooner had she finished speaking than she saw her own man’s face turn a shade darker. Ye Jian’s eyes grew serious, realizing she had said something wrong, and she quickly tried to reassure him, \"Don’t worry, don’t worry. Even if he said something, it won’t matter to me, and you shouldn’t dwell on it either. There’s no need.\"","Could he really have said something?","Impossible.","Qin Xiu wasn’t the type to speak recklessly.","The placating Xia Jinyuan revealed a hint of a profound smile, \"I’m not dwelling on it, but somehow, having one’s girlfriend admired by someone else for so many years doesn’t feel great. And somehow, I feel like you quite admire him, don’t you?\"","\"Indeed, I do admire him, for his character and for his professional ability.\" Ye Jian didn’t avoid the subject; she would clarify what needed to be clarified, and since there was nothing between her and Qin Xiu, there really was no need to evade."]},{"number":5440,"title":"Chapter 5440: Failure to Gain Sympathy","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan had intended to act a bit aggrieved to gain Ye Jian’s sympathy, but as she spoke so seriously, it made him feel too embarrassed to continue. After thinking for a bit, he responded, \"Yes, he is indeed a good person, so, you see, I’m very worried, very worried.\"","While speaking, he took Ye Jian’s hand and pressed it to his chest, \"Here, it’s completely broken.\"","In the corridor leading to the chess room, Qin Xiu, who had been listening the whole time while holding a thermos bottle, finally couldn’t bear it anymore and stepped forward, \"I didn’t say anything, don’t listen to his nonsense.\"","With only one hand wrapped around Ye Jian’s waist and the other holding her hand against his chest, a gap had been left in the encirclement. Qin Xiu’s sudden appearance startled Ye Jian into a little bunny, her hands frantically pushing Xia Jinyuan away and instantly jumping out of his embrace.","The sugar-seeking Xia Jinyuan truly hadn’t expected Qin Xiu to suddenly appear. His arms suddenly empty, he looked down and coughed softly with his fist at his mouth, then said to Qin Xiu, \"I haven’t said anything yet.\"","\"You haven’t said anything, but you’ve already said so much,\" Qin Xiu, approaching with the thermos, stood tall and straight beside Ye Jian, his finely arched brows slightly furrowed, \"Does he usually bully you like this?\"","What Qin Xiu meant by bullying was taking advantage.","The questioned Ye Jian was still feeling quite embarrassed. Hearing this, she looked up at Qin Xiu, then turned her gaze to her own man to defend him, \"No, he really didn’t say anything just now. He even said that you are indeed a good person.\"","Her defense made Qin Xiu’s heart feel a slight pang, so protective of Xia Jinyuan; she truly placed Xia Jinyuan at the very top of her heart.","\"Do you want to know what exactly I talked about with him outside just now?\" Qin Xiu, covering the pang in his heart, looked unwaveringly at Ye Jian, \"If you want to know, I can tell you right now.\"","Xia Jinyuan stretched out his hand and pulled his girlfriend, whose earlobes were still reddish, into his arms, glaring warningly at Qin Xiu, \"Qin Xiu, the old masters are thirsty and waiting for your boiling water to make tea.\"","As their gazes met, it was like a bucket of cold water was poured over his head. Seeing Xia Jinyuan so tense, Qin Xiu suddenly thought of something, his refined and handsome face then revealed a relaxed smile, as tranquil as the time Ye Jian saw him standing in the sunlight waiting for someone through the glass, poised and incomparably elegant.","\"Don’t be nervous, as long as you remember our conversation today, you will never need to be nervous,\" Qin Xiu said with a slight smile. After a deep glance at Xia Jinyuan, he turned to look at Ye Jian, \"Don’t be shy, it’s normal for you two to have some physical contact after not seeing each other for a long time. Grandpa Fu even thinks it shows how good your relationship is, and he’s very reassured.\"","It turned out that Xia Jinyuan was not as composed in front of him as he had seemed on the mountain; in fact, he was nervous. He was very anxious about this potential rival in love, anxious that one day he would stand up and compete with him for his girlfriend.","That was not bad.","Having him a bit anxious would make him treat Ye Jian even better, the better he treated Ye Jian, the less chance he would have, and thus, Ye Jian would be very happy, and he... might finally let go.","Qin Xiu walked past the couple, catching sight of Ye Jian’s reddened earlobes from the corner of his eye, his mouth couldn’t help but curl up a lot, really... very shy, very cute.","He went into the kitchen and naturally greeted Uncle Fu, who let him pour the hot water himself, evidently treating Qin Xiu like family.","Meanwhile, Xia Jinyuan was silently enduring the tender assault from his girlfriend, repeatedly begging for mercy, \"I was wrong, I was wrong, I really was wrong, I won’t dare again, I won’t dare again. Go easy, go easy, it hurts.\"","Ye Jian, who was pinching his waist, said with a grin that did not reach her eyes, \"Do you really know what you did wrong? Huh? Do you really understand?\"","\"I do, I really do...\""]},{"number":5441,"title":"Chapter 5441: Deduction","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan repeatedly begged for mercy, and Ye Jian finally let go of her hand. She feared that he might continue to be frivolous, so she glared at him, \"Don’t follow me, go upstairs and rest.\"","She still needed to continue helping Uncle Fu in the kitchen; first, she had to send this troublemaker upstairs to rest.","Xia Jinyuan actually had important matters to discuss with her. Rubbing the waist pinched by his girlfriend, he glanced sideways at the kitchen and said to Qin Xiu who had not yet come out, \"Ambassador Qin, please help in the kitchen first. Ye Jian and I will come and take over later.\"","\"No need, no need, I’m not busy here,\" Uncle Fu hurriedly declined, \"You work hard every day, and when you come home, you should rest properly. I’ll handle the kitchen duties. If you’re bored, you can play cards or watch TV. Just don’t come into the kitchen and get in my way.\"","Uncle Fu, who came from a cooking squad, had always taken care of Old Man Xia, and kitchen chores were never a problem for him; it was more convenient for him to move around the kitchen alone.","Ye Jian had been kicked out of the kitchen by Uncle Fu twice without success, only relenting to her persistence to let her help.","Qin Xiu was also shooed out by Uncle Fu, and he said calmly to Xia Jinyuan, \"Uncle Fu thinks I’m in the way, and you have your own matters...\" Glancing at Xia Jinyuan, thinking about his sudden descent from halfway up the mountain, the astute diplomat guessed Xia Jinyuan must have urgent matters to discuss with Ye Jian, \"You go ahead. I’ll take care of the two elders.\"","Xia Jinyuan didn’t stand on ceremony and took Ye Jian upstairs.","Standing in the living room, Qin Xiu’s gaze slightly intensified, contemplative for a while before he returned to the game room. Urgent matters? What urgent matters suddenly required finding Ye Jian?","Coming down the mountain, he hadn’t seen him seeking Ye Jian, but instead, he went to the upstairs guest rooms.","Something wasn’t right.","Stopping suddenly at the entrance of the tea room, Qin Xiu had mentioned the Li family, talked about the death of Li Chuhai, discussed Old Master Li’s possible death from rage in the hospital, and also mentioned the rumors in the capital about the Li family, immediately after which Xia Jinyuan had said that he would come down here.","Had Xia Jinyuan come down because he heard about the Li family?","Li family? Xia family?","The two families had no grudges or dealings; why did Xia Jinyuan seem so concerned?","He didn’t appear concerned — when he mentioned the Li family, Xia Jinyuan’s expression was calm, showing no unusual reaction. So why would he...","Wait...","Qin Xiu’s hand, holding the hot water bottle, suddenly turned cold, a shadow crossing his refined face. Li Chuhai... had been killed, though it was unclear where. It would not have been difficult for Old Master Li to protect Li Chuhai and enable him to flee the country.","Yet he had still not escaped and had been killed.","Could it be... Li Chuhai was killed by the military? Is that why Xia Jinyuan thought of coming down the mountain immediately?","If that was the case, it would explain why he suddenly said he needed to come down.","Qin Xiu took a deep breath to calm the storm inside his heart and pushed open the door of the tea room. The two elders were still enthusiastically \"battling\" each other, occasionally complaining about the other’s slow moves, or too much talking, joyfully playing chess for nearly three hours like two children.","Upstairs, after hearing what Xia Jinyuan had said, Ye Jian pondered for a moment before saying, \"It doesn’t matter if they know, and nobody has confirmed it to them; I’m not worried.\"","\"Old Master Li has passed away, and Madam Li is currently locked in a battle of wits with her stepson, while Madam Li is closely watched by Staff Officer Du; even if she knows, she can do nothing to me because Staff Officer Du won’t let her cause any trouble.\""]},{"number":5442,"title":"Chapter 5442: Analysis","paragraphs":["Ye Jian, sitting on the bed, analyzed slowly, her voice clear and melodious, without a hint of panic.","\"I heard from Uncle Xia that Staff Officer Du has always been fair in official matters, abiding by the law and regulations. The occasional minor mistake—one that would neither damage his reputation nor affect his career—happened, but before, Old Master Li indeed supported his son-in-law. However, in the later stages, Staff Officer Du himself couldn’t stand Old Master Li’s actions and took the initiative to request a transfer elsewhere, where he then ran into Uncle Xia.\"","\"Therefore, I don’t need to worry about Staff Officer Du. The only thing to worry about is Li Chuhai’s twins. They could be somewhat tricky, but there’s no need for excessive concern.\"","\"I’m in the military, they are in the country, and now they’ve been blacklisted, preventing their return. Naturally, they can’t do anything to me. It wasn’t easy for Staff Officer Du to climb to where he is today; surely he won’t ruin his decades of hard work because of a criminal.\"","\"If Madam Li wants to do something foolish, we won’t even need to step in. Staff Officer Du, as her husband, won’t let her off easily. Oh, right, what about Madam Li’s eldest son? What is he like?\"","\"I was once assigned to the regiment he was in charge of. Du Jiayi tried to make things difficult for me, but that very afternoon, she vanished. Zhou Yijin later told me that Du Jiayi was scolded by her brother and left crying, dragging her suitcase.\"","Ye Jian was not too familiar with Kaiwei, who was also in the military, but she was aware that he had some unresolved issues with Xia family’s eldest brother, Xia Ling, a situation similar to Staff Officer Du and Uncle Xia.","Both pairs were like kings avoiding each other’s presence, as the saying goes, ’If both cannot stand each other, why bring the disciple into the light?’","Xia Jinyuan saw her analyzing the situation seriously, without a trace of worry on her face, and he couldn’t help but admire her composure. Leaning over, he lightly brushed the tip of her nose with his slender finger and smiled, dispelling her doubts, \"Kaiwei is not bad, the eldest son of Father Xiao, inherited his father’s somewhat narrow-mindedness. Aside from that, he’s good at keeping his public and private affairs separate and is quite capable of keeping his younger siblings in line.\"","\"That year, when Madam Li’s youngest son got into a fight and was taken into custody, Madam Li tried to bail him out immediately. It was Kaiwei who intervened to stop her and intentionally asked the police not to give any special treatment to his brother for the sake of the Du family. He said to deal with it as they would normally.\"","\"Because of this incident, he received a record and couldn’t join the military, and there were rumors that he harbored resentment against Kaiwei for them. Kaiwei told him, ’You still get to enjoy the sun, do business, and fly all over the world, surrounded by people. Have any of those involved in the fight with you met a good end?’\"","\"After showing those with whom he fought’s records to his brother, peace prevailed at home, and even Madam Li didn’t dare blame her eldest son for her youngest’s inability to join the army.\"","\"From these small incidents, one can see that Kaiwei is quite a commendable person. Also, he is someone who understands the importance of gratitude. Ye Zhifan once saved him unintentionally, and Kaiwei kept it in mind and immediately arranged for Ye Ying to join the military through his family, but unfortunately, turmoil ensued, and Kaiwei was also implicated.\"","This was also why, later on, Madam Li targeted Ye Ying with such ruthless determination, likely because both her husband and son had been implicated by the association.","Hearing all this, Ye Jian felt even more at ease about Madam Li’s side of things. She clapped her hands together, laughing crisply and clearly, \"Well, that settles it. Madam Li won’t pose any problem, and we really don’t need to worry about anything.\"","Ye Jian, aware of the Li family knowing about her only recently, showed no undue concern. Facing the potential dangers with great calmness, she said, \"You can also relax a bit. Neither the Old Madam Li nor Madam Li will be able to stir up any trouble.\"","\"And since the twins can’t come to our country, they won’t cause any trouble either.\""]},{"number":5443,"title":"Chapter 5443: Calm","paragraphs":["She was optimistic, but Xia Jinyuan was still worried. After thinking it over, he decided to tell her the reason for his concern truthfully, \"Li Jun can’t enter the country anymore, but his sister can.\"","\"So far, National Security has not been able to find out his sister’s basic personal information. Her height and appearance remain unknown. Therefore, it is very easy for her to return to our country and enter our borders without any trouble.\"","That was why Xia Jinyuan was worried, and even Commander Xia was concerned about Ye Jian because of Li Jun’s sister.","Foreign powers have always been rampant. If they infiltrated our country and harmed Ye Jian... The late Principal Chen would be a lesson from the past.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t mention Principal Chen, for fear that bringing it up would sadden Ye Jian.","Ye Jian remained very optimistic, patting her man on the shoulder and saying with deep feeling, \"Lieutenant Colonel Xia, what’s bound to come will come, and worrying won’t help. Instead of worrying, why not think about how to root out any hidden dangers in advance?\"","\"I believe National Security will definitely find a way to get Li Jun’s sister’s personal details. If not, I’ll ask my brother to contact that helpful Uncle Li to see if he can find something.\"","Xia Jinyuan couldn’t help but chuckle, \"What you’ve thought of, they have already considered. Li Ronghuan, feeling guilty for unintentionally betraying you and then finding out you’re the Demon King’s sister, has decided not to settle in New Zealand. Instead, he has moved back to Li family’s old residence, keeping an eye on Old Madam Li.\"","\"On the surface, he appears to be fighting for the Li family’s inheritance, but in truth, he’s closely watching the Li family for your sake.\"","\"Then I really should thank Uncle Li. Hey, with him helping out, isn’t that good for my brother?\" She got ahead of herself, getting concerned for her own brother before sorting out her affairs.","Looking into Ye Jian’s eyes, which held not a trace of gloom, Xia Jinyuan was also defeated by her optimism. Not only did he lightly flick her nose, but he also pulled her into his arms and gave her a good rub before saying, \"It seems that Li Ronghuan might truly be the only member of the Li family who’s good to the Demon King. If you want to know more, you can ask the Demon King.\"","\"Don’t rumple my hair; it’s turning into a bird’s nest.\" Ye Jian protested as his large hands tousled her hair, lifting her head from within his warm, broad chest, looking straight at the man who was worried about her, \"Don’t worry about me. With so many people helping me, I will definitely be fine.\"","Even Uncle Li, who had never met her before, had given up going abroad because of her and her brother, returning to the Li family to pit wits against Old Madam Li and Madam Li. With so many people helping her, she would definitely be fine.","She wouldn’t allow herself to be harmed because... she hadn’t yet found the murderer of Uncle Chen. Therefore, she wouldn’t let anything happen to herself; she couldn’t afford a single accident!","Xia Jinyuan caught a fleeting glimpse of malice flash across her eyes and understood the source of that malice without needing to ask.","Once again pulling her into his embrace, he planted a gentle kiss in her hair, \"Yes, you’re absolutely right. With so many people quietly supporting you, how could anything happen to you?\"","\"For yourself, for those who help you, and for us who love you, you must make sure nothing happens to you,\" he added.","Ye Jian wrapped her hands around his waist and nodded lightly, \"Nothing will happen. If she really comes to the country, it’s actually a good thing for us. As long as she appears around me, I will definitely recognize her.\"","\"Silly girl, there’s a technique known as plastic surgery nowadays. If she enters our country and doesn’t do anything bad, we might not be able to recognize her at all.\""]},{"number":5444,"title":"Chapter 5444: Celebration","paragraphs":["Ye Jian: \"...\" I almost forgot there’s still that technique!\"","\"Besides appearance, there’s also temperament and gaze. There’s always something off,\" Ye Jian said, burying his head and choosing to think of the situation in the most optimistic way.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t take the matter seriously anymore. As she said, what is meant to happen will happen, so might as well face it calmly.","The two of them had been sitting upstairs for about an hour when a knocking sound came from outside, followed by Qin Xiu’s voice, \"Excuse me, I need you two to come out and help persuade the two elders.\"","The knocking was very cautious, as if afraid to disturb the two inside.","The two got up, and Xia Jinyuan opened the door. Qin Xiu immediately noticed that the bed in the guest room had traces of only two people sitting close together. He glanced briefly and did not think about anything else, his expression slightly resigned as he said to Ye Jian, \"Hurry and persuade the two elders. They ended their chess game in a draw and decided to jog outside a bit to celebrate...\"","Ye Jian couldn’t help but laugh and cry; Old Master Qin and Grandpa were both like mischievous old children.","Deciding to go out for a jog because the chess game ended in a draw was indeed something Ye Jian was hearing for the first time.","Qin Xiu was helpless to stop them and had to go upstairs to seek help from Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan, hoping that they could persuade the old master and Old Man Xia to come back.","But even the intervention of the two was useless. The two naughty elders ran around the outside yard twice, bringing back a chill before they returned to the house.","The three hurried to attend to them. The two elders didn’t care at all. Old Master Qin reminisced about the days he and several late senior leaders spent together, full of nostalgia as he sighed to the busy Ye Jian, \"Back then, your grandpa and I accompanied the senior leader. In the dead of winter, we climbed Taishan and the Great Wall, and even went to the bordering town.\"","\"That year, your grandpa made quite a stir right during the dead of winter. I was at the State Guesthouse briefing foreign guests when the senior leader received the news. The next day, after seeing off the foreign guests, he immediately took a special plane to your grandpa’s workplace.\"","\"That place was all snow, and the temperature during the day was below minus twenty degrees. Your grandpa ran, jumped, and laughed in the snow with the data in his arms. The senior leader watched him for five minutes and even teared up.\"","Speaking of the past, Old Man Xia seemed to feel as if everything had happened just yesterday. Grasping his cane in both hands, he recalled the memories seared into his soul, as described by Old Master Qin. A deep smile crossed his weathered face, \"Back then, I was young and not afraid of the cold. Even in such thick snow, I could run around.\"","\"The senior leader later told me, seeing my vigor, he knew my foundation was solid, and I could work in scientific research for another fifty years!\"","\"And he really hit the nail on the head, another fifty years just flew by in the blink of an eye. Thinking about it, it really seems like it all happened just yesterday.\"","\"I’m old, really old now,\" Old Man Xia took the hot tea Ye Jian handed him and said with a smile to Old Master Qin, \"I’ve already accepted my age, are you still trying to prove something?\"","Old Master Qin also drank the hot tea, waved his hand in response, \"There’s no denying I’m old. My heart’s still racing from that run. We can’t do this next time, wouldn’t want to frighten these young ones.\"","And wasn’t that the case? Qin Xiu’s face was still dark, \"You and Grandpa Fu had a cold together recently. I know it must be the two of you braving the snow again that got you sick. Like this time, even if you’re happy, you need to know your limits.\"","Ye Jian narrowed his eyes, \"Grandpa, you just said you’ve never even had a cold.\""]},{"number":5445,"title":"Chapter 5445: Persuasion","paragraphs":["Ye Jian asked the old man how he had been feeling lately, and Uncle Fu actually wanted to tell her the truth. However, the old man had instructed Uncle Fu to absolutely not tell the truth, so as not to worry Ye Jian and affect her work. He also mentioned that he was completely recovered now and as long as he didn’t speak of it, Uncle Fu wouldn’t either, so Ye Jian was unaware that the old man had caught a cold.","Thinking it over, Uncle Fu agreed with the old man’s perspective and ultimately sided with him, not wishing to worry Ye Jian. Even when she inquired in detail while helping out in the kitchen, Uncle Fu still didn’t reveal the true situation to her.","Now that Qin Xiu had unexpectedly revealed it, the old man fell silent for a long while. Then, seeing Ye Jian’s expression turn serious, the old man and Old Master Qin exchanged glances with each other, and silently gave Qin Xiu a look. This child, wasn’t he usually quite clever? How could he drop the ball at such a critical moment?","Qin Xiu remained unmoved and said coolly, \"If I can’t persuade you both, then I must rely on a savior who can. Grandpa Fu, Ye Jian rarely comes home once a year, and what worries her the most is you. If you don’t take good care of your health, how can she work with peace of mind?\"","The old man nodded in agreement, \"That’s right, I have to take good care of myself. I still want to see my great-grandson with my own eyes, don’t I?\"","Xia Jinyuan quite liked what he was hearing and immediately smiled, saying, \"At that time, I’m afraid we’ll still need to trouble you with helping us take care of the child.\"","The old man loved hearing that, seemingly imagining himself looking after his great-grandson in the future, and happily continued the conversation, \"If I still have the energy, I will definitely take him around to have fun.\"","\"If you want to enjoy your time with the great-grandson, then you must take good care of yourself first. Like today, with the snow not stopping and the wind being strong, you and Old Master Qin were so happy that you went out for a round in the snowstorm. We, as the younger generation, understand your happiness, but we hope even more for your health and well-being, free from illness and disaster.\"","Xia Jinyuan was skilled at cheering up the elderly, and with a few words, he had coaxed the old man into high spirits, and he promised to take very good care of his health and to absolutely not allow himself to fall sick.","Uncle Fu in the kitchen heard this and couldn’t help but smile, thinking that the young master from the Xia family really knew how to handle matters.","After listening, Qin Xiu felt as if he had touched on something profound. Looking at the joyous old man and Old Master Qin, who was also happily joining in, Qin Xiu reflected thoughtfully.","After dinner, Xia Jinyuan went back to the Xia family’s old residence. Ye Jian wanted to go along, and the old man also wanted Ye Jian to come over and visit the Xia family’s old master and Old Madam. Xia Jinyuan didn’t want Ye Jian to run back and forth; she could just come over the next afternoon and stay for dinner as well.","He considered that if she went with him tonight, she would inevitably have to stay overnight at the old mansion, and knowing that the old man hadn’t seen Ye Jian in a long time, he probably had some private matters he wanted to discuss with her after everyone else had left. With such thoughtful consideration, he went back to the Xia family’s old residence alone.","Once Xia Jinyuan had left, Old Master Qin and Qin Xiu also departed together.","On the way home, Old Master Qin, while being supported by Qin Xiu as he walked slowly, sighed and said, \"Grandpa won’t rush you, but I’m thinking you also need to speed up a bit. Just now, when I heard Little Six mention about a great-grandson, my heart felt so happy.\"","\"Grandpa is old now; living one more day is one day less. I’m not sure if I’ll be able to enjoy my next meal properly after today’s, and perhaps after having this good chat with you, by tomorrow morning Grandpa might be gone.\"","Qin Xiu frowned, \"Grandpa, you’re fine right now, don’t talk like that.\""]},{"number":5446,"title":"Chapter 5446: Heart-to-heart Talk","paragraphs":["\"Hahaha, what’s there to hide? The facts are right in front of us, plain as day. There’s nothing that can’t be said.\" Old Master Qin could see things in perspective; at their age, every day lived was one day less, and their time was a countdown.","Qin Xiu pursed his lips tight, \"You and grandma are fine, just wait until my sister gets married and has a baby. You and grandma will get to help raise your great-grandchild.\"","\"Hahaha, your sister is married into another family. If she really has a great-grandchild, it would be up to her in-laws to look after, not brought to our Qin family.\"","Raising a great-grandchild was indeed something Old Master Qin had thought about, but it wasn’t just a simple wish.","It wasn’t like the Xia and Fu families, living so close to each other.","\"Today, your sister brought that young military officer to visit, and even stole the family register for his sake. It’s clear that barring any accidents, they will smoothly tie the knot. The officer’s family is in a small county town. If the in-laws want to take care of the great-grandchild, your sister wouldn’t stop them, would she?\"","\"Even though he said that he became a soldier on his own and isn’t on great terms with his family, once the child is born, what grandparents would not care for their grandchild? Even if that officer doesn’t care about his family, the grandparents would still come looking on their own.\"","Old Master Qin dared not even dream of having to care for his granddaughter’s great-grandchild; what he envisioned was caring for the great-grandchildren born to Qin Xiu.","After some thought, Old Master Qin sighed with a smile, \"Xiu, there are some things we can’t force. Trying too hard is only making it hard on ourselves. Grandpa knows you best; you’d rather inconvenience yourself than others. Living like that is very exhausting.\"","\"You already have enough pressure at work. If even in your personal life, you never find ease and can’t find someone close to your heart with whom you can laugh and talk freely, your days will become harder and harder, and you might even find your whole life bleak.\"","\"Even if you pour all your passion into your work to fill the void in your life, you’ll still be exhausted. Over time, you might even lose interest in your work.\"","\"Do you think what grandpa is saying makes sense? Isn’t it just like that?\"","The distance from the Fu family to the Qin family was not far, just three or four hundred meters. Old Master Qin wanted to have a chat with his grandson, and taking advantage of the fact that the snow had stopped, he slowed his pace and chatted as they walked.","Qin Xiu’s heart skipped a beat upon hearing his grandfather’s words, \"I’m not forcing anything, don’t worry.\"","\"Do you still need to hide things in front of your grandpa? I can tell that there’s someone in your heart just by looking at you. You don’t say, and grandpa won’t ask.\"","Aside from Old Master Fu, only Old Madam knew about Qin Xiu’s feelings for Ye Jian. But Old Madam did not tell Old Master, she wanted to keep this secret for her grandson out of fear that the old man, in the midst of plotting his chess game, would reveal all to Old Master Fu.","Ye Jian had a boyfriend, and knowing this, Qin Xiu still harbored feelings for her; Old Madam felt that the fewer people knew about it, the better, and so she even kept Old Master Qin in the dark.","When Qin Xiu heard this, he knew that Old Master wasn’t aware of the situation and he couldn’t help but feel relieved, yet there was also an inexplicable sense of loss. If he knew... could another scenario have unfolded?","As this thought emerged, Qin Xiu immediately stopped himself, reminding himself not to entertain such crooked thoughts.","Even if Grandpa knew, in the love story of Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan, there was no room for him to step in.","Slowing down, he walked home alongside his talking grandfather, under the yellowed streetlights that cast a dreamlike thin golden sheen on the pristine snow, occasionally twinkling like brilliant diamonds."]},{"number":5447,"title":"Chapter 5447: Heart-to-Heart","paragraphs":["Old Master Qin gently patted Qin Xiu’s arm, which tightly clung to his own, and continued lovingly, \"You are a child with goals and aspirations, deeply in love with our motherland, willing to dedicate your entire life to serving our homeland. Grandpa also walked through such a passionate age and understands you completely, even if you tell Grandpa now that for the sake of strengthening our country’s foreign relations, you wish to remain unmarried for life, Grandpa would understand.\"","\"But Xiu, Grandpa is no saint; his heart is soft. Grandpa can understand you, but he truly does not wish to see you all alone, and it pains his heart.\"","\"Find a girlfriend with shared ideals, like Ye Jian and Little Six of the Xia family, both soldiers with common goals. Even separated by thousands of miles, they continue hand in hand striving toward their mutual goal, thus, they are connected by an invisible bond, no matter how far apart they are, their hearts are together.\"","\"Such love is not merely personal but a sublimation on the spiritual level, a fusion of two souls, which as time goes by, does not lose strength from prolonged separation, but rather, like aged wine, becomes ever more fragrant.\"","\"Grandpa hopes you can find such a girlfriend. We won’t force it, nor should you seek another just to forget someone else; that would be unfair to the next person, and Grandpa does not approve.\"","\"Your uncle made a mistake, and although Grandpa accepted Qin Yi back into the Qin family, it was because his child was innocent, but your uncle... Grandpa will never forgive him in this lifetime.\"","\"You must remember, we must not use our youth as an excuse to err, nor should we comfort ourselves by thinking everyone has experienced youthful folly or has made mistakes in their youth.\"","\"Youthful folly—that’s youth in luxurious and reckless splendor; because of youthful dreams, one may do reckless and immature things. But all errors must not contravene morality, principles, or step on others’ pain, preying on others’ vitality and blood.\"","\"Remember Grandpa’s words, walk your own path well. If some people or things are hopeless, you need to be able to pick up and let go. Understand?\"","\"Grandpa has no other hopes; he only hopes you can find a like-minded lover to share your life with, through thick and thin, never abandoning each other.\"","Old Master Qin spoke softly, with persuasion, comfort, and admonishment.","Qin Xiu was his most beloved grandson, also the most promising one to carry forward the Qin family’s legacy. He hoped his most beloved grandson could find happiness, not having to sacrifice his own happiness for the sake of the family, marrying a girl with a matched family background arranged by Mrs. Qin, solely because she was a match for their Qin family.","Qin Xiu listened earnestly, taking in every word of the old master’s speech, \"I will find a girl with shared ideals, who resonates with my own heart. Grandpa, you can rest assured.\"","\"Don’t worry about me; I will handle my affairs well. And please do not be upset because of some things my mother has done; she does not mean anything by it, only trying to find a girl well-matched in social status, who won’t hold me back.\"","\"It’s not her fault for thinking this way; rather, it’s the prevailing attitude in the capital city. To ally with the strong through marriage is the most effective and convenient strategy for advancement.\"","\"But my mother is mistaken; our Qin family does not need any alliances or marriage for support, as I do not pursue politics, so there is absolutely no need for that.\"","\"I will have another talk with my mother. You and grandma don’t need to worry.\""]},{"number":5448,"title":"Chapter 5448 Suddenly","paragraphs":["Qin Xiu could see through people, which put Old Master Qin’s mind at ease.","When it was time to sleep at night, Old Master Qin discussed the matter with his wife. After a long, long time, the Old Madam said, \"Our grandson has set his heart on someone too outstanding, so outstanding that it would be difficult for him to find another good girl.\"","\"Sometimes I watch Dingkang’s wife scouting for girls everywhere. I don’t get involved and let her be, isn’t it because I also want to see if Dingkang’s wife can find a girl more outstanding than the one in our grandson’s heart?\"","\"Now it seems I was wrong, and you were the clearheaded one. Whether the girl is outstanding or not doesn’t really matter, what matters is that our grandson must like her, and the girl must also like our grandson.\"","\"When there’s mutual affection and shared aspirations, their life together will undoubtedly be fulfilling.\"","Old Master Qin, who had been lying down, felt something was off after hearing this, \"No, that’s not right, my dear. You’re hiding something from me. Qin Xiu has someone in his heart, and you know who.\"","\"I don’t know. Why do you have so many questions at night? Get some rest. Tomorrow Ying will bring her boyfriend over, and you can take a good look then. Although the young man has honestly admitted that his relationship with his family isn’t great because of his military service, you should ask him in detail whether there are other issues besides this one.\"","\"The young man’s honesty is true, but we can’t just take it at face value and not ask about his family’s situation. The whole family are teachers; why would a son raised by them have a poor relationship with the family? I’m afraid there might be other issues at play here.\"","Old Madam Qin immediately changed the subject, and Old Master Qin knew his wife’s temperament too well; she wouldn’t speak even if the higher-ups came to ask, her lips sealed tighter than a clamshell. In the past, she would have been someone who faced death without yielding, a martyr of honor.","Without further questions, Old Master Qin lay thinking for a while, not realizing when he had fallen asleep.","Around two in the morning, Ye Jian, who had been sound asleep, suddenly was roused by the sound of an ambulance siren whizzing past her ears before it stopped and continued to wail incessantly. Ye Jian’s eyes snapped open, and without even slipping on her shoes, she ran barefoot to the window and pushed it open.","Without the window’s soundproofing, the ambulance’s siren was even clearer.","The sound was coming from the Qin residence.","Old Man Xia, who was a light sleeper, woke up too. The soundproofing in Dan Gui Garden villas was usually quite good, but at this still hour of night everything was so quiet, and the two homes were close, so it naturally reached his ears as well.","Ye Jian quickly got dressed and ran downstairs, just in time to see Old Man Xia also getting up. The guard sleeping in the downstairs guest room and Uncle Fu were also on their feet.","\"Girl, go check out what happened at the Qin house. An ambulance coming in the middle of the night must mean someone in their family has had an accident,\" Old Man Xia said as he saw Ye Jian dressed appropriately and immediately instructed, \"You go help out, tonight only Xiu is staying at their house.\"","Ye Jian nodded. \"Alright, you stay inside. I’ll go take a look right now.\"","Ye Jian would have gone to check even without Old Man Xia’s instructions. With her and Chief Engineer Fu often absent from home over the years, they were grateful to the Qin family for their care. Now that something might have happened there, she felt it was only right for her to go and help.","Old Man Xia wanted a guard to accompany her, but Ye Jian refused, \"No need, you have to be taken care of too. I’m quick, and I’ll call you once I’m there.\"","Old Man Xia had some knowledge of what Ye Jian did for a living, so he let her go alone, and then sat waiting in the living room.","In less than five minutes, the living room’s landline rang, and the guard answered immediately, hearing Ye Jian’s voice on the line."]},{"number":5449,"title":"Chapter 5449: Shocking","paragraphs":["Old Man Xia, learning that an old friend was ill, couldn’t help but panic, even contemplating accompanying him to the hospital himself.","Uncle Fu, noticing what was on Old Man Xia’s mind, stepped forward to persuade him, \"You should stay at home and rest. If you go to the hospital, An Jiaxin will have to divide her attention to take care of you. She will worry if you strain yourself going to the hospital in the middle of the night, and she might become too tired to care for Grandma Qin.\"","Only after these words did Old Man Xia agree to stay, knowing that visiting the hospital wouldn’t help his friend and fearing he might be a burden to the younger generation, who would have to take care of him instead.","So be it, he would wait at home.","Seeing that Old Man Xia had dropped the idea of going to the hospital, Uncle Fu felt relieved and said, \"You go back to your room and rest for now. I will contact An Jiaxin later to inquire about Old Master Qin’s condition. Does that sound acceptable to you?\"","Old Man Xia, no longer insistent, nodded his head and was helped back to his bedroom by the guards to wait for news.","Meanwhile, Ye Jian sat in the Qin family’s private car, clutching Grandma Qin’s arm, softly saying, \"Grandma Qin, don’t worry. The doctors have said not to worry, let’s listen to them. Grandpa Qin has doctors and nurses taking care of him, so he will certainly be safe and sound.\"","The sudden convulsions of Old Master Qin had frightened Grandma Qin, who usually had a sturdier constitution than Old Man Xia, rarely suffering even minor colds. His sudden collapse frightened even the stalwart Old Madam.","\"Your Grandpa Qin was always well, and to suddenly fall like that, I was frightened too. It’s tough on you tonight, girl, having to come out in the cold to take care of me. Xiu should have checked with you first before making you come and look after me, ah... I’m troubling you.\"","When Ye Jian arrived at the Qin residence, she saw the medical staff attending to Old Master Qin. The guards assigned to take care of Old Master Qin and Old Man Xia had emergency training, which helped buy precious golden time for Old Master Qin’s rescue.","Upon seeing Ye Jian, Qin Xiu, without any hesitation, asked her to look after the old madam. Ye Jian agreed immediately without a second thought, as she had come to see if there was any need for her assistance anyway.","Holding hands with the old madam, Ye Jian spoke softly, \"Grandma Qin, you’re being too formal with me. You’re my elder, so how could it be tough to take care of you? It’s what I should do, and I’m actually afraid of being in your way.\"","Ye Jian was not usually eloquent, but each word she spoke conveyed her sincerity, touching Grandma Qin. She gripped the hand within her arm tightly and sighed, \"Child, you’re truly a delightful person.\"","Unfortunately, she had no destined bond with her grandson, Qin Xiu. Although Qin Xiu liked her, and she liked him, they just weren’t meant to be, and it was a missed opportunity that led to regrets.","Xiu never truly let go of her, and Grandma Qin sighed repeatedly in her heart. She patted Ye Jian’s hand and lightly said, \"Good child,\" she indeed was. It was their Qin family’s misfortune to miss out on her. Old Master Qin still had no idea that the girl his grandson held dear was Jian.","When her husband awoke, she would find an opportunity to tell him.","Thinking of her partner, Grandma Qin’s eyes filled with tears; he simply couldn’t have anything wrong, he just couldn’t.","The ambulance rushed to the nearest hospital with sirens wailing. The hospital had already dispatched doctors for the rescue, managing to save the old master with the utmost speed. Qin Xiu made a phone call to Mrs. Qin, then to his sister Qin Ying, and then to their uncle who lived in the capital city, before finally approaching Ye Jian."]},{"number":5450,"title":"Chapter 5450 Transfer","paragraphs":["Old Master Qin was rushed into the emergency room for resuscitation, and Ye Jian stood beside Old Madam at the door of the emergency room, softly persuading her to sit down and wait, to avoid getting tired.","As she gently and delicately urged her, Qin Xiu, who happened to overhear, saw his grandma take the advice and sit down to wait for news.","Holding his cellphone, Qin Xiu’s gaze darkened slightly as he strode over.","Old Madam, looking anxious, heard the footsteps and looked up to ask Qin Xiu, \"Have you managed to contact your uncle yet?\"","\"My uncle is driving over right now, my mom and my sister are also on their way,\" after saying this, Qin Xiu added, \"My sister’s boyfriend is driving. My sister says he’s a good driver, very safe.\"","Old Madam was about to stress the importance of safety, but when she heard it was Qin Ying’s military officer boyfriend driving, she felt somewhat relieved, \"That’s good, that’s good. As for your uncle... sigh, he’s an adult and can take care of himself. With a driver, he won’t let himself be inconvenienced.\"","Qin Xiu’s uncle is a businessman who loves to maintain an imposing appearance. Neither of his legitimate children inherited this trait, but his illegitimate son, Qin Yi, did.","Qin Yi also hurried over, not notified by Qin Xiu, but by Qin Dingbo, Qin Xiu’s uncle.","\"The doctor in the ambulance told me just now that the guards intervened promptly, pulling Grandpa back from the gates of hell. We’ll do a full-body examination for Grandpa next, focusing on his heart. Don’t worry, Grandpa will be fine,\" Qin Xiu said, fearing Old Madam might become too worried and affect her own health, so he chose only the best news to tell her.","In fact, the doctor had told him in the ambulance that the situation might be complicated, and they needed to be prepared mentally.","Upon hearing this, Old Madam’s expression visibly relaxed, and looking up at the emergency room still lit, she just hoped her partner inside would pull through this safely.","Then Qin Xiu turned to Ye Jian, \"I’m sorry for the trouble tonight.\"","Ye Jian sighed, \"Saying that really makes us strangers. You took great care of my grandpa, and I’ve never been so formal with you. Grandma Qin and Grandpa Qin are also my grandparents, and it’s my duty to look after Grandma Qin. Right, Grandma Qin?\"","This drew Old Madam’s attention away from staring at the emergency room, and Qin Xiu, noticing this, couldn’t help but give Ye Jian a deep look. Ye Jian wasn’t looking at him, her gaze fixed on Old Madam.","\"You’re such a sincere child,\" Old Madam said, touched by Ye Jian’s words as if warm water was flowing through her heart, \"He used to trouble your grandpa quite a bit when he was young. Sometimes, when he got into mischief and didn’t dare to tell me or your Grandpa Qin, he would first run to your grandpa. I don’t know how many messes your grandpa solved for him, not to mention the numerous meals he ate at your place.\"","\"Your grandpa treated him as his own grandson and cherished him. Now that he’s old, it’s only right for him to look after your grandpa. You really shouldn’t say things like ’trouble’ or ’thank you’.\"","\"You’re in the military and can’t often come home, so don’t worry about the household, we are here.\"","Ye Jian smoothly shifted the conversation to Old Man Xia, asking about her grandpa’s recent health and some matters between Old Man Xia and Qin Xiu. She had questions, and Old Madam had answers. The back and forth eased Old Madam’s anxiety considerably.","Qin Xiu was also relieved. He hadn’t expected Ye Jian to have such a way with the elderly, and in no time at all, she had made the old lady relax. Him asking her to come and look after Grandma had indeed been a wise decision."]},{"number":5451,"title":"Chapter 5451: Bumping Into","paragraphs":["Footsteps echoed outside the emergency room, the click-clack of high heels particularly clear at this moment, accompanied by murmurs of conversation. Ye Jian, who was speaking with Old Madam, didn’t notice, nor did Qin Xiu, who was absorbed in listening. Old Madam was in the middle of recounting how Qin Xiu had mischievously thrown laundry detergent into Old Man Xia’s fish tank, claiming he wanted to give the fish a bath.","Bringing up childhood antics, Qin Xiu felt somewhat helpless and said, \"Grandma, please save me some face. If you go on, she’ll be afraid to even let me through the door.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, the sound of high heels outside came to a sudden halt, followed by a somewhat uncertain call, \"Brother Qin?\" Upon hearing the voice, Ye Jian’s gaze slightly darkened.","Old Madam’s expression also faded considerably; she clearly did not welcome the newcomer.","Qin Xiu then shifted his body to look toward the person standing at the entrance.","Standing at the doorway leading outside the emergency room, Du Jiayi, realizing it indeed was Qin Xiu, felt a surge of joy, though she did not show it on her face and hurried over, \"Brother Qin, what are you doing here? Is it because...\"","As she approached, she only then saw Old Madam, and Ye Jian seated further inside, whom Qin Xiu was blocking; Du Jiayi was struck as if by lightning, her worried inquiry abruptly stopping as her eyes widened dramatically at Ye Jian.","Ye Jian! How was Ye Jian here! How was she with Qin Xiu, warmly linking arms with Old Madam! How could she be holding Old Madam’s arm, how could she be so close with the Minister of Foreign Affairs family!","Since when had she become so close with the Qin family, why hadn’t she heard a whisper of it!","Was she with Qin Xiu now?","This wretched woman!","Was she with Qin Xiu now?","At that moment, Du Jiayi, deeply agitated by what she saw, felt her anger blazing. If not for Madam Li’s timely cry of \"Jiayi\" from behind, which jolted Du Jiayi awake, she might have rushed up to Ye Jian, pointing at her nose in accusation.","Startled by the call, she quickly turned her head, using this moment to adjust her facial expression, and said to Madam Li who had found her, \"Mom, I’m here.\"","Madam Li, who had been infuriated by Li Ronghuan to the point of feeling faint in the middle of the night, came over with some displeasure, \"Walking and then suddenly you disappear, come quickly to your grandma.\"","Li Ronghuan’s infuriating manner had not only overwhelmed Madam Li but had also caused Little Madam Li to be hospitalized again, showcasing Li Ronghuan’s intense capability to infuriate others.","As she spoke, Madam Li, entering, first caught sight of Qin Xiu and was surprised, \"Qin Xiu? What are you doing at the hospital so late at night?\"","\"Mom, Old Madam is here too,\" Du Jiayi said, stepping aside to give Madam Li a clear view.","By this time, she had recomposed herself, her expression revealing no signs of disturbance, and she respectfully greeted Old Madam, \"Old Madam, how do you do? Are you feeling unwell? I hope you are feeling better now?\"","Madam Li, upon seeing Old Madam, also caught sight of Ye Jian. The shock in her heart was no less than Du Jiayi’s, and moreover, she remembered what Li Ronghuan had once said, that Ye Jian was the murderer who killed Li Chuhai!","Caught up in her jealousy at seeing Ye Jian beside Old Madam, Du Jiayi failed to think of anything else.","Madam Li, on the other hand, having some sophistication, managed to keep her face calm regardless of the shock inside, and quickly stepped forward to show great concern for Old Madam, \"Old Madam, how is your health?\"","Her gaze had flickered unknowably many times toward Ye Jian, her eyes filled with needle-like hatred.","The murderer of her brother was right before her eyes; how could she seek vengeance for her brother?"]},{"number":5452,"title":"Chapter 5452: Relative","paragraphs":["The other party was considerate and polite. Although Old Madam Qin didn’t particularly like the mother and daughter, since they were always courteous, Old Madam Qin courteously replied, \"Thank you for your concern, there’s nothing serious now, just sitting here and chatting with the younger generation.\"","She didn’t want to tell Madam Li the truth, to avoid giving Madam Li another opportunity to visit again.","Her grandson had made it clear that he disliked Du Jiayi’s two-faced hypocrisy, so why would she allow outsiders to visit and add to her grandson’s discomfort?","Upon hearing these words, Madam Li sensed that Old Madam Qin wasn’t telling the truth. Sitting at the emergency room door and chatting with the younger ones? Ha, she really thinks I’m a three-year-old child.","However, if the other party was not welcoming, she had no need to impose. She had given up hope regarding her daughter and Qin Xiu, but the Qin family was an established family after all. If they couldn’t become in-laws, she at least had to maintain a good relationship with them.","Hearing this, Madam Li responded as if a weight had been lifted, \"Well then, that’s good, that’s good. With Qin Xiu and Miss Ye here, I can rest assured.\"","Old Madam Qin lifted her head, rubbed her forehead, and tiredly agreed, \"Thank you for your concern. Just now I heard you say you needed to accompany Old Madam Li, so you go ahead and be busy. Don’t let me hold you up.\"","\"Alas, my mother was also agitated by my second brother, suddenly complaining of chest pain in the middle of the night, which frightened Du Jiayi and me terribly, so we rushed to the hospital. You should rest up; I’ll come to see you next time.\" Madam Li didn’t want to stay any longer, she had her own status and wasn’t accustomed to sticking around for a cold reception.","Du Jiayi also immediately said, \"Old Madam, you must take good care of your health. I see even Brother Qin is so anxious that he’s gone pale. For the sake of the younger members of the family, you must take good care of yourself.\"","Once she finished speaking, she obediently stood by Madam Li, while her eyes, in the corners of which malice lurked, swept over Ye Jian several times.","Qin Xiu’s brows were already tightly knitted, his gaze swept past Du Jiayi and then slowly fell upon Ye Jian, his thin lips slightly pursed.","Madam Li, who seemed to be leaving, suddenly turned her gaze toward Ye Jian and smilingly asked, \"Miss Ye, have you been in contact with Xia Jinyuan lately? A few days ago, I met his mother, who has been asking around about how Little Six is doing lately, and I don’t know if Ye Jian has been in touch with him. Could you let me know a thing or two?\"","She wasn’t asking on behalf of Madam Xiao, but rather, she did so intentionally, wanting to leave a thorn in Old Madam Qin’s heart.","Old Madam Qin’s expression instantly darkened at Madam Li’s sudden targeting of Ye Jian. Du Jiayi tugged at Madam Li’s sleeve and said helplessly, \"Mom, if you have to ask, at least choose a better time. Ye Jian is currently accompanying Old Madam; she doesn’t have time to answer you now.\"","\"If you really want to ask, let us do it later.\" Then she turned and smiled at Ye Jian, politely inquiring, \"Ye Jian, can you give me your mobile number? You and Xia Jinyuan have always had a good relationship. Maybe I can have Aunt Xiao contact you later, would that be alright?\"","The mother and daughter’s words obviously showed they had misunderstood her relationship with Qin Xiu. Upon hearing this, she responded indifferently, \"No, if Madam Xiao truly cares and wants to know how her own son is doing, she will definitely find other ways.\"","\"You child, you’re still the same as before, like a hedgehog. When things weren’t good between the sisters at home, one could say it was because you were young and didn’t understand. Now that you’re grown up, it’s still the same, alas, it can’t be helped. You grew up wild without parents, lacking upbringing. Alright, since you don’t wish to speak, I won’t insist.\" Madam Li was very satisfied with Ye Jian’s lack of cooperation, which allowed her to plant another thorn in Old Madam Qin’s heart."]},{"number":5453,"title":"Chapter 5453: Meddling in Affairs","paragraphs":["If Ye Jian and Qin Xiu truly had some relationship, then Madam Li’s words would indeed leave a thorn in the heart of Old Madam Qin, from a very strict and well-born family, allowing Madam Li to succeed and get her way.","However, the two families were close, with a generation that had supported each other through thick and thin, sharing a profound revolutionary friendship so deep that each family’s affair was like their own, becoming one family.","Thus, any attempt by Madam Li to stir up trouble would seem ridiculous, like a clown performing on stage.","Old Madam Qin’s polite expression disappeared, and her gaze towards Madam Li turned icy in an instant; the firm aura of the older generation spread, causing Du Jiayi to feel an involuntary jab in her heart.","She moved slightly closer to Madam Li and spoke in a lowered voice so that only the two of them could hear, \"Mom, stop talking. That wretched girl will win the favor of the elder, I see Old Madam likes her very much. If we keep on this way, we might even cause Old Madam to dislike us.\"","Madam Li, however, laughed. She was well aware that Old Madam might feel some aversion, but she could not help herself when she thought about how her own brother had been killed by this helpless girl who relied solely on her pretty face to deceive others.","\"Ye Jian girl, Grandma Qin needs to give you a lesson today. In this world, we always hear rumors and gossips; some are casual remarks, some are said deliberately to please others, some are carelessly spoken but misunderstood by others, and then there are those that are vicious, intending to trample a person to death. You are still young and might not yet understand how frightening people’s words can be. When you encounter such people or situations, either crush them mercilessly or dismiss their words and later teach them a lesson.\"","\"Grandma Qin was tough when she was young, and although she has mellowed a lot in her old age, her nature hasn’t changed. She treats you like her own granddaughter and can’t bear to see you being stepped on.\"","\"No father, no mother, no one to rely on? Does that make our Qin family all dead?\"","Madam Li’s face truly turned ugly then, as Old Madam Qin implied that she was malicious and dishonest, taking advantage of her old age to bully a young person!","Very well, very well, it is not in vain that she is the Old Madam of a diplomatic family; her words are like knives, cutting into the flesh of people’s hearts.","Ye Jian, this little wretch, truly has her ways, having charmed both Little Six and Qin Xiu, and even managed to make Qin Xiu cherish her over his own beloved daughter, bringing her home and treating her like a treasure!","With her face turning from green to white, Madam Li took several deep breaths, thinking about what to say next.","As soon as Ye Jian heard these words, she knew Old Madam Qin was standing up for her; in fact, it didn’t really matter to her. Being criticized a bit didn’t bother her at all, with no real harm done; if Madam Li liked to speak in front of Old Madam, then let her speak.","The more she speaks, the more mistakes she makes; the more mistakes, the less she will be liked by Old Madam, and the worse her impression will be.","It turns out, the one at a disadvantage isn’t herself, but Madam Li.","\"Grandma Qin...\" Ye Jian was just about to speak when Qin Xiu suddenly coughed softly, intentionally interrupting her, and said lightly, \"Madam Li seems to have the leisure to meddle in other’s affairs, which suggests that the affairs of the Li family are not as troublesome as Madam Li has claimed.\"","\"Unable to resolve her own family’s issues yet still able to meddle in others’, Madam Li, are you looking to add more chaos to your already troubled house?\""]},{"number":5454,"title":"Chapter 5454: Up to No Good","paragraphs":["Old Madam Qin’s words were such that Madam Li couldn’t directly refute them, for Old Madam Qin had cloaked her teachings to Ye Jian in a guise, not directly naming her, and had Madam Li spoken rashly, she would have fallen right into Old Madam Qin’s trap, admitting to being a cruel and devious person.","But Qin Xiuyu was different, Qin Xiu was naming names when threatening her.","\"Qin Xiu, your mother and I have been friends for many years, it seems you truly want to go against her to the end. Sigh, you young people, no matter how outstanding, your vision is still too narrow, judging people only by whether they look beautiful or not, while ignoring whether their character is good or not.\"","Madam Li had intended to just say her piece and leave, but now that it was all out in the open, she decided to lay it all bare, lest Old Madam Qin truly think she was garrulous and deliberately bullying that little wretch.","She wasn’t bullying the little wretch, she was just telling the truth!","As for whether the Qin family would take heed, it depended on whether they were blind or not, for their eyes may be blind, but their hearts were not yet blind to a family’s true nature.","\"This Miss Ye, whom I’ve known for many years, went so far as to harm her own cousin Ye Ying before joining the military school, causing her to lose her qualification for the college entrance exam out of revenge against her own uncle’s family. Fearing trouble from her second uncle who was an official, she somehow managed to cling to Little Six of the Xia family, using the Xia family as an umbrella.\"","\"After her second uncle fell from power, she thrived in the military school. Not only did she establish connections with Little Six of the Xia family, but she also befriended my nephew, Li Jinnian. Fortunately, my nephew has been serving in the army all year round and hasn’t the time to bother with her, and to this day has not brought her home to meet the elders. Little Six is also in the army, probably in the same situation as my older nephew, just having fun, never intending to take her home.\"","\"Old Madam, even at the risk of truly offending you now, I must make myself clear. This Miss Ye indeed has formidable skills, talent, and beauty, and with her intelligence and schemes, she has astonishingly climbed her way up to associate with three of the capital city’s most sought-after young masters. Now she has even got Qin Xiu bringing her to your home. I might be speaking out of turn, but you’ve crossed more bridges than I’ve walked roads, yet you must still be careful.\"","Madam Li characterized Ye Jian as a woman who flirts with many suitors, stepping on three boats at once, choosing to climb whichever branch was higher, and cunningly carving her way into a noble family with focused determination.","Unfortunately, she had never considered that Li Jinnian was Ye Jian’s brother, that Ye Jian was the granddaughter of the Fu family, that the Xia family already regarded Ye Jian as their granddaughter-in-law, and that the Qin family, although they liked Ye Jian, lamented the lack of fate with her.","Thus, her words not only had no impact on Ye Jian, but on the contrary, they encouraged Old Madam Qin to be even more resolute in distancing herself from the Du and Li families.","A sixty-year-old woman still so fond of stirring up trouble, and in the end, putting on an appearance of benevolence and consideration for others — Old Madam Qin truly looked down upon this.","\"Madam Li, you say so much, but the crux of it is you want me to know that Jian isn’t good. I like Ye Jian, and to me, she is a good person. And as for Madam Li, sigh, I truly can’t accept your ’kindness.’ The words you speak, I can’t listen to a single one. Our Qin family has little to do with the Du and Li families; Madam Li, you should worry less about our Qin family’s affairs in the future.\"","Having said that, Old Madam Qin instructed Qin Xiu, \"Xiu’er, Ye Jian has been with me for so long without a sip of warm water. Go find a nurse to pour her a cup of hot water; let’s not have her go thirsty.\""]},{"number":5455,"title":"Chapter 5455: Power Slap in the Face","paragraphs":["\"Experience indeed comes with age.\" As soon as she spoke, Madam Li’s face changed multiple times. She said Ye Jian wasn’t good enough, but Old Madam still insisted on instructing her own grandson to take care of Ye Jian. How could Madam Li not be angry?","Du Jiayi had loved Qin Xiu for so long, but she had never even managed to get a glass of water from Qin Xiu’s hand!","Despite being advanced in years, Madam Li managed to steady the emotions on her face and even displayed a slight smile to disguise the rage within. She had said so much, yet the other party didn’t take it to heart and even blatantly insulted her. If she continued, she would only be further humiliated by Old Madam.","Considering her status and saving face, Madam Li didn’t say much more, only remarking, \"Old Madam truly has a broad mind, incomparable to us.\"","Old Madam responded with a slight smile, showing her agreement.","However, beside her, Du Jiayi’s hatred twisted her features as she clenched her hands tightly to prevent her emotions from spilling out. She loved Qin Xiu so, so much, had lowered her own status so, so much. She even tolerated being harshly slapped twice by her own father, never thinking of giving up, clinging to the hope that one day even Qin Xiu’s stony heart might be warmed by her.","But reality dealt her a harsh blow: Qin Xiu was not moved by her. For his sake, she retired and returned to the capital city. After burying herself in her studies and enduring countless hardships to finally get close to him, he had unexpectedly given up a job abroad, silently transferred back home, all to evade her.","She had given so much. What had she received?","Nothing but humiliation.","Feeling as if her heart was bleeding, Du Jiayi couldn’t hold back anymore. Seeing that Qin Xiu was indeed getting up to fetch water for Ye Jian, she could no longer contain herself and chased after him.","Madam Li then courteously bowed slightly to Old Madam, saying goodbye, \"Old Madam, we’ll be leaving now. Take good care of yourself.\"","\"Madam Li, take care,\" Old Madam responded with a smile and a nod, watching as Madam Li left.","Only when the sound of heels faded did Old Madam retract her smile, her brow deeply furrowed showing her profound fatigue, \"Ye Jian, this time you’ve been implicated by Qin Xiu. I supported him handling Miss Du himself to keep trouble away from you.\"","It showed Madam Li and her daughter how well the Minister of Foreign Affairs treated Ye Jian and also freed up Qin Xiu to solve the matter with Du Jiayi.","In fact, there was really no issue at all; it was all just Du Jiayi’s wishful thinking.","Gently patting Ye Jian’s hand again, Old Madam sighed, \"Just now, Grandma Qin didn’t disclose your identity to Madam Li, probably because your grandpa and your dad have yet to reveal your status to others. Although Grandma Qin doesn’t know why, she mustn’t jeopardize your grandpa and your dad’s plans out of impulsiveness.\"","\"Your current status is still being kept hidden. Miss Du is not a generous person. Now that she harbors resentment towards you because of Qin Xiu, the Minister of Foreign Affairs must take responsibility for protecting you.\"","\"Grandma wants to discuss this with you. Wouldn’t it be better if you and Qin Xiu acknowledged each other as siblings? That way, Miss Du would no longer hold a grudge against you.\"","If the matter with the Du family was really that simple, recognizing Qin Xiu as a brother would naturally resolve the danger.","But things were not that simple. Even if they recognized each other as siblings, her crisis was still unresolved, so why should she implicate the Minister of Foreign Affairs?","Ye Jian smiled and said, \"No need, Grandma Qin, the situation will be resolved properly. After all, the Du family holds status too. Although Madam Li and her daughter aren’t very reliable, the head of their family is Staff Officer Du, so things won’t get too out of hand.\""]},{"number":5456,"title":"Chapter 5456: How to Be Willing","paragraphs":["Outside, Du Jiayi, having left, chased after the figure striding ahead, her movements exuding elegance. She pursued relentlessly, her eyes betraying her obstinate yearning for that which she could not obtain.","\"Qin Xiu,\" Du Jiayi called out as she caught up and directly blocked his path.","Qin Xiu stopped in his tracks and looked indifferently at Du Jiayi, who had blocked his way, \"Miss Du, what can I do for you?\"","Seeing that Qin Xiu was still looking at her filled her heart with joy, but in the next instant, her face fell as she saw Qin Xiu bending over to take two disposable paper cups from the water dispenser.","Her eyes red with emotion, Du Jiayi fixated on the paper cups in Qin Xiu’s hand.","She had chased after him for so long, done so many things for him, yet he had always treated her with cold indifference, just like a stone that neither warmth could thaw nor embrace could melt.","If he were always like a stone, she would have been willing to accept that, but why had he given his tenderness to that wretched Ye Jian! Why did that fickle woman deserve it at all? Was she even worthy?!","\"Miss Du, if there’s nothing else, please step aside,\" Qin Xiu said, holding two cups of water with a cold voice. To him, Du Jiayi was nothing more than a stranger.","\"Qin Xiu, on what basis?\" Clenching her fists so hard that her nails dug into her flesh, Du Jiayi struggled with how he could treat her this way after all she had done for him.","\"Ye Jian is nothing but a flirtatious woman who plays around. She has always had an ambiguous relationship with Xia Jinyuan and has even struck up a rapport with my cousin. And now, she seeks you out, Qin Xiu. What exactly does she have that makes you fond of her!\" With desperate indignation in her eyes, she grabbed Qin Xiu’s sleeve, the man she couldn’t have, yet Ye Jian could easily obtain. Why! Why!","\"What kind of person she is, I understand perfectly well and don’t need Miss Du to tell me.\" Holding the water, Qin Xiu couldn’t easily free himself from Du Jiayi’s grasp, impatience shining in his normally cool eyes.","He knew all too well what kind of person Ye Jian was. If possible, he would rather she were a flirtatious woman—then, he might have stood a chance. But now, her entire heart belonged to Xia Jinyuan.","\"Qin Xiu.\"","\"Miss Du, it would be better if you address me as Qin Xiu.\" He didn’t want to be entangled with Du Jiayi any longer. Even if he and Ye Jian weren’t possible, the possibility with her was even less.","\"Qin Xiu, don’t let yourself and Grandma Qin be deceived by Ye Jian’s pretense. She’s merely trying to climb the social ladder by marrying into affluence. Seeing that the Xia family hasn’t accepted her, she’s come to deceive you and Grandma Qin. She’s the best at acting and scheming. You and Grandma Qin must not be used by her.\" Pleading earnestly, Du Jiayi was determined to expose Ye Jian’s true face to Qin Xiu, to prevent Ye Jian from bewitching her Qin Xiu.","How could that despicable Ye Jian always cross paths with her family?","The Li family’s vendetta would be settled bit by bit, and she would make sure that wretch wouldn’t die a good death!","\"If Miss Du has said all she wanted, then please let go of my sleeve. After all, appropriate distance should be maintained between men and women, and such pulling and tugging is not seemly, especially in a public place like the hospital.\" Qin Xiu said sternly, stepping back slightly and with a nimble move, he withdrew his sleeve from Du Jiayi’s grasp and walked past her with long strides.","\"Qin Xiu... you’re too heartless! How can you treat me like this... how can you... Ye Jian, I will never let you off the hook.\" Du Jiayi murmured lowly, venom seething in her eyes as she mentioned Ye Jian, her hatred for her was irreconcilable.","Qin Xiu, carrying the water, returned and handed the cups to Old Madam Qin and Ye Jian."]},{"number":5457,"title":"Chapter 5457: Settling Past Life’s Grudges in This Life","paragraphs":["Madam Li had already left, and Ye Jian was accompanying the fatigued Old Madam Qin, with the emergency room’s light still on, the situation inside unknown.","Qin Xiu’s gaze darkened as he pursed his lips and withdrew his gaze to look at Ye Jian, whispering, \"Sorry.\" If it weren’t for him, the Du mother and daughter wouldn’t have said such things.","\"Madam Li and her daughter are narrow-minded; what does that have to do with you?\" Ye Jian smiled, \"Without you, they wouldn’t have kind words for me anyway. You needn’t take it to heart.\"","Although Madam Li’s pointed words were provoked by Qin Xiu, Ye Jian wouldn’t blame him for it. Madam Li and her daughter versus Qin Xiu—she considered them separately. She wouldn’t conflate the two, nor would she take out her anger at them on Qin Xiu.","\"Mother, Grandma,\" Du Jiayi stormed into the ward, her words still laced with barely concealed fury.","When she passed by just now, she saw that despicable woman continuing to happily chat with Old Madam Qin and Qin Xiu, which infuriated her. Qin Xiu looked like he had been completely enchanted by that vile woman, as if he hadn’t taken a single word she’d said before to heart.","\"Du Jiayi, what’s the matter?\" Old Madam Li asked her granddaughter, \"Who has provoked you? It’s not that scoundrel again, is it!\"","The scoundrel referred to Li Ronghuan. The Old Madam Li, feigning illness due to her stepson and admitted to the hospital, would feel unwell all over just at the mention of Li Ronghuan.","She had not expected that this stepson she had driven to desperation, forcing him out of the Li family, would become such a persistent problem!","\"Grandma,\" Du Jiayi with a look of aggrievement, walked to Old Madam Li’s bedside, \"It’s all because of that despicable Ye Jian. My mother and I just saw Qin Xiu and Old Madam Qin outside, with Ye Jian accompanying them. What right does Ye Jian have!\"","\"Alright, Du Jiayi,\" Madam Li held back the indignant Du Jiayi. With Old Madam Li already hospitalized because of Li Ronghuan, it was especially important not to disturb her rest with other troubles.","\"Mother will handle that girl. You just stay here and keep your grandma company,\" the grim-faced Madam Li said to Du Jiayi, \"Don’t trouble your grandma with outside matters.\"","She definitely wouldn’t let off the killer who could have caused her brother’s death. And that girl dared to oppose the Li and Du families; Madam Li resolved to make her life a living hell.","\"Is that Ye girl the same one Li Ronghuan mentioned before, possibly the one who caused Chuhai’s death?\" asked Old Madam Li, propping herself up in bed upon hearing Du Jiayi’s report, visibly agitated.","Madam Li glared at her daughter and then, supporting Old Madam Li, nodded and said, \"Yes, that girl. She must have fed Old Madam Qin some sort of love potion. Just now, when I tried to expose that girl’s true face in front of Old Madam Qin, Old Madam Qin actually defended her vehemently.\"","\"Even Qin Xiu, that boy, directly questioned me for that wicked girl’s sake. I’m afraid he’s been drugged by her too. Our Du Jiayi is countless times better than that girl! Whether that girl is the murderer who caused Chuhai’s death or not, I won’t let her off easily.\"","Madam Li’s emotions swelled as she spoke, her cold voice steeped in malice, \"If Chuhai truly died at her hands, even if the Qin family protects her, I won’t let her off.\"","Had she caused her brother’s death and ruined her daughter’s chance at a good match? Was this despicable girl their family’s curse? How come everything had been going wrong since encountering her?"]},{"number":5458,"title":"Chapter 5458: Scheming","paragraphs":["Old Madam Li leaned on the pillow, her murky eyes revealing a cold light, \"It’s hard to say whether Li Ronghuan is telling the truth or not, and whether Chuhai was really killed by this girl. But judging by this, this wretched girl is indeed no easy opponent. You must investigate thoroughly; we can’t let your brother’s murderer get away but also mustn’t be careless. Who knows if this is a trap set by Li Ronghuan for us?\"","\"Mother, rest assured, you should rest well; I will thoroughly investigate,\" Madam Li soothed Old Madam Li, \"You keep watch over home, and I’ll keep watch over everything outside.\"","Madam Li was aware of her mother’s suspicions. The fact that Li Ronghuan had spoken such words with the clear intention of wrongdoing made it difficult to discern their truth.","Would he really reveal the truth to them out of the kindness of his heart if he discovered it? What if he had conspired with that girl to deliberately set a trap for them? After all, that girl was a tough nut to crack, who had managed to completely charm the Old Madam of the Qin family; surely, the Qin family members were all on her side.","What would she do if, in the end, she and that girl were at odds, and Li Ronghuan turned out to be the fisherman who benefitted from their quarrel?","But if what Li Ronghuan said was true, and she had to watch the murderer of her own brother flaunting in front of her without seeking vengeance and letting it slide, she would be letting Chuhai down.","Madam Li closed her eyes; she had to have someone properly investigate the matter.","Li Ronghuan truly knew how to torment one’s heart!","The attending Du Jiayi, seeing the fierce expression that flashed across her mother’s face when she closed her eyes, began to calculate in her heart as well. She had been so rattled by Qin Xiu’s closeness to Ye Jian just now that she had forgotten Ye Jian might be the murderer of her uncle!","Should... should she tell Li Jun?","No, Li Jun already knew about Ye Jian. What she should tell Li Jun was that Ye Jian was in the capital city; would there be any actions on his part once he found out?","Her father had made it clear: he would not allow her mother to interfere in Li family affairs, nor to deal with her uncle’s matters, and even her elder brother had warned her mother. So, the best solution was to have Li Jun deal with Ye Jian.","Ye Jian, Ye Jian... Du Jiayi, sitting by the sickbed, grew more and more sinister. Don’t blame her for being ruthless—it’s all because you know Qin Xiu and even managed to gain his affection.","What Du Jiayi couldn’t have, no one else should even think about having!","Qin Xiu belonged to the Qin family; she couldn’t touch him, but you, a mere orphan girl, even if you are now protected by the Qin family, ha, what of it! She would still use others to do her dirty work.","In the quiet hospital room, besides the faint sound of breathing, no one else spoke. Three generations, each with their own thoughts, spent the night together; it was already past 3 am in the morning, time to rest.","Meanwhile, Mrs. Qin and Qin Ying finally managed to arrive—thank goodness for the V8 driver, whose skill was truly unmatched. Mrs. Qin had been worried initially, but later, she even urged the driver to go faster.","Despite being somewhat far away, speed still took some time.","\"Mother!\"","\"Grandma!\"","The two women who hurriedly rushed in spoke at the same time. On their way here, they were both extremely anxious; the old master had always been healthy, so how could he suddenly have been taken to the hospital?","The leading V8, who was among the first to enter, almost blurted out a question when he spotted Ti Yejian, and Mrs. Qin and Qin Ying were even more surprised to see Ye Jian accompanying the Old Madam of the Qin family, especially Mrs. Qin, who was so surprised she froze.","Qin Ying was the first to react, discretely pulling Mrs. Qin, \"Mother.\""]},{"number":5459,"title":"Chapter 5459: Big Problem","paragraphs":["Madam looked quite biased against Ye Jian, hardly able to stand still before questioning Ye Jian about her presence here, without inquiring first about Grandpa Gen’s condition.","Ye Jian’s arm was linked through Grandma Qin’s!","Reminded by her daughter, Mrs. Qin finally came back to her senses, \"Mom, you must be tired.\"","\"You’re tired too, sit down and talk.\" Old Madam saw her daughter-in-law gasping and gestured for her to sit beside her.","Only then did Mrs. Qin ask Qin Xiu, \"Xiu, how is grandpa doing now?\"","\"The doctor said the hospital security acted promptly in the rescue. Grandpa Gen has pulled through the critical phase of his illness, and now the doctors are conducting a full body examination on him,\" Qin Xiu said, helping Mrs. Qin sit down while she caught her breath, \"We’ll ask the doctor properly when they come out.\"","\"That’s good, that’s good.\" Mrs. Qin patted her chest in relief and glanced subtly at Ye Jian before speaking to Old Madam, \"The old master has always been in good health. He surely will be alright. Don’t worry.\"","Qin Ying’s heart also settled, considering she had just brought her boyfriend home, and Grandpa Gen suddenly took ill. Although this was merely a coincidence, if word got out, who knows what people would say behind her back.","\"Aunt Qin, Sister Jia Jia,\" Ye Jian stood up to greet them.","Mrs. Qin nodded faintly, her expression somewhat distant. Aunt... she really couldn’t assume that title.","With the old master in urgent sickness, why was it her accompanying Old Madam? Moreover, it was clear Old Madam had known her for a while, so how come she knew nothing about it?","Qin Ying stepped closer and took Ye Jian’s hand, \"Ye Jian, it’s really a trouble for you, bothering you to accompany Grandma Qin so late at night.\"","Her younger brother was impressive indeed, stealing a person right out of Xia Jinyuan’s hands, even bringing her to the hospital to accompany Grandma Qin!","She’d need to ask him properly in private.","\"Sister Jia Jia, you’re being too polite. Taking care of Grandma Qin is part of my duty, you don’t need to be so formal,\" Ye Jian said with a bright smile.","Upon hearing \"part of my duty,\" both Qin Ying and Mrs. Qin instinctively looked towards their own Qin Xiu.","Two cups of hot water were served by V8, \"Grandpa Gen should be okay, right?\"","\"Grandpa Gen is fine; the doctor is inside doing a check-up on him right now.\" Upon seeing her boyfriend, Qin Ying’s interaction with him, their hands intertwined, both sensed each other’s nervousness.","It wasn’t just Qin Ying who was worried; V8 was too. His first time visiting and promptly the old master fell ill. If this got out, it could sound really bad.","In the army, he might not hear these things, but his girlfriend might hear these rumors and gossips. He had already felt like an unworthy match, and if she were to be subjected to such baseless rumors, he couldn’t imagine how remorseful he’d feel.","\"Don’t worry, the old master is not in any serious trouble,\" Ye Jian reassured, hardly ever seeing V8 look so tense. Even in the battlefield, she had not seen him like this.","\"How come you are here?\" V8, having seen Ye Jian earlier, feigned great surprise. Wasn’t she supposed to be with the Captain? How could she be with his future brother-in-law and the others?","\"I am here accompanying Grandma Qin,\" Ye Jian laughed but didn’t directly answer, thinking, don’t assume she hadn’t noticed his peeping and sneaking away earlier.","But to Mrs. Qin, this scene set off alarm bells in her head—this girl also knew Ying’s boyfriend!","Plus, the old master’s sudden illness late at night, the girl accompanying the old lady in the hospital, so where had she been before that? Could it be that she was with their Xiu before that?","What was she doing late at night with their Xiu?","The more Mrs. Qin thought about it, the more it seemed like a big deal."]},{"number":5460,"title":"Chapter 5460: High and Low Status","paragraphs":["And looking at their son Xiu’s attitude towards her, it was clearly different from how he treated other girls. Could it be that Xiu had always liked this girl? But didn’t she vaguely remember that this girl had an unusual relationship with Commander Xia’s Little Six? How come she was now with her son?","This girl is clearly no pushover!","Ye Jian calmly accepted the scrutiny without offering much explanation, quietly accompanying them.","The situation immediately turned somewhat awkward. Seeing her daughter-in-law’s scrutinizing gaze towards Ye Jian, Old Madam Qin sighed internally. She took Ye Jian’s hand and said, \"It’s hard on you, girl, staying up so late to be here.\"","\"You’re too kind,\" smiled Ye Jian, knowing that the Old Madam was backing her up and signaling Madam Qin to take note.","But Mrs. Qin felt even more anxious seeing the interaction between Ye Jian and Old Madam Qin... How could this be! The Old Madam clearly liked Ye Jian very much!","No, no!","She absolutely could not have this kind of daughter-in-law. The sons of the Xia family and the Li family had been toyed with by her, and seeing that they couldn’t snag a well-to-do guy in the capital, she aimed her sights at her son Xiu. She absolutely could not let her succeed!","Mrs. Qin glanced at the time, her gaze slightly fixed, and took the opportunity to say, \"It’s getting late now, mom. Why don’t we let Miss Ye go back first? We are here to accompany you now, so there’s no need for outsiders, and it’s ultimately inconvenient for outsiders to stay.\"","Outsider, Ye Jian could only be an outsider, definitely not someone from the Qin family. She absolutely wouldn’t accept such a daughter-in-law!","\"This Ye Jian girl is not an outsider,\" Old Madam Qin said, glancing at her daughter-in-law. \"Before you arrived tonight, she was with me all along. If it weren’t for Ye Jian, I might have been frightened by your father’s message and ended up in the hospital.\"","Ah, her daughter-in-law’s regard for social status was extraordinarily deep, deeper even than her, from the older generation!","Hearing this statement from Old Madam Qin, Mrs. Qin’s facial expression changed even faster.","Now her daughter was about to marry a poor soldier with no family background. How could she also let her son marry a woman with no power and no status?","Now, in the capital city, which of those families isn’t seeking strong alliances? Could it be that their Qin family, having married off a daughter with a humble background, would also marry another woman of low social standing?","Moreover, she was also a soldier. How could she look after their son Xiu in the future, how to take care of their Qin family... hence, she would never agree to this matter, no matter what!","Old Madam Qin, observing her daughter-in-law’s expression, could roughly guess what was on her mind. She disagreed, huh!","It was merely that their son Xiu had taken a liking to the girl, but the girl wasn’t interested in him at all.","This was a case of the prince having feelings while the goddess had none.","They all liked this girl, but sadly, she was not fated to be with their son Xiu.","You still despise Ye Jian for her low status?","One day, knowing the truth, you will regret today’s actions so much that you’ll feel sick to your stomach!","\"Dingkang’s wife-to-be, I think Ye Jian is pretty good. What do you think about her becoming a goddaughter to our family in the future?\" Old Madam Qin didn’t directly point it out, saving her daughter-in-law’s face somewhat. Furthermore, she didn’t want to offend an old friend because of her daughter-in-law’s views on social status.","The only granddaughter being disdained by her Qin family’s daughter-in-law would really hurt their relations.","Upon Old Madam Qin’s words, everyone present except Ye Jian was surprised."]},{"number":5461,"title":"Chapter 5461: Improper Thoughts","paragraphs":["Mrs. Qin felt a surge of joy when she heard the Old Madam speak in such a manner.","Although she did not like this girl, recognizing as kin was much better than her marrying their own son, as it merely meant acquiring a poor relative at most, which was entirely different from marrying into their family.","Mrs. Qin said, \"Mother, the child you favor must be good, but now is not the time to discuss this matter. Let’s wait until dad wakes up and then we can talk it over at length.\"","Even if it was about recognizing as kin, she couldn’t immediately agree.","Once they recognized the girl as kin, her status would change! She wouldn’t be an orphan any longer but a daughter of the Qin family.","Her nature still needed further honing. Spreading nets everywhere to climb up the social ladder could damage the Qin family’s reputation, she needed to be honed to understand the rules.","\"That is true.\" The Old Madam also descended the ladder provided by Mrs. Qin. She had just mentioned it to put her daughter-in-law at ease, not to start baseless speculations here.","When Qin Xiu heard the proposal from the Old Madam, his heart tightened. Although he knew there was no possibility between them, if they really became siblings, he would have a reason to care for and love her.","Let it be then, just like this.","Having become siblings, having become relatives, it would be inappropriate for him to have any further thoughts.","Or perhaps, he could truly forget her.","\"Exactly, let’s discuss this matter after Grandpa wakes up,\" Qin Ying added, watching her own brother and sighing inwardly.","To recognize as kin the girl he liked and have her become his sister was truly a painful matter. Their complications would never end, and for him, it was not something favorable either.","Qin Ying felt heartache for her brother Qin Xiu, her gaze tenderly shifting, indeed seeing her brother with eyes cast down and lips pursed. Unable to bear it, Qin Ying closed her eyes briefly.","It was ultimately not meant to be. Even deep feelings were doomed to have no conclusion.","Soon, Qin Xiu’s uncle Qin Dingbo and his illegitimate child Qin Yi also hurried over, all waiting outside for the check-up results.","It was already around three or four in the morning. The Old Madam was visibly exhausted. The Qin family repeatedly urged her to go home to rest or to rest in the hospital room, but the Old Madam refused, insisting on waiting for Old Master Qin to come out of the emergency room.","Ye Jian stayed by her side the whole time, occasionally speaking with the Old Madam.","Finally, around five o’clock, the doctor wheeled Old Master Qin out of the operating room. \"The old master’s condition is not serious. It’s just that due to his age, there is some obstruction in his brain arteries, but there are no major issues. However, he needs to be more careful in the future.\"","\"Thank you, doctor.\"","Hearing that Old Master Qin was not in serious danger, Ye Jian planned not to stay any longer and go home first, so when Grandpa woke up, he could be reassured.","After accompanying the Qin family to take Old Master Qin into the hospital room, Ye Jian said to the Old Madam, \"Grandma Qin, since Grandpa Qin is not in serious danger, I am relieved and will take my leave now. You have also been here for a whole night, Grandma, why not go home and rest too? Qin Xiu and the others are here watching.\"","The Old Madam hesitated but nodded her head.","Qin Ying said to Qin Xiu, \"You go ahead and take Grandma and Miss Ye home first, we’ll stay here.\"","She then said to Madam Qin, \"Mom, why don’t you go back and rest too? I’ll call you once Grandpa wakes up?\"","Madam Qin also hesitated for a moment and then nodded, \"That sounds good.\"","In her heart, Madam Qin was still concerned about the matter between Ye Jian and Qin Xiu and wanted to probe into it more while they walked together."]},{"number":5462,"title":"Chapter 5462: May You Be Happy in This Life","paragraphs":["Madam Qin was very supportive of recognizing sworn relations.","Just now, when the Old Madam brought it up, her own son didn’t oppose it, indicating that although the Old Madam had some affection for Ye Jian, it still wasn’t deep enough for her to accept Ye Jian as her granddaughter-in-law.","In the end, it was her family’s Old Madam who came from a prestigious household; despite claiming to be indifferent to social status, she had her own set of standards deep inside!","Thinking of her mother-in-law siding with her, Madam Qin felt much more reassured inside.","In fact, Madam Qin misunderstood entirely; the Old Madam didn’t disapprove of Ye Jian as her granddaughter-in-law, it was that Ye Jian had no intention of becoming the Qin family’s granddaughter-in-law.","Self-delusion, that was the type Madam Qin fell under.","\"Xulin, could you take mom home for me?\" Qin Ying understood her mother’s temperament. Although grandma was also in the car, she couldn’t help but worry her mother might say something inappropriate.","With her freshly-minted boyfriend keeping her company, the madam at home would be somewhat cautious, less likely to say anything too unpleasant, and thus not offend Grandma Qin, causing Ye Jian to be annoyed.","\"Sure, Auntie, I’ll take you back to rest.\" V8 wasn’t aware of what they were all circling around in their minds, but he followed his girlfriend’s wish. In reality, he was more inclined to send his Captain a message, to tell him that his lady was on the mind of a formidable and strong rival, and he should come to the rescue posthaste!","Mrs. Qin couldn’t get a word out before being interrupted by her daughter’s words, which made her quite frustrated. However, at this time, she also felt a bit overwhelmed and didn’t want to argue; there would always be time to address these matters.","\"Be careful on the road.\" Qin Ying saw them to the elevator and subtly signaled to V8, who blinked, his sharpness as a Special Forces operative coming fully to bear in that moment, astonishingly quick to understand!","Returning his girlfriend a thumbs-up, V8 waved goodbye, taking the Old Madam home.","Ye Jian helped Old Madam Qin into the car. The streets of Capital City were quiet before the break of dawn. After getting in the car, the Old Madam finally couldn’t resist sleep any longer. As she drifted off, she didn’t forget to cling tightly to Ye Jian’s arm.","\"Is there a blanket in the car? Grandma Qin has fallen asleep,\" Ye Jian asked Qin Xiu in a low voice, who was seated in the front passenger seat.","\"It seems none was prepared in the car.\" Qin Xiu took off his jacket and handed it to Ye Jian, \"Cover Grandma with it for now.\"","Ye Jian took the jacket from Qin Xiu, cautiously supporting Old Madam Qin, and draped it over her.","\"It has been a tough night for you,\" Qin Xiu said to Ye Jian after a while, still in the midst of an internal struggle.","Ye Jian chuckled softly and said, \"You’ve said that several times tonight already, there’s no need to repeat such words of gratitude over and over, is there?\"","Qin Xiu smiled and lowered his head, uncertain of what else he should say to her.","\"Why don’t you sleep a bit too? I’ll let you know when we arrive,\" Qin Xiu suggested after some thought.","\"I’m still holding up fine,\" Ye Jian adjusted Old Madam Qin into a comfortable position, shrugging off the late-night vigil as a minor inconvenience.","Qin Xiu saw Ye Jian’s actions through the rearview mirror, and his gaze dimmed once more. He was too late. Such a wonderful girl, yet they had no fate together, no foreseeable future.","\"What do you think about the proposal Grandma made at the hospital earlier?\" Qin Xiu asked abruptly.","\"Which proposal? The sworn kinship?\" Ye Jian inquired.","\"Yes.\"","\"Let’s discuss the issue further; there’s no rush at this moment,\" Ye Jian knew the Old Madam had mentioned this matter twice as a way to protect and relieve her from pressure, but it was a decision that needed more careful consideration."]},{"number":5463,"title":"Chapter 5463: Get Together","paragraphs":["Qin Xiu was silent for a long while before responding to Ye Jian, \"From now on, you will also have the protection of the Qin family. If people outside dare to bully you again, you can tell me.\"","\"Hmm, I want to go home and talk to Grandpa.\" In fact, Ye Jian thought that this was a good idea as well. Qin Xiu was a gentleman and very clear about the bottom line of being a person. Becoming siblings naturally solved some problems that hadn’t been resolved over the years.","Qin Xiu didn’t try to find another topic to talk with Ye Jian about. He just occasionally looked in the rearview mirror. He suddenly wished the journey could be longer, time could pass slower, and it would be nice for them to be together quietly in the same space.","After today, who knows how long it would be until they had another chance like this.","Ye Jian returned to the Fu family, where Old Man Xia was still waiting in the living room and had fallen asleep. A security officer had covered him with a thick blanket. Ye Jian walked over to tuck in the blanket around Old Man Xia, who was a light sleeper and woke up immediately.","\"Grandpa.\"","\"Girl, you’re back.\" Old Man Xia slowly tried to get up while Ye Jian and the security hurried to help him sit.","\"How is Grandpa Qin doing?\" Old Man Xia asked.","\"The emergency response by Grandpa Qin’s home security was timely. There were no major issues. The doctor did a full body checkup and said it was a cerebral arterial thrombosis due to his old age, but currently, there’s no danger to life,\" Ye Jian said.","\"It’s good that there are no major issues.\" Old Man Xia also breathed a sigh of relief. At their age, they had to accept growing old, and any of these old comrades could depart any day without warning.","\"Grandpa, let’s get you to your room to rest.\" Ye Jian said, thinking of Old Master Qin lying in the hospital and still feeling a bit of regret. She hoped her own grandpa could live for many more decades!","\"Okay.\" Old Man Xia nodded and let them assist him slowly back to his room.","Ye Jian returned to her room to freshen up and quickly fell asleep snuggled in her blankets.","When she woke up again, it was already past ten in the morning. As Ye Jian came out of her room, she heard voices talking downstairs.","Xia Jinyuan was sitting opposite Old Man Xia, sipping tea, and smiled at her, \"Awake?\"","\"Mhmm.\" Ye Jian nodded.","\"Breakfast has been kept warm for you in the kitchen. Go ahead and eat first,\" Old Man Xia said lovingly as he looked at Ye Jian.","After having breakfast, Ye Jian sat down in the living room where Xia Jinyuan and Old Man Xia were chatting happily. Xia Jinyuan said to Ye Jian, \"I have good news to tell you.\"","\"What good news?\" Ye Jian was unaware of the situation.","\"I just got the news this morning that our three-day holiday has been extended to ten days, so I rushed over to tell you the good news,\" Xia Jinyuan said.","\"A ten-day holiday?\" Ye Jian was a mix of surprised and delighted.","The unexpected ten-day break was a pleasant surprise. She had been thinking about how to spend these three days, and now that a ten-day holiday had suddenly appeared, it meant they could arrange to spend it very well.","\"You two young people should discuss how you want to spend these ten days of holiday,\" Old Man Xia said, standing up to give the young people some space.","\"The ten-day holiday can be spent properly celebrating the New Year at home,\" Ye Jian said with joy.","\"Besides celebrating the New Year properly, do you have any other plans?\" Xia Jinyuan asked with a smile.","\"Other plans?\" Ye Jian deliberately paused for a moment, looked at Xia Jinyuan’s expression, and said, \"Isn’t that something the boyfriend should arrange? The girlfriend just needs to follow along. Captain Xia, how do you plan to arrange our holiday?\""]},{"number":5464,"title":"Chapter 5464: Little Time","paragraphs":["Ye Jian was thinking about how to spend this precious little extended holiday. Besides spending time with her family, she naturally wanted to spend it with her boyfriend. However, when it came to the matter of dating, she really wasn’t familiar with the ins and outs.","Seeing her happy, contented expression, like a cat basking in the warm winter sun, Xia Jinyuan felt his heart relax. He raised his hand to rub her head and smiled, \"Alright, I’ll take care of the arrangements.\"","Ye Jian started talking about the encounter with the Du family’s mother and daughter at the hospital last night and what Madam Li had said, telling it all to Xia Jinyuan, \"I know Madam Li did it on purpose to provoke me in front of Old Madam Qin, even deliberately bringing up your mother, but I hit back at her directly.\"","\"Oh? How did you hit back?\" Xia Jinyuan was quite interested. He didn’t care at all what Madam Xiao thought.","His girlfriend standing up for him made him very happy inside.","As for his girlfriend helping the Qin family, V8 had already informed him and even seriously advised her that she must be cautious of Qin Xiu, and even gave a thorough analysis of Qin Xiu’s advantages.","Although the analysis was sharp, with Madam Qin being Qin Xiu’s mother, nothing else needed to be said!","Ye Jian didn’t feel the need to hide the fact that she helped the Qin family. She focused the topic on Madam Xiao, \"I told Madam Li that if Madam Xiao really wanted to know about your current situation, she would naturally find a way, without learning it from me.\"","She knew Xia Jinyuan’s attitude towards Madam Xiao—knowing that he didn’t want to meet Madam Xiao, and even less interested in getting involved and playing peacemaker. She respected Xia Jinyuan’s decision.","After saying this, she asked, \"Do you think I’m the most disagreeable daughter-in-law?\"","Xia Jinyuan burst into laughter, \"Baby, being a daughter-in-law comes with a certificate. Where’s yours? Besides, you are Xia family’s most beloved daughter-in-law, totally unrelated to that Madam Xiao.\"","Having someone to back her up, Ye Jian felt great, and even more emboldened when confronting others.","As for Madam Xiao, well... she really didn’t see herself going to her and being a daughter-in-law who tried to win her favor.","The couple joined Old Man Xia for lunch, and the smile at the corner of his lips never faded throughout the meal. He had thought his granddaughter would leave early in the morning, but the sudden extension of her leave for ten more days made the creases on his smiling face deepen.","After lunch, Old Man Xia said he wanted to visit Old Master Qin in the hospital. Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan, of course, went along. With timely medical intervention, Old Master Qin was in good physical condition. Seeing his good friend come to visit, he immediately expressed his desire to be discharged, \"I’ve never liked this place in my life; even the air makes me unhappy. They all insist on keeping me here!\"","It sounded huffy, but in reality... As Old Man Xia sat down, he teased his old friend with his usual banter, \"Still being fussy at your age? The younger ones are being filial, and you’re complaining?\"","\"I can be filial at home. Staying in this hospital is pointless, pointless,\" Old Master Qin said, shaking his head repeatedly. It was the hospital he detested, not the filial piety of the younger generations.","Regarding Qin Dingbo and Qin Yi, Old Master Qin was fed up with them. The first thing he did upon waking was kicking both father and son out of the hospital, only leaving Qin Ying, V8, and Qin Xiu to stay with him.","After chatting with the two elders, Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan were shooed away by Old Man Xia, who told them to go enjoy their own private world."]},{"number":5465,"title":"Chapter 5465: A Pair of Confrontations","paragraphs":["At the elevator entrance, fate again conspired to make Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan run into Madam Li and her daughter Du Jiayi. When the four met, the atmosphere immediately froze.","Upon seeing Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan so close and chatty, and recalling Qin Xiu’s attitude towards her the night before, Du Jiayi was even more furious, her eyes filled with jealousy and dissatisfaction.","She couldn’t understand why Qin Xiu still didn’t believe Ye Jian was a sleazy woman? Being intimate with him last night, and yet today she’s chatting and laughing with another man. Could it be that they all failed to see through her true face?","Madam Li was even more surprised. Yesterday, she saw this wicked girl getting along closely with Qin Xiu and the Old Madam from the Minister of Foreign Affairs, how could she be seen entering and leaving with Little Six from the Xia family the very next day? Her tactics were truly remarkable. Indeed, she had these outstanding juniors wrapped around her finger.","Madam Li, looking at Ye Jian, said, \"Ah, Miss Ye, why aren’t you accompanying the Old Madam and Qin Xiu today? You were so attentive late into last night, maybe spending a little more time, the Old Madam might just let you marry into the family.\"","Madam Li’s words were replete with sarcasm and mockery, clearly intended to humiliate Ye Jian in front of Xia Jinyuan.","After mocking Ye Jian, Madam Li turned to Xia Jinyuan, \"Little Six, you might not know, but just last night Miss Ye kept Qin Xiu and the Old Madam company. People who didn’t know better might have thought she was their granddaughter-in-law. And today, she’s here with you. This girl is truly impressive.\"","Madam Li adopted a worried tone and said, \"Jinyuan, as your mother’s friend, I can’t bear to see you being deceived by this girl. You don’t meet many girls in the military and might not see people clearly. I know many good girls, and I can introduce you to them. There are so many good girls out there.\"","Xia Jinyuan glanced coldly at Madam Li, \"Thanks for your concern and kindness, Madam Li, but I don’t need it. Perhaps keep them for your son. After all, a virtuous wife means fewer troubles for the husband.\"","Xia Jinyuan didn’t simply reject Madam Li, he severely slammed her face.","A virtuous wife means fewer troubles? Was he implying that she wasn’t virtuous?","That Xia kid was truly disagreeable, his words were as sharp as a knife, cutting straight to the heart and causing bleeding.","Maintaining a calm face while inwardly seething, Madam Li continued, \"I’m not trying to meddle, but your mother is truly concerned about you. She has been inquiring about your recent circumstances. Ah, what grudge could there be between a mother and her son? It was your mother’s fault in the past, but as a son, shouldn’t you stop blaming her? Don’t you think? Besides, your mother has not had it easy these years, she has truly had a tough time for your sake.\"","\"Hear me out, have a good talk with your mother. Don’t let her suffer constantly. It pains me to see it, and you, being her son, how can you be so indifferent?\"","Madam Li seems very concerned about other people’s affairs, but as a junior, I would advise Madam Li that instead of meddling in other people’s affairs, she should better manage her own family matters first,\" Xia Jinyuan said, standing tall with his hands in his pockets and a sharp gaze directed at Madam Li, \"With your own household in such disarray, and yet you find the capacity to meddle in others’? What would your husband think if he knew?\""]},{"number":5466,"title":"Chapter 5466: The Tip of the Needle","paragraphs":["This was about invoking Staff Officer Du to deter Madam Li.","Madam Li, unable to maintain her demeanor in front of Old Madam from the Minister of Foreign Affairs, generally held a high posture in front of these younger people like Xia Jinyuan, and because of her relationship with Madam Xiao, she always took it upon herself to lecture Xia Jinyuan as an elder.","Unfortunately, Xia Jinyuan was not someone easy to provoke, and Madam Li, maintaining the elder’s stance, had never succeeded; she often ended up as irritated as a hedgehog.","\"Little Six, you truly can’t recognize good intentions!\" Fuming, Madam Li’s eyes turned cold and fierce as she bit out her words, \"I am also kindly reminding you of what kind of distinguished family the Xia family is, how can you allow such a girl with ill intentions to tarnish your family’s threshold? Your father and your grandparents would never agree! Could it be that for her sake, you would turn against your own family?\"","Seeing that she could not persuade Xia Jinyuan, Madam Li had no choice but to invoke the Xia family elders.","Um, her scheming continued.","Ye Jian, who had been listening all along, now actually felt sorry for Madam Li. A quite shrewd lady, who had initially impressed her enough to be cautious around her, especially since in her past life she was Ye Ying’s mother-in-law.","However, as time went on, she discovered that although Madam Li was formidable, she was not the kind of formidable character that could handle everything perfectly.","It also makes sense that if Madam Li had been formidable in her past life, she wouldn’t have been used by Ye Ying to trouble her by exploiting her family background.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t want to waste any more time on Madam Li, and said with a light smile, \"Then thank you for the reminder, Madam Li. Our Xia family all likes my girlfriend. The elevator has arrived, Madam Li and Miss Du please go ahead.\" He did not want to share an elevator with them and preferred to let them go first and wait for the next one.","\"Mom, let’s go,\" said Du Jiayi with a subdued look, looping her arm through Madam Li’s, \"There’s plenty of time, no need to rush. Let Aunt Xiao speak for herself when the time comes.\"","Madam Li took a moment to calm herself, her gaze coldly sweeping over Ye Jian, who stood composed and cool by Xia Jinyuan’s side. Madam Li almost clenched her teeth to the point of breaking.","Born into a humble family not worthy of public attention, and yet... and yet to be regarded as precious treasures by the young masters of both the Xia and Qin families, truly infuriating. Her daughter... Thinking of how her own daughter was looked down upon by the Minister of Foreign Affairs’ family, Madam Li became so angry she felt dizzy.","Madam Li and Du Jiayi entered the elevator first, and in the moment before the doors closed, Du Jiayi fiercely glared at Ye Jian.","\"That Ye Jian must be a reincarnated little vixen, why is everyone so on her side!\" Inside the elevator, an irritated Du Jiayi stomped her foot, \"No matter what we say, they just don’t listen.\"","\"I really fear she is indeed a reincarnation of a vixen, otherwise how could each and every one of them be so utterly enchanted by her, she’s too capable.\" Madam Li’s eyes flashed with a cold and malicious light, \"Don’t worry, such people will eventually meet disaster!\"","Meet disaster? No, what she wanted was not for Ye Jian, that despicable girl, to simply meet disaster, but for her to never be able to recover again!\",","The irritated Du Jiayi thought bitterly to herself, and after a while, she carefully asked, \"Mom, do you think it’s possible Uncle really was killed by her?\"","\"I don’t know, it’s unclear whether this is a trap set by Li Ronghuan for us, we need to carefully investigate to find out,\" Madam Li was still cautious, and she advised Du Jiayi, \"Don’t make any rash moves on your part, mom needs to check things out first. Don’t spook the quarry, understand?\""]},{"number":5467,"title":"Chapter 5467: The Serpent’s Letter","paragraphs":["Du Jiayi was no longer willing to endure and, after thinking for a bit, pressed her lips together and voiced her own thoughts, \"Mom, I always feel that keeping Ye Jian around will be a big problem. Whether she is the uncle’s murderer or not, we cannot let her continue to stay.\"","If she stayed on, there’s no telling how many troubles she could stir up!","Even Grandma Qin was on her side!","Feeling powerless to deal with it immediately, Du Jiayi suggested another plan, \"Why don’t we ask the old subordinates of grandpa from the past to help us investigate this matter? Out of respect for grandpa, they would surely be willing to help us.\"","\"It makes sense, but we need to find someone trustworthy for the task,\" Madam Li nodded. She could indeed approach her father’s old subordinates; many of them were raised to their positions by her father, and would naturally be willing to help them out of respect, even using their influence to deal with that lowly girl Ye Jian. But this was a grave matter, not something to be entrusted to just anyone on a whim.","In the past, there had been attempts to seek their help, all of which had been rejected. This time, they couldn’t afford to be reckless as before.","After the old master passed away, the Li family was like a fallen tree and the hearts of people... scattered.","Li Ronghuan dared to come home and make trouble precisely because the hearts of the Li family were no longer united, right?!","\"I just don’t understand if what Little Six from the Xia family said was true or not. How could the Xia family like a rustic girl? How could they accept her so easily?\" Madam Li was still pondering over this matter; if the Xia family really had accepted that girl, then it would be even harder to deal with her.","\"Mom, do you realize the status of the Xia family? How could they easily accept such a lowly and originless girl? Maybe Xia Jinyuan was just deceiving us,\" Du Jiayi, whose heart had already brought Ye Jian down to the mud, believed that this was impossible. Even if it were possible, she would not back down.","If neither the Li nor Du families could solve her issue, then... what about Li Jun, Li Qin?","Ye Jian was their father’s murderer!","Putting those thoughts to one side for now, what made her most resentful was how that lowly girl could so easily win over Old Madam of the Qin family! How could she also gain the Xia family’s favor?","It was absolutely impossible; Xia Jinyuan must be deceiving them.","\"We should investigate this matter thoroughly, and then we will know,\" Madam Li said with a grave expression, not wanting to make a move before being certain of the stances of both the Qin and Xia families towards Ye Jian.","Perceptive Du Jiayi guessed what Madam Li was worried about and, after a while, lowered her voice, whispering, \"Mom, don’t forget about Aunt Xiao. Right now Xia Jinyuan may be unwilling to forgive Aunt Xiao, but after all, they are mother and son, connected by blood. How could there be eternal grudges between mother and son?\"","\"Xia Jinyuan is currently unwilling to forgive Aunt Xiao, but who knows if it was Ye Jian who incited this? Once Xia Jinyuan and Aunt Xiao reconcile, do you think Aunt Xiao would want a woman who has caused discord in their mother-son relationship to become her daughter-in-law? Then, she would just be left to be cast aside.\"","The words of Du Jiayi were filled with barely concealed spite, and imagining Ye Jian being abandoned brought a cold, mocking smile to the corners of her eyes, \"Aunt Xiao hasn’t seen Xia Jinyuan for so many years. Do you think, if she finds out that Ye Jian was the one behind everything, what would Aunt Xiao’s reaction be? Would she make a scene at the Xia family home?\"","\"Even though the Xia family may not protect Aunt Xiao, at the very least, it would let the Xia family be aware of Ye Jian’s existence. Mom, why don’t you invite Aunt Xiao out for shopping or a meal?\""]},{"number":5468,"title":"Chapter 5468: Don’t Talk Nonsense, It’ll Make Me Angry","paragraphs":["Du Jiayi’s proposal somewhat tempted Madam Li. To target Ye Jian, she first had to sever Jian’s ties with the Xia family, which was the main issue, although the Minister of Foreign Affairs’ family wasn’t that big of a concern.","Moreover, from the sounds of it, that damn Xia Jinyuan seems to have already brought that little wench home to the Xia family!","This was the trickiest part. If it were true and the Xia family was indeed pleased with that little wench, then targeting Ye Jian would be the same as opposing the Xia family. Even Old Du didn’t have the guts to go against the Xia family. Once they found out she was targeting someone the Xia family approved of, it would only make her relationship with her husband even tenser.","For Chuhai’s sake, Old Du was already quite angry.","A careful plan was necessary!","After pondering for a while, Madam Li nodded and said, \"You’re right, I could indeed arrange to have tea with your Aunt Xiao one of these days.\"","Seeing that Madam Li was really taking her words to heart, Du Jiayi was secretly thrilled inside, \"And who knows, we might even help mend the relationship between Aunt Xiao and her son. Then, we might not even need to deal with Ye Jian ourselves.\"","As long as she could cut off the ties between that wench Ye Jian and the Xia family, her own actions afterwards would surely go much more smoothly. Oh, not right, it wasn’t her who would act, but Li Jun and Li Qin, the brother and sister, coming into play, while she, sitting in the stands, would reap the benefits without any effort.","Such thoughts were very pleasing.","\"If she really is the murderer of your uncle, then we can’t let her live so comfortably!\" Madam Li, who kept a cold face, was actually taking Li Ronghuan’s words to heart. She had always looked down on Ye Jian and even felt Jian lacked the ability, but the seed of doubt had been planted. She needed to find someone to investigate thoroughly and confirm this matter.","On one hand, she planned to sever the connection between Ye Jian and the Xia family, and on the other, she intended to secretly send people to investigate.","Meanwhile, Ye Jian, standing in the elevator with Xia Jinyuan, teased her own boyfriend, \"Why did you just let them walk away like that? Weren’t you supposed to introduce me to your relatives?\"","\"You really want me to meet other women?\" Xia Jinyuan, with one hand in his pocket and the other naturally taking Jian’s hand, looked down at her with a hint of darkness in his deep eyes. \"Too bad I only have you in my heart. You want me to find other women, but I wouldn’t like that.\"","His tone became a bit serious.","Ye Jian immediately realized she had stepped into a minefield and quickly stopped teasing, \"I was just saying it casually.\" She embarrassingly turned her face away, and as the elevator was about to reach the first floor, Jian quickly changed the subject, \"We’re almost there.\"","\"Don’t say such things in the future.\" Seeing her immediately admit to her mistake, Xia Jinyuan pinched his girlfriend’s cheek, \"It doesn’t feel good to hear. Say it again, and I’ll have to punish you properly.\"","Ye Jian nodded, indicating she wouldn’t say such things again. The elevator arrived, and as she was about to enter, Xia Jinyuan’s hand appeared in front of her.","\"I think it’s necessary for you to declare your rights over me to others,\" Xia Jinyuan said as he opened his palm, \"and to inform them that I’m already taken. No one should even think about making a move on me! I am unswervingly loyal!\"","Looking at Xia Jinyuan’s serious expression, Jian smiled, nodded, and placed her hand in his, \"Yes, our Captain Xia.\"","\"Let’s go, I’ll take you someplace,\" Xia Jinyuan said, holding Jian’s hand tightly as they gracefully moved through the queuing crowd on both sides, and only then did Jian belatedly realize... it was a good thing there were only the two of them in the elevator, otherwise, they would surely have been laughed at."]},{"number":5469,"title":"Chapter 5469: Couple","paragraphs":["Having left the hospital, Xia Jinyuan drove Ye Jian to the bustling area of the capital city, parking in a lively downtown spot bustling with people coming and going.","As soon as Ye Jian got out of the car, Xia Jinyuan took her hand. She rarely walked hand in hand with him outside like this, and today, dressed casually, they looked just like any other couple on the street.","When they arrived, Ye Jian stopped and looked up, \"Is this the place you wanted to bring me to?\"","She had assumed he would take her somewhere else. It turned out to be just a movie theater, which was quite a surprise, especially since they had never been to one together before.","However...","\"I thought you were going to take me somewhere very mysterious. With all this secrecy, a movie theater is one of the typical date spots for couples, so there’s no secret there,\" Ye Jian said, unable to resist teasing him, \"Not very innovative.\"","\"You just said a movie theater is one of the typical date spots for couples, so how about we play at being an ordinary couple today?\" Xia Jinyuan touched his nose, hiding his embarrassment. He really lacked creativity and experience!","He had spent the previous night thinking of date ideas but ended up only with the movie theater, a classic date venue. The choice seemed foolproof!","\"Of course,\" Ye Jian squeezed Xia Jinyuan’s hand as they walked into the cinema. \"I’ve never watched a movie with you before. Are there any sci-fi or action movies? We could pick one of those.\"","She didn’t care much for the other genres.","Xia Jinyuan wasn’t fond of them either, but after all, it was a date, and they couldn’t exactly have a firefight on a date.","As they entered the cinema, their appearance and demeanor stood out among the crowd, instantly attracting many glances: men looked at Ye Jian and women at Xia Jinyuan, with side glances continuously drifting their way. Just walking to the ticket counter drew quite a bit of attention.","Xia Jinyuan remained composed; though he had never dated, he had always been a prominent figure, so such attention was nothing new.","What he considered now was which movie to watch.","Over the years, both of them had been in the military and often out on missions, rarely partaking in such common recreational activities. Neither knew which movie to pick.","The ticket seller, looking at the striking couple, spoke up, \"This newly released romance movie is suitable for couples. Many couples choose this film, and there are only a few tickets left for the next session.\"","\"How about this one?\" Ye Jian exchanged glances with Xia Jinyuan and asked, \"Everything else is full; we might as well choose this one, rather than making a wasted trip.\"","\"I’m fine with anything.\" Anyway, he didn’t care what the movie was about; the important thing was that they could sit quietly together.","\"Let’s go with this one then. Hello, we would like two tickets,\" Ye Jian turned to speak to the ticket seller and then hesitated to ask, \"Are there really no seats left in other films?\"","The ticket seller couldn’t help but smile, \"Really, there are none left. If there were, we would definitely sell them.\" The young lady was quite beautiful and had a presence that seemed almost as if this was her first time at a movie theater.","And it really was their first time at the cinema, Ye Jian admitted, indeed unfamiliar with how things worked here.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t know either; Ye Jian handled the ticket buying while he took care of the payment."]},{"number":5470,"title":"Chapter 5470: Bring One Who Is Not","paragraphs":["As Spring Festival approached, the cinema was quite crowded, with the theater full to bursting. Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan made their way to their seats at the back. There were couples all around, affectionately feeding each other cola and popcorn, while the two of them sat upright in their seats, hands clasped together.","Xia Jinyuan stole a glance around and thought he might try doing the same.","Tsk tsk, one of the classic date settings indeed has its reasons! Holding hands, kissing, hugging—it’s all so normal.","He would give it a try later!","Deep down, Lieutenant Colonel Xia was raring to go.","The movie started soon after, and it was a true-to-name romance film. There were many scenes where the male and female leads kissed and embraced. Whenever such scenes played, the couple sitting to their right would involuntarily start embracing and kissing as well, and not too quietly either, making Ye Jian feel quite embarrassed.","Ye Jian’s eyes didn’t know where to look, so she could only turn helplessly towards Xia Jinyuan. Sitting beside Xia Jinyuan was a couple that seemed to be only sixteen or seventeen, and before long, they too were kissing passionately as if no one else was around, leaving Ye Jian even more at a loss.","So young yet their actions were anything but!","Xia Jinyuan who was feeling antsy squeezed Ye Jian’s hand, a familiar mischievous smile curling at his lips, \"Feeling envious? Should we have one too?\"","\"There are so many people here,\" Ye Jian refused, kissing like this, cough cough... she felt like she should still be in kindergarten!","\"No one will notice us,\" Xia Jinyuan gestured to the clingy couples around them, as sitting upright and watching the movie like this, they really were the odd ones out in the theater. He leaned in slightly, and his lips grazed Ye Jian’s earlobe, his breath warm against her skin, \"Classic date spots definitely have their charms.\"","Images of the two of them kissing flashed through Ye Jian’s mind, and with so many spectators, the mere thought made her face feel feverish and flushed.","She she she... she was still a kindergarten kid!","Xia Jinyuan was bold and eager to learn, not giving Ye Jian a chance to escape, he suddenly cupped her face and planted a quick kiss on her forehead. After the kiss, he said, \"How’s that? Pretty normal, right? Doesn’t feel weird, does it?\"","\"It’s... it’s okay,\" Ye Jian touched her kissed forehead, smiling sweetly. It seemed... okay, but... she still needed some time to adjust, \"Let me take a moment, a moment to get used to it.\"","Xia Jinyuan was amused by her words. Take a moment to get used to it? He had to hand it to her for coming up with that.","Finally, he guided Ye Jian’s head to rest on his shoulder. She quickly glanced around to make sure there weren’t any problems, and then boldly leaned on Xia Jinyuan’s shoulder. Their clasped hands became tightly intertwined.","With the warmth of the cinema’s heating and resting against Xia Jinyuan’s shoulder, Ye Jian eventually fell asleep, only to be woken by Xia Jinyuan when the movie ended.","\"Time to get up, the movie’s over,\" Xia Jinyuan patted Ye Jian’s shoulder.","Ye Jian stretched lazily as she awoke from her sleep, looking just like a girl of their age should, sleepy from watching a movie."]},{"number":5471,"title":"Chapter 5471: The Look of a Date","paragraphs":["It wasn’t just Ye Jian who had fallen asleep; Xia Jinyuan had also dozed off, only a little later than she did.","He only opened his eyes when he heard a noise and then saw the strange looks being cast their way by the couple next to them. They probably hadn’t seen a movie outing where both the boyfriend and girlfriend ended up sleeping!","\"Is it over? What was the movie about?\" Ye Jian hadn’t expected to fall asleep so unguardedly in such a public place, and found it quite incredible to think about, \"Maybe we shouldn’t come to watch anymore. I’m worried I’ll sleep through the whole thing again.\"","\"The movie ended, and the male and female leads ended up together.\" Xia Jinyuan had been uncomfortable moving with Ye Jian leaning on him, and he himself had fallen asleep without seeing the end of the film. Although he hadn’t seen it through, he could guess the general direction of the story.","The relationship between the two characters ended up being one-sided, and they hadn’t gone through any great trials together, so their love seemed a bit far-fetched. But in the end, it was just a movie.","\"So, what are our plans next?\" Ye Jian was more interested in what was to come. She felt refreshed after her nap!","\"How about dinner and shopping? Let’s pretend we’re just average folks today, shall we?\" Xia Jinyuan once again guiltily touched his nose. Later today, he would need to do some research to figure out how they should spend the upcoming days.","\"Sure.\" Ye Jian agreed without hesitation. She didn’t care about the details, just that she was spending the time with Xia Jinyuan.","\"I’ll study it carefully.\" Xia Jinyuan still felt their limited vacation dates should be somewhat special—not so casually spent.","\"I’ll leave it all to the leader’s arrangement.\" Ye Jian said playfully, yet it was rare to see him looking so troubled.","Being in the military for so long, regular civilian life seemed far removed from them. They were clueless about what interesting things might happen on a civilian date; they were just not skilled at this sort of thing.","\"Speaking of dinner, I heard there’s a nice place we can try. If it’s good, we could bring the grandparents along next time.\" Xia Jinyuan suggested.","\"Grandparents?\" Ye Jian’s heart suddenly started to beat faster, \"Are they coming over later?\"","Xia Jinyuan really didn’t know what to do with his girlfriend, and after giving her a couple of firm kisses, he let it go, \"Would I let grandparents intrude on our date?\"","Ye Jian, who had just been startled, patted her chest in relief. Thank goodness, thank goodness. Otherwise, she wouldn’t know how to handle being led around and kissed by Captain Xia in front of them.","Ye Jian knew it was something that should be expected, but the thought of holding hands or kissing Xia Jinyuan in front of the elderly made her a bit embarrassed.","\"You suddenly mentioning grandparents just scared me.\" Ye Jian’s heart was still racing a bit.","However, Xia Jinyuan suddenly said, \"But grandpa and grandma did say, since we have a long vacation this time, why not get engaged? Once we’re engaged, I think you won’t be so shy anymore.\"","Why the sudden scare? Xia Jinyuan could tell at a glance!","In front of the elderly, his Little Fox was always on her best behavior.","Ye Jian, finally calming down, was genuinely startled and began coughing, \"Engaged? So soon... My father... my father isn’t back yet.\""]},{"number":5472,"title":"Chapter 5472: Engagement","paragraphs":["Ye Jian was unexpectedly prompted about engagement, which really frightened her, who was unprepared. Engagement... in her eyes, it wasn’t far from marriage.","Her, her, her... She had just graduated a year ago, and now marriage?","It wasn’t that she was against marriage, but it all felt too soon.","Xia Jinyuan felt it wasn’t soon at all, the old master and Old Madam had especially mentioned it yesterday when he returned, even his family’s Old Xia thought they could get engaged first.","Later, he also thought about it and it seemed possible.","Seeing that he had scared her, Xia Jinyuan directly pulled her into his embrace, not rushing at all, and leisurely said, \"Hmm, there’s no hurry in a day or two, our holiday is still so long, getting engaged in a few days is also possible. As for the future father-in-law, Grandpa Gen said he would think of a way, mainly we have to tell the future father-in-law.\"","There was a faint light flickering in his deep eyes, like a cheetah eyeing its prey gradually drawing closer, \"With father-in-law’s blessings over the phone, we might as well get engaged first.\"","From watching movies, shopping, to suddenly talking about engagement, Ye Jian felt the jump was too big. No, she needed to slow down, slow down some more.","\"Let’s go eat first,\" Ye Jian’s face flashed a touch of blush, looking down at her shoes. Perhaps... should they get engaged first?","She would ask Grandpa Gen first when she returned home. If Grandpa had no objections... No, her dad too, she must also ask for her dad’s opinion, yes, and her elder brother’s as well.","Seeing the faint blush on her cheeks, a hint of amusement flashed in Xia Jinyuan’s eyes; his sweetheart didn’t oppose engagement but felt it was somewhat sudden.","Indeed.","He felt it was very sudden last night too and was a little scared, wondering if the old master and Old Madam had some health issues, hence the rush to see him married.","Not wanting to pressure her too much, Xia Jinyuan released his hands from around her shoulders and switched to holding Ye Jian’s hand, clutching it tightly in his palm. \"Okay, we can talk while we eat.\"","Having barely escaped his presence, she was now gripped tightly by his hand. Ye Jian felt her palms sweating, \"Why hold so tight? It’s hot.\"","\"It’s almost New Year and it’s crowded outside. If I don’t hold onto you tightly and someone abducts you, what should I do then? Where would I go to find a wife, or cry?\" Xia Jinyuan teased, placing their intertwined hands on his chest, \"I want to keep you in my heart, so you can’t go anywhere.\"","Ye Jian: \"...\"","This revenge is indeed a dish best served cold—payback for today’s noontime joke in the hospital. Also, please don’t speak so cheesily, it’s making my skin crawl.","Knowing it was intentional, Ye Jian squinted her eyes, suddenly stepping closer to Xia Jinyuan, \"Then Captain Xia better hold on tight. Just in case I really run away, don’t have anywhere to cry.\"","Coy and playful, only in front of Xia Jinyuan would the usually composed Ye Jian reveal a slight daughter-like tenderness.","Her daughter-like charm made Xia Jinyuan smile broadly, \"Run? If one day you do run, I’ll definitely find you. You can only be mine, and I can only be yours.\"","Very domineering, confident, and filled with deep affection, Ye Jian bit her lip and smiled. Run? She really hadn’t thought about it.","As time neared noon, Xia Jinyuan was ready to take Ye Jian to the next date spot. He drove her to a well-known old brand restaurant in the capital city, where Ye Jian let him lead, following wherever he took her."]},{"number":5473,"title":"Chapter 5473: Habit","paragraphs":["For a long time, the couple had not experienced such leisure, free from disturbance, war, and the pursuit of life and death. Just like that, hand in hand, you looking at me, and I at you, they strolled and talked like any ordinary couple, enjoying the bustle of Capital City, feeling the stability of life, casting aside their identities. Today, they were just an ordinary couple.","In the car, warmth and tender smiles played between their brows. Sometimes, without speaking, a single glance was enough to feel happiness.","After about an hour’s drive, they arrived at the restaurant Xia Jinyuan had booked. The building and decor were quaint and traditional; red lanterns hung outside, radiating festivity, and the place was doing well — completely full in the middle of the day. If Xia Jinyuan hadn’t called ahead to reserve a spot, it would have been tough to have this meal.","Having spent years in the military, neither of them had a particularly strong desire for fine dining. They were neither picky nor accustomed to leaving leftovers, finishing every dish brought to their table.","When the waiter brought them tea, he noticed the completely empty plates and seemed to guess something, smiling as he poured the tea before slowly taking his leave.","Despite its traditional charm, the restaurant was not expensive and catered to civilian budgets. Some customers, like them, practiced finishing their plates to the last bite.","After the waiter left, Ye Jian sipped her tea and said to Xia Jinyuan, \"The waiter gave us a look just now, seemed like he was saying I can eat a lot.\"","And it was a little embarrassing for her.","\"It’s not that we can eat a lot, but he recognized our identities,\" Xia Jinyuan also took a sip of his warm tea and saw Ye Jian’s eyes widen in alert at his words, which made him chuckle, \"Don’t be nervous. There’s a military guesthouse nearby, so it’s not strange for the waiter to know. Only we would clean our plates completely like this.\"","Military canteens strictly prohibit leaving food unfinished, and this habit, developed over time, persisted when dining out. This is only the case during leisure time; if on a mission, all habits learned in the military must be set aside to avoid giving away any clues.","It was then that Ye Jian realized, \"This is the first time eating at a restaurant where the waiter figured out our identities just because we cleaned our plates. This has never happened before.\"","Patting her stomach, she laughed again, \"I ate a bit too much. I’ll have to eat less for dinner. If I can’t manage that, I’ll run five kilometers when I get home. Otherwise, after resting for ten days and stepping on the scale back at the base, I’ll have gained ten pounds.\"","\"Once back in the unit, I’ll get you to lose ten pounds in ten days,\" Xia Jinyuan said as he refilled her tea, suddenly changing the subject, \"This year, we’ll be at home for the Spring Festival. How about picking a day during the Spring Festival for our families to meet?\"","Ye Jian paused, knowing the significance of what he was suggesting—meeting each other’s parents was a step toward engagement.","Holding her tea, she nodded, \"I’ll speak to Grandpa Gen about it once I’m home, as well as to my father and big brother. I have to tell them too.\"","After all, they would have to take this step sooner or later; whether it was a little sooner or later didn’t really matter. Either way, she was fine with it. Maybe a bit quickly for others, but she and Captain Xia had been together for a good length of time. It was time to get engaged.","\"Good, talk to Old Man Xia about it first, and let’s hear what he has to say,\" Xia Jinyuan said, his eyes glittering with satisfaction.","After finishing their tea, Xia Jinyuan checked the time and found it was still early. Continuing to embrace the full itinerary of an ordinary couple’s date, he planned to take Ye Jian shopping at the mall."]},{"number":5474,"title":"Chapter 5474: Encounter","paragraphs":["It’s rather embarrassing to admit, but during the many years of dating, he had only accompanied his beloved to a shopping mall once, and even then, their relationship had not been fully confirmed.","After that, it never happened again.","This leave, Xia Jinyuan planned to make up for all the years he had neglected Ye Jian.","Since they were going to celebrate the New Year at home, Xia Jinyuan thought of buying his wife some beautiful clothes to have a splendid New Year. Once engaged, she was his wife for sure, with no escape!","Ye Jian was also in high spirits and even casually asked if Xia Jinyuan’s wallet was full today, and if she could shop freely.","Xia Jinyuan pulled his salary card from his wallet and handed it directly to Ye Jian, \"Four years in military school, several years working, this card has never been used, definitely enough to spend!\"","Purchasing luxury items... If they didn’t buy too many, it should be enough, he guessed. Suddenly, Xia Jinyuan felt somewhat poor! Now he had to consider whether his salary was enough for luxury items!","Perhaps it was because they had mentioned Madam Xiao too often these past two days, but as soon as they stepped out of the private room, they ran into Madam Xiao head-on.","Both were looking down and talking, and did not see Madam Xiao at first, it was Madam Xiao who entered with the waiter and saw Xia Jinyuan first.","\"Ah Yuan?\" She called out excitedly, not quite sure in her hurried approach, \"Ah Yuan, Ah Yuan, is it really you?\"","Hearing this, the two, who had been talking, looked up together. Xia Jinyuan glanced at the excited Madam Xiao, his gaze turned cold and dismissive, ignoring her as she approached and, holding Ye Jian’s hand, no longer spared her another glance.","The indifferent Madam Xiao did not give up despite Xia Jinyuan’s coldness; she was too excited by the unexpected encounter.","Who would have thought that today, while dining here with an old friend, she would run into her son whom she had not seen for years!","Over the years, Madam Xiao had always been trying to find information on Xia Jinyuan and his contact details, but since he had been in the army, he was completely unreachable. The Xia family refused to give her his contact details; she never imagined that her luck would be so good to just bump into him here.","Madam Xiao was so excited that tears welled up in her eyes; she blocked Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan’s path, tears streaming down her face, \"Do you really not want to see mom? Mom has been looking for you for a very long time.\"","This was her son, her own son; what could she do to make him forgive her past mistakes?","What could she do to earn his forgiveness?","In the face of Madam Xiao’s tears, Xia Jinyuan remained unflustered and unmoved, \"Madam Xiao, may I ask what you want?\"","\"Ah Yuan, you, you still can’t forgive mom, and you won’t even call me mom? No matter what, we are mother and son bound by blood.\" Madam Xiao was now crying so hard her voice was choked, and she looked at Xia Jinyuan in agony, her tone miserable, \"What must mom do for you to forgive her?\"","The sudden scene caused by Madam Xiao drew the attention of the passersby, with many gathering around to watch the spectacle. Those unaware of the details only saw Madam Xiao’s pitiable state, and harbored a biased view of Xia Jinyuan’s indifference.","Ye Jian narrowed her eyes, tugged at Xia Jinyuan’s hand; she took a small step forward, positioning herself in front of Xia Jinyuan, and said with a smile, \"Auntie, hello, excuse me for interrupting. This isn’t a good place to talk, let’s not stand here in the way and block other guests.\""]},{"number":5475,"title":"Chapter 5475: Relative","paragraphs":["She didn’t want to see anyone pointing fingers at Xia Jinyuan, so she simply stepped forward to play the villain herself.","Little did she know...","\"I am speaking to my son, what does it have to do with this young lady? Why are you interjecting? Where are your manners?\" Madam Xiao’s gaze turned toward Ye Jian, her words were anything but polite, \"If you feel that you’re in the way, you can leave first.\"","Madam Xiao sized up Ye Jian, this unknown little vixen who dared to seduce her son, and even dared to speak out of turn.","Chenglan was probably not wrong, Ah Yuan was avoiding seeing his own mother, just because of her!","Xia Jinyuan tightened his grip on Ye Jian’s hand and looked at her before saying to Madam Xiao, \"Madam Xiao, I hope you will show some respect to my fiancée.\"","\"Fiancée?\" Madam Xiao’s tone rose sharply, her voice sounding somewhat shrill, \"Ah Yuan, how is she suddenly your fiancée? Does your father know? Do your grandparents know?\"","Fiancée? He actually wants to marry a country village girl!","Hearing her words, Xia Jinyuan’s eyes turned colder than before. Madam Xiao’s heart skipped a beat, realizing she may have overreacted, she quickly adjusted her expression and softened her voice, \"Mom didn’t mean anything else. It’s mainly that you, Ah Yuan, are still young, there’s no need to rush things! This young lady also looks very young, you can both spend more time understanding each other, and consider marriage when you are older, which would be more suitable.\"","Madam Xiao, just thinking about what Madam Li had told her, felt countless dissatisfactions towards Ye Jian.","Minister of Foreign Affairs family, Li family, and Commander Xia family’s heirs were all high branches she wanted to cling to. Whichever branch she could climb onto, she would settle on! Where in the world could there be such good fortune!","Xia Jinyuan immediately knew that Madam Li must have said something, his handsome face darkened with a hint of hostility, \"My affairs are none of your concern, Madam Xiao. I’ll repeat what I said before, the year you left me behind to pursue your own happiness, and now, please continue to stay away from me and live your own life well. My affairs will never need your meddling, that’s what you always wanted, isn’t it?\"","Madam Xiao had naturally developed the ability to be flexible over the years, and with a pleasing expression, she said to Xia Jinyuan, \"Ah Yuan, Mom is just concerned about you. How about we change the place and talk? Mom has reserved a private room. Let’s go inside to talk.\"","Madam Xiao had arranged to meet these friends today precisely to probe for news about Xia Jinyuan. She didn’t expect to actually run into him here, truly saving her a lot of effort.","As soon as she finished speaking, a lady around the same age as Madam Xiao walked out of one of the private rooms. They had been listening for a while, and Madam Xiao had also mentioned to them the grievances between the mother and son; naturally, they were on Madam Xiao’s side.","They all urged Xia Jinyuan, \"Ah Yuan, right? Your mother has been painstakingly trying to find out your whereabouts. To get a bit of news about you, your mother has been asking everyone for help, even a tiny bit of news about you makes her happy for a long time.\"","\"Just the other day, she was telling us that as long as she knows where you are, she would be willing to shorten her lifespan. It seems that your mother’s hardship has indeed moved Heaven, arranging for you and your mother to meet here today. Since you have met your mother, just have a good talk. There are no overnight resentments between a mother and son. If there are things to be said, talk it out, don’t hold onto your anger.\""]},{"number":5476,"title":"Chapter 5476: Difficult to Resist","paragraphs":["Madam Xiao’s acquaintances were not ordinary housewives; each one of them was cunningly observant, knowing exactly what to say and when to say it, never confused at crucial moments.","Seeing Madam Xiao anxious, and knowing some things about her and her son, the women exchanged meaningful glances secretly. They quickly made excuses to leave early. Those without an excuse were taken away by others, clearing space for Madam Xiao to speak.","Madam Xiao did not attempt to retain them. She didn’t even see them off. Standing still, she repeatedly apologized, \"I’m truly sorry about this time. Let’s meet again next time, and I’ll really treat you all well.\"","\"Sure, sure, sure, we all know you have urgent matters. Who would blame you? You should have a good talk with Ah Yuan. It’s not easy to meet; don’t waste your time on us. We are free to meet anytime!\"","\"Exactly, exactly, don’t be polite among friends. If we were polite, you have got to teach me flower arranging and painting later!\"","\"You’re quite clever. She’s so busy, and yet she still needs to come to your house to teach you flower arranging and painting; you really have some ideas. Shulan, ignore her nonsense, it’s good enough for us to gather, drink tea, have meals, and enjoy massages.\"","The understanding from her friends significantly lightened Madam Xiao’s mood; the smiles in her eyes deepened, \"Alright, alright, I will follow what you say. I won’t see you off then, we’ll meet again next time.\"","Meanwhile, in the guest area, Ye Jian secretly pulled Xia Jinyuan aside twice, whispering, \"Don’t rush off now. If we’re leaving, let’s wait for them to leave first.\"","Ye Jian was concerned that if they left like this, those seemingly reputable ladies would spread gossip, potentially damaging the reputation of Captain Xia and the Xia family.","In this respect, the delicately minded Ye Jian was more thorough than Xia Jinyuan.","Xia Jinyuan’s expression grew dark, as he really had no interest in connecting with Madam Xiao.","\"Ah Yuan, how about we go inside, sit down, and have a chat? It’s been so many years since we had a good meal together as mother and son.\" After her friends had left and with no one else to consider, Madam Xiao pleaded, \"I have no other desires, just to sit with you and have a meal together. It’s been way too long since we shared a table.\"","\"Sorry, we have already eaten dinner,\" Xia Jinyuan said coldly, unmoved by Madam Xiao’s entreaties. After a pause, he added with a slight smirk, \"It has been way too long since we shared a meal, but wasn’t that your choice?\"","\"Ah Yuan, can’t you join me for a meal?\" Madam Xiao grasped Xia Jinyuan’s sleeve. Although nearly sixty and well-maintained, there was a pitiful charm about her that belied her age, \"Just accompany Mom, okay?\"","The restaurant was bustling with activity, with customers coming and going. As the previous onlookers dispersed, new diners began to pause nearby. Ye Jian pressed her lips together; her expression darkening.","This could lead to a poor reflection.","\"Captain Xia, we can’t keep lingering here. There are too many people coming and going,\" Ye Jian said, tugging at Xia Jinyuan’s clothes, \"Just go in with her, sit down, and have a talk. A few words won’t hurt, and it won’t affect you, right?\"","With Ye Jian’s urging, Xia Jinyuan was naturally inclined to listen, especially as he was tired of Madam Xiao’s pitiful act after the fact."]},{"number":5477,"title":"Chapter 5477: Heartbroken","paragraphs":["If you chose to leave with such flair back then, why bother coming back to play the victim now?","Xia Jinyuan, who very much disliked being threatened, nodded slightly; that was all he could do now. He could grant her this one wish, but only this one time. There would be no precedent.","A shadow flickered in the depths of Xia Jinyuan’s eyes as he pressed his lips together firmly.","His nod brought Madam Xiao to an unexpected joy, her eyes even welling up with tears as she choked out, \"Very good, very good, let’s go to a private room and talk there.\"","Casting another imperceptible glance at Ye Jian, Madam Xiao’s tearful eyes held a hint of inquiry.","She never expected to be at the mercy of this ’pretty face’, nor had she imagined that this ’pretty face’ could wield such great influence over her son. Her son would listen to whatever she said and heed her advice.","Chenglan had not exaggerated; it seemed she needed to inquire more thoroughly.","Asking Ah Yuan would yield nothing; she needed to question Old Xia instead.","\"Ah Yuan, please take a seat. Or maybe eat something else, or we could have some tea and talk.\" Once inside the private room, Madam Xiao was all hospitality. After so long without seeing Xia Jinyuan, she no longer felt the mother-son separation of her younger years was of no consequence. As she grew older and lonelier, she regretted her choices all the more.","Back then, even if she had chosen to leave, she should have taken Ah Yuan with her.","That way, she wouldn’t have ended up in today’s lonely and dire straits.","\"There’s no need for such trouble; I’m only here for a short while before leaving,\" Xia Jinyuan felt there was nothing left to discuss with Madam Xiao. Since she had left with someone else all those years ago, there was no need for her to return, and certainly no discussion of repairing their mother-son relationship.","He did not even wish to sit down, his gaze cold as if looking at a stranger, and he said to Madam Xiao, \"Madam Xiao, since we are now in the private room, I’d prefer you speak directly.\"","\"Ah Yuan, can’t we, mother and son, sit down and have a proper talk?\" Facing Xia Jinyuan’s indifference, Madam Xiao felt her heart shatter anew as she began to cry again, \"Why can’t you talk to your mother?\"","\"Madam Xiao, we really have nothing to discuss, and I believed I made that clear last time,\" Xia Jinyuan had no desire to waste time with Madam Xiao. He had already made his decision, and a few words from her weren’t going to change that.","\"Ah Yuan, are you still blaming your mother? I regret it now too,\" Madam Xiao, her voice hoarse, clutched at her chest. No longer did she possess the fearless resolve to never regret leaving, as she had once believed. Now older, she had returned to her homeland, longing for kinship and the bond between mother and child. Therefore, she sought to make amends.","She believed that if she truly made amends, everything would pass, everything would move in a positive direction.","\"Madam Xiao, what has passed has already passed; discussing it now won’t remedy anything.\" To Xia Jinyuan, her regret seemed like a joke, and he felt no desire to continue discussing the matter with her, \"You made your choice, and even if you regret it, even if you must walk the path alone, you must continue on.\"","\"Please, do not ask others to accommodate you because of your regrets, alright?\"","\"Ah Yuan!\" Madam Xiao trembled all over; this was her son! Why, why was her son so... so heartless!","\"Madam Xiao, you’ve seen the person I’ve brought with me, and we’ve had our talk. We have other matters to attend to, so we’ll be leaving now,\" Xia Jinyuan concluded before pulling Ye Jian with him as he walked out."]},{"number":5478,"title":"Chapter 5478: Entanglement","paragraphs":["Madam Xiao lost her voice in distress, desperately trying to keep him, \"Ah Yuan!\" She chased after him, attempting to grab Xia Jinyuan once again.","Having only walked a few steps, Xia Jinyuan seemed to remember something. He stopped and turned to look at Madam Xiao, making her face light up with joy as she caught up, \"Ah Yuan.\"","The halted Xia Jinyuan’s lips curled into a slight smile, \"Madam Xiao must think I am heartless, right? Once, Madam Xiao was just as heartless.\"","\"You shouldn’t have forgotten how I chased after you the day you left. And you, to get rid of me more quickly, even threw stones at me.\"","The joy on her face \"whooshed\" away, leaving Madam Xiao with a look of terror. Xia Jinyuan found it even more amusing; apparently, Madam Xiao really had forgotten.","No, that’s not right.","She hadn’t forgotten.","She thought he had. Perhaps, she assumed he was too young back then and wouldn’t remember anything, not knowing what happened on the day she left.","Unfortunately, Xia Jinyuan’s memory was too good; he remembered everything from that day clearly. Mention it, and he could recall everything; don’t, and he wouldn’t remember a single scene.","\"I also remember Madam Xiao throwing stones at me while screaming for me to ’get lost’, ’as far as possible, and not to be a drag on you. Also, Madam Xiao said you didn’t have a son like me, and I didn’t have a mother like you.\"","\"What about it? Has Madam Xiao forgotten everything she said that day? She probably hasn’t, from what I can tell by her expression; Madam Xiao hasn’t forgotten.\"","Madam Xiao’s face could no longer be described as pale but as ashen as death!","\"Ah Ah Ah... Ah Yuan...\" She cried, her tears falling like beads off a string, one after another, \"It wasn’t... it wasn’t like that... Ah Yuan, your mother was young then and didn’t know... didn’t know what the consequences of her actions would be.\"","\"Ah Yuan, your mother was wrong, your mother... was wrong, she truly knows her mistakes now.\"","She pleaded with tears ruining her delicate makeup, exposing a frail elderly appearance, \"Your mother was wrong, please, forgive your mother, will you?\"","\"No good,\" Xia Jinyuan shook his head, his gaze coldly on Madam Xiao, \"You had already given up on me. You were young then, and now I am young, so I can’t forgive you. No, it’s not that, I can’t acknowledge you again.\"","\"In my world, there’s no need for a mother’s presence, so please, Madam Xiao, don’t appear in front of me again as a ’mother’.\"","\"Also, she is my fiancée, this is my affair, the Xia family’s affair, it has nothing to do with Madam Xiao.\" Xia Jinyuan finished all he had to say, no longer looked at the weeping and limp Madam Xiao, and left the private room.","Ye Jian was pulled by Xia Jinyuan out of the restaurant, with Xia Jinyuan’s face remaining tense and his complexion not looking good.","\"Captain Xia, leaving like this... will Madam Li keep going after Madam Xiao?\" Ye Jian was only worried that after Madam Xiao left, she would talk recklessly with others, like Madam Li.","\"Nothing’s wrong with that; I have nothing more to say to her. What’s the point in staying? To listen to her talk about how she’s been trying to dig up information on me recently? To hear her talk of how regretful she is?\" Xia Jinyuan gave a faint smile, \"If she wants to find Madam Li, let her.\"","\"I’m just afraid this will expose you to other people’s gossip.\" Ye Jian pursed her lips slightly, \"Madam Xiao is not likely to let this go, and there’s also Madam Li, Captain Xia, this matter, it seems, is not over yet.\""]},{"number":5479,"title":"Chapter 5479: Intimate","paragraphs":["She didn’t sympathize with Madam Xiao, after all, everyone had to bear the consequences of their own actions. If you knew this would happen, why did you do it in the first place? Since you made such a decision, why still think about regretting and seeking forgiveness?","Continuing like this was not a solution.","\"Let others say what they want, I really don’t mind these things,\" Xia Jinyuan said, \"The things she did back then are already well known, and she wants to use filial piety to pressure me, but the Xia family will not agree to it.\"","\"Madam Li, she will definitely talk. Her reason for doing this is very simple, to use Madam Xiao to test your position in my heart and in the Xia family.\"","\"Madam Li is most skilled at using others to do her dirty work, and Madam Xiao...,\" Xia Jinyuan spoke and suddenly laughed, \"Madam Xiao is not simple either. She knows full well that Madam Li has ulterior motives, yet she continues to associate with her, simply because she needs to get news about me and the Xia family from Madam Li.\"","\"Madam Li thinks she’s manipulating Madam Xiao throughout, but little does she know, she has been used by Madam Xiao all along. After all, the only people she knows who have any connection to our family are from the Li family.\"","\"If she can’t continue her relationship with the Li family, then Madam Xiao would have to start over and get to know other people who have connections with the Xia family.\"","\"For her, that would be too troublesome, better to continue her relationship with Madam Li. Madam Xiao is quite something, you see...\" Xia Jinyuan finished speaking and suddenly leaned in to kiss Ye Jian, \"You, in front of these ladies, are only playing into their hands with your naïveté. Don’t underestimate Madam Xiao, although the troubles won’t end, she won’t tarnish the Xia family’s reputation publicly.\"","\"Just now, there was a lady, the wife of the CEO of Limin Group. Madam Xiao didn’t know her in the past, but now they’re close, it’s clear that Madam Xiao is still leveraging our family’s reputation to her advantage.\"","\"Don’t worry, silly girl, she won’t damage the Xia family’s reputation. Stop thinking about it, I’ll handle it. Be good.\" He stroked her head, as Xia Jinyuan didn’t want these trivial matters to upset his girlfriend.","\"Okay,\" Ye Jian responded, and did not bring up the matter again, treating it as a minor incident.","\"Let’s go, let’s go shopping,\" Xia Jinyuan said, taking Ye Jian’s hand.","He didn’t want to think about Madam Xiao anymore. Instead of dwelling on that, it was better to think about what clothes to buy for his girlfriend later, or what kind of gift to pick for Old Man Xia when they visited during the New Year.","\"What are we shopping for?\" Ye Jian asked with a smile, following his conversation, \"After buying, there’s hardly a chance to wear them.\"","\"First, I need to buy you a few outfits, so that when you visit the Xia family, the grandparents don’t say I didn’t dress their granddaughter-in-law prettily,\" Xia Jinyuan said, \"And also to pick what kind of gift to bring to your family when visiting during the New Year.\"","\"You’re usually not this formal,\" Ye Jian laughed, her eyes curving into crescents.","\"It’s also to help you make a good impression,\" Xia Jinyuan said with a light laugh.","In the army, they always wore uniforms. Although Ye Jian looked good in anything, now that they had the chance, it was still better to let her dress up like an ordinary girl.","Upon entering the store, Xia Jinyuan immediately spotted a dress hanging on the rack. Its form-fitting design would beautifully highlight the wearer’s graceful figure, and he could already imagine what Ye Jian would look like standing in front of him in that dress."]},{"number":5480,"title":"Chapter 5480: It’s a Date","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan’s gaze shifted, and Ye Jian’s gaze also followed suit, both possibly fixated on the same dress. In any case, Ye Jian, who seldom wore casual clothes, turned visibly flustered.","Coming to her senses, her first reaction was... to pull her boyfriend by the arm and head outside.","She had to pull him; otherwise, with his personality, he’d buy it for her in a heartbeat!","Xia Jinyuan was still envisioning how stunning his girlfriend would look in that dress when Ye Jian suddenly yanked him, causing Xia to stagger with his first step but stabilize by the second, securely dragged by Ye Jian to the door.","\"Let’s go home, go home, no more shopping. I don’t like shopping; it’s more comfortable just sitting at home.\" Ye Jian, with sweat on her forehead, felt lucky she reacted and moved quickly; otherwise... the consequences were unthinkable!","Comrade Xia Jinyuan also felt fortunate for his quick reaction and agile movements, otherwise, he would have been dragged down to the ground by his girlfriend. Hearing her, he quickly grabbed Ye Jian’s wrist and leaned in closer, a mischievous smile forming, \"Are you sure you want to go home? How about we go to my apartment? Besides sitting and chatting, we could do other things, like...\"","Like what?","Well, Ye Jian didn’t give him the chance to continue, immediately covering his mouth with her hand, her clear, bright black eyes glaring at him, \"Stop whatever you’re thinking right now; don’t say it!\"","After all, she knew nothing good was about to follow.","Although his mouth was covered, it didn’t stop Xia Jinyuan from making a move; his lips subtly pressed a kiss to Ye Jian’s palm, the tender touch making Ye Jian abruptly pull back, both amused and exasperated, \"Captain Xia, can you please be a bit more decent?\"","She spoke sternly, yet Xia Jinyuan loved teasing her exactly when she was being serious. Holding her hand, Xia Jinyuan lightly raised an eyebrow, \"So, is it shopping or going home?\"","Ye Jian glared at him, \"Shopping!\"","So frustrating, she was \"threatened\" by him again!","Before entering the store, Ye Jian humphed, \"I’m definitely going to tell Grandma Xia and Grandpa Xia that you’re bullying me.\"","\"Bullying you? I wouldn’t dare,\" Xia Jinyuan replied with a smile in his eyes as he led Ye Jian back into the store. The store was quite busy due to the approaching holidays. Despite this, the busy sales staff spotted them immediately.","Seeing that the customers nearby were still browsing, they quickly apologized and hurried over to greet them.","Ignoring the sales staff, Xia Jinyuan pulled Ye Jian towards the dress he had initially noticed, but after a few steps, his gaze locked onto another dress, a... fiery, bright red dress.","Ye Jian followed Xia Jinyuan’s gaze and also focused on the striking red dress.","The two exchanged a glance, and Ye Jian’s calves trembled slightly, \"Captain Xia, you’re not... interested in this... this one, are you?\" The color was fine, but... but the style was quite trendy!","Lace, V-neck, short sleeves, the sleeves just like the dress’s lace, semi-transparent, slightly sexy.","The dress itself was also very sexy, designed to highlight the body with a fitted waist. It required not only a slender figure but also some substance at the chest.","Whether Ye Jian had anything at her chest, Xia Jinyuan, who had personally measured, knew the best. Not much, but definitely something!","Additionally, Ye Jian had fair skin, the type that never tans but only burns and peels, leaving her skin as pale as porcelain glaze. Thus, Xia Jinyuan believed his girlfriend would look stunning in this little sexy fitted red lace dress."]},{"number":5481,"title":"Chapter 5481: Pointing Out","paragraphs":["Ye Jian’s calves trembled, her scalp tingled, and every cell in her body screamed, urging her to run outside. She really wanted to escape!","\"Thinking of leaving?\" Xia Jinyuan saw through her immediately and smiled subtly as he looked at his girlfriend, who was thinking of fleeing again, \"Then let’s go back to my apartment, and we can talk privately.\"","She did not want to!","Despite every cell in her body wanting to flee, Ye Jian felt as if her feet were nailed to the floor; she couldn’t run even if she wanted to.","The young sales assistant approached them, looking at the most eye-catching couple in the store. Following Xia Jinyuan’s gaze, she promptly took down a red dress, enthusiastically recommending, \"This gentleman has great taste. This dress is a new arrival. We only received one set of sizes and this is the only piece left that fits this lady. Moreover, it’s almost New Year, and wearing such a bright red dress could not be more festive.\"","Ye Jian glanced at the dress and subconsciously stepped back, declining, \"Wearing a dress is so inconvenient, let’s just go.\"","\"Inconvenient? No no no, madam, it’s very convenient. Don’t be misled by its body-hugging style; it’s actually a mermaid cut, which doesn’t hinder walking at all.\" The sales assistant did not understand Ye Jian’s intent, thinking she referred to the dress being inconvenient to wear for activities, and hurriedly explained, \"Look at the hem, our designers have considered this, it definitely won’t inconvenience you.\"","\"Touch the fabric here, it’s very soft lace. It’s extremely comfortable once worn; it won’t restrict your movements at all. And if there’s anything inconvenient, can’t your boyfriend help out? Right?\"","Seeing that the boyfriend was interested while the girlfriend was hesitant, the skilled salesman immediately turned to Xia Jinyuan, \"Sir, your girlfriend is so beautiful, and her skin is particularly lovely. I’ve really never seen anyone who’d suit this red dress better than her. Once she tries it on, she will definitely amaze you. Why don’t you have your girlfriend give it a try?\"","Xia Jinyuan, who wanted the dress the most, was moved by the salesman’s passionate recommendation. He took the red dress and handed it to Ye Jian, his eyes full of tender warmth, \"Sweetie, go try it.\"","He was very excited to see what Ye Jian would look like in the red dress, certain that, as the salesperson said, it would be absolutely stunning.","\"I will feel very uncomfortable, let’s not do this.\" Ye Jian, accustomed to wearing pants, held the red dress as if it were a hot potato. For her, used to pants, wearing such a dress felt weird!","\"If you’re not used to it, you can gradually get used to it. It’s rare we come out like this; we should get something out of it, otherwise, our grandparents might twist my ear and scold me for not accompanying you properly.\"","Yesterday, returning home, Grandpa Xia and Old Madam Xia specifically asked about their grandson and his future granddaughter-in-law’s holiday plans. Upon learning that there were no plans, Grandpa Xia was stunned, and Old Madam Xia directly grabbed Xia Jinyuan’s ear, scolding, \"You scoundrel, tell me, are you bullying Little Ye? Huh? You, when in a relationship, are you so stingy? So stingy that you even skimp on shopping with your girlfriend?\"","\"Where’s your paycheck? Where is it? Have you touched the money? You scoundrel, grandma has never seen you behave this way in a relationship. No flowers, not accompanying your girlfriend shopping – stingy! Stingy, I’ve never seen a man as stingy as you.\"","\"If it were my daughter, if you were this stingy, I definitely wouldn’t agree to let my girl be with you! And getting married, pah! You think you’re a toad wishing to eat swan meat, dreaming so beautifully!\""]},{"number":5482,"title":"Chapter 5482: Self-taught","paragraphs":["After scolding Xia Jinyuan, the Old Madam immediately instructed the old master to summon their family’s Old Fifth, Xia Yunyin, back to the old mansion overnight.","Xia Yunyin, who was getting ready to visit a nightclub with a few clients, received a call from the old master and was so frightened that he hurriedly looked around to see if the old master had sent someone to follow him.","When he learned that the Old Madam wanted him to rush back to the old mansion at once, Xia Yunyin didn’t dare to delay and immediately drove back, feeling anxious all the way, thinking he would be reprimanded. When he arrived at the old mansion and parked the car, Xia Yunyin’s back was covered in cold sweat.","After being schemed against by his second aunt, he had restrained himself considerably with women. He only accompanied them as far as necessary for social engagement, but always kept it to a minimum.","When he reached the old mansion and saw Xia Jinyuan, whom he rarely got to see, Xia Yunyin was stunned. But what stunned him even more came later: the Old Madam ordered him to teach everything he knew, including how to chase girls and how to make them happy, to Xia Jinyuan.","Xia Yunyin then laid bare all his tricks and, in front of the Old Madam, assured with a hand on his chest that for the sake of his brother, he would hold nothing back!","Hence, today’s arrangements were made.","Going to the movies, dining out, and shopping were all suggested by Xia Yunyin to Xia Jinyuan. And, they were planned according to Ye Jian’s age, regarding how to date. As for the big moves, Xia Yunyin didn’t mention them, fearing that his family’s Little Six’s wallet couldn’t bear it.","In their circle, giving girlfriends cars and luxury goods could easily cost millions in minutes, but that was not long-lasting—it was just for pampering and making it easier to leave cleanly afterward.","Therefore, Xia Yunyin also taught very carefully, not teaching Xia Jinyuan the manipulative tactics of their circle used for fame and profit.","Xia Jinyuan was a good learner, and more importantly, a self-taught individual. Excluding Xia Yunyin’s playboy-style dating techniques, the arrangements for today were made.","Clothes, of course, had to be bought.","One set wasn’t enough; inside and out, at least five sets were required.","Having a rare ten-day vacation, coupled with the New Year, naturally one should dress beautifully and elegantly.","His girlfriend looked beautiful and had charisma, dignified in uniform and radiant in casual wear!","Xia Jinyuan then gestured for the sales associate to take down several sets of clothes and dresses. With one arm draped with clothes and the other pushing Ye Jian to the dressing room door, he handed all the clothes to Ye Jian, coaxing her to try them on, \"Go on, try them out. Let’s see the speed with which we change clothes in the squad, two minutes for one set!\"","The sales associate originally wanted to follow, but Xia Jinyuan refused.","He hadn’t examined them carefully himself; he couldn’t let outsiders take advantage.","Xia Jinyuan chose a high-end store in a luxury mall, neither too expensive nor too cheap, which perfectly suited their spending power.","Luxury goods wouldn’t be a problem with Xia Jinyuan’s economic ability, but Ye Jian would definitely not cooperate!","Ye Jian, pushed into the dressing room with a mountain of clothes, looked troubled, \"Do I really need to try these on? Can I not?\"","\"You really need to try them,\" Xia Jinyuan said seriously, and he leaned in, pretending to be pitiful, \"Come on, see if your boyfriend’s ears are still red. They’re all twisted by the Old Madam!\"","The sales associate saw the interaction between Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan and couldn’t help but laugh, while Ye Jian, with a hint of embarrassment, took the mountain of clothes into the dressing room.","\"Sir, why don’t you go and rest on the sofa and wait for your girlfriend?\" the sales associate suggested softly, already treating Xia Jinyuan as a VIP customer. Although their store was not a very famous brand, it was still considered a deluxe brand with clothes priced quite steeply.","With Xia Jinyuan unhesitatingly giving Ye Jian six or seven pieces, he naturally became a major customer in the eyes of the sales associate."]},{"number":5483,"title":"Chapter 5483: Waiting to Be Married (The Ace Military Marriage Book Title Has Been Changed)","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan, who had seldom gone shopping, was actually quite interested in continuing to browse the store, looking to see if there were any other clothes suitable for his girlfriend.","The more interested he seemed, the more enthusiastic the sales assistant became, \"Sir, are you still looking for a particular style for your girlfriend? This coat would fit her perfectly, and it goes well with the one you picked earlier. If she wears them together for the New Year’s visit to relatives and friends, the elders will definitely compliment her.\"","Every time a garment was recommended, Xia Jinyuan picked it up to take a look, and the sales assistant’s eyes crinkled with a smile, recognizing a man who knows how to pamper his girlfriend and thus sparing no effort to recommend more!","Outside, a couple walked in but then discreetly backed out.","V8, who immediately noticed the Captain was in the store, quickly pulled someone away before Qin Ying noticed, with no other choice because his girlfriend felt sorry for her younger brother and even spoke about it in front of him, while her mother, well, she had much more to say about it.","And she took the opportunity to tell him to keep away from Xia Jinyuan in the future, as he was a notorious ’devil’ in the capital city, one who causes headaches for everyone.","V8 felt like he had discovered an extraordinary secret about their Captain.","Madam Qin referred to the ’devil’ as someone who only fools around, doesn’t take the right path, and doesn’t strive to improve, even in military school. However, their Captain...the pillar of the military, was also the guiding beacon of the team.","Therefore, V8 did not disclose his relationship with Xia Jinyuan to Mrs. Qin, but he also didn’t offer any explanations to his girlfriend Qin Ying.","Qin Ying was not so easily fooled. The more he talked, the more she would suspect, so it was better not to say anything. At that moment, when Mrs. Qin mentioned Xia Jinyuan, she just looked deeply into her boyfriend’s eyes with a shadow flickering through them and didn’t ask any questions.","As V8 was leaving the hospital with his girlfriend, he pointed to a nearby store and said, with a façade of a smile, \"Let’s check out that shop next door, the Tang suits. The Old Madam and the old master would definitely love them.\"","In the hospital were Qin Xiu, Mrs. Qin, and Qin Yi. The old master didn’t want his granddaughter to come and take care of him, thus ignoring V8, who had purposefully visited the Qin family, and using the excuse that the Old Madam wanted to buy new clothes for the New Year, sent the two out shopping.","V8 actually thought he needed to buy clothes, and Qin Ying was amused by her boyfriend’s simplicity, having asked the doctor who said a three-day observation would be enough before being discharged from the hospital. Only then did Qin Ying feel relieved to leave the hospital.","But as soon as she entered the mall and was about to step into a store to look around, her boyfriend Xulin picked her up... and simply carried her out!","It was indeed a carry, not a hold, not a drag, and definitely not a tug!","In his quick-thinking, V8 scooped up his girlfriend by the waist with ease and carried her to the entrance of a Tang suit shop, where he finally set her down.","Standing there, Qin Ying was still dazed, receiving countless stares.","She hadn’t even recovered when V8 spoke to her.","Meanwhile, Ye Jian had spent half an eternity in the changing room before finally stepping out in the mermaid-style lace red dress, then immediately dived back into the changing room, uncertain, tugging at the dress before the mirror, looking at herself from left to right, and feeling awkward all over again. Upon seeing her exposed calves, Ye Jian wanted to wear pants again.","Xia Jinyuan and the sales assistant, laden with a pile of clothes, walked over. He hadn’t noticed Ye Jian was already dressed and headed straight for her. Ye Jian, fiddling in front of the mirror, walked out to meet him, then immediately turned her back towards him, shyly asking, \"Could you help me pull up the zipper at the back? It’s reached my waist, and I can’t reach.\"","Xia Jinyuan, who had been looking forward to seeing his girlfriend in a dress, suddenly stopped moving. The figure in red before him seemed like a flame, her silhouette graceful and beautiful, standing like a bride waiting on her wedding dais, quietly awaiting the arrival of her beloved."]},{"number":5484,"title":"Chapter 5484: Heart Throbbing Like That","paragraphs":["The sales assistant was absolutely dazzled, her eyes wide. That figure, that demeanor, that tiny waist... The compliments and qualities she had just mentioned were usually just politeness during sales, something the customers loved and which boosted her sales conversion rate.","This time, she truly understood what \"stunning\" meant!","Even she, a woman, was left staring!","Xia Jinyuan’s gaze was so intense that Ye Jian’s back felt slightly heated. Already shy, she pursed her lips, her eyebrows hinting a shy delight like a budding flower about to bloom, gave Xia Jinyuan, who was staring motionlessly, a glance, and noticed something off in his look. Ye Jian felt her face ignite and hastily moved to the changing room to change clothes.","The fiery red dress indeed looked gorgeous, but it was too gorgeous, too conspicuous.","She was not used to being conspicuous.","Tossing the dress onto a sofa nearby, she strode forward, blocking Ye Jian’s path, \"Don’t move, I’ll do it.\"","His voice was as deep as a cello, deep and rich, hooking one’s soul seductively as if with a hook. Ye Jian’s neck even blushed pink.","She blushed so deeply, appearing as alluring as can be. Xia Jinyuan, trying hard to stay calm, inadvertently touched her creamy skin. The high defenses in his mind shattered instantly, and in a hurried glance up... He saw Ye Jian’s swan-like neck also turn crimson. Xia Jinyuan was no longer restless; his heart rippled as if waves stirred in water!","His mouth dry, his legs tight, and the deep darkness of his eyes even sparked a flame, burning his gaze fiercely.","Ye Jian felt her nape burning as if in flames, her waist instinctively straightening even further, and then... accentuating the female curves so much that even the sales assistant couldn’t help but swallow.","That figure, that face, that demeanor... This... this is not human, this is a fairy!","The young sales assistant was screaming internally.","Xia Jinyuan, with somewhat trembling fingers, finally managed to zip up Ye Jian’s dress. She almost couldn’t keep herself stable.","She had intended to ask the sales assistant for help, but he had dashed over straight away.","As the zipper closed, Ye Jian felt her waist and chest tighten further, her breath hitched as she tried on the dress. She turned around, slightly lowered her head, showing the most enchantingly shy angle, whispered, \"Does it look awkward? I said it feels awkward. Let’s buy pants instead.\"","Feeling uneasy, she tried to pull the skirt a bit longer.","\"Don’t move, it looks great,\" said Xia Jinyuan, placing his hand on Ye Jian’s shoulder, making her look with him in the mirror. \"Look, the person in the mirror...\"","\"Is truly beautiful,\" Xia Jinyuan whispered into Ye Jian’s ear, his voice a bit hoarse. \"You are beautiful in a camouflage uniform, but now, you are even more breathtaking that I can’t take my eyes off you.\"","There was no exaggeration, it was just the truth. The sales assistant had even slipped out to call her colleagues to come and look.","\"No, it can’t be that exaggerated.\" Ye Jian continued to look down, unable to meet her own gaze in the mirror. She tugged at the neckline, feeling it was a bit too tight, making her uncomfortable, \"Can I change now? It’s a bit small, I can’t breathe.\"","Small? No, no, no, not at all small.","Xia Jinyuan slowly grasped her hand covering the neckline, his hot breath brushing against Ye Jian’s earlobes, \"Where is it small? It’s not small, not at all. It’s just right.\"","Yes, Ye Jian was talking about the dress, and Comrade Xia clearly hinted at something else."]},{"number":5485,"title":"Chapter 5485: You Are Beautiful","paragraphs":["Seeing her continuously looking down, afraid to lift her head, Xia Jinyuan encouraged her, \"Don’t be afraid, look at the person in the mirror, really very beautiful, so beautiful that I hate not being able to marry you today and keep you in the room for only me to admire.\"","\"When we get married, how about we wear red bridal gowns? At that time, you will certainly be even more beautiful than today. A red bridal gown, a red veil, to welcome my most beautiful bride.\"","Red bridal gown, red veil, welcoming... the most beautiful bride...","Ye Jian finally lifted her head, and she finally saw herself more clearly in the mirror, her red dress like fire, her complexion fresh as new jade, with a man in a black overcoat standing beside her, tall and straight as a pine, one red and one black, they matched so well together.","She was the bride-to-be, and he was the groom-to-be; as images flashed through her mind, Ye Jian’s eyes filled with water-like anticipation.","Footsteps came from outside, Ye Jian, startled, stepped back from Xia Jinyuan’s embrace; the salesperson appeared at the dressing room door with shining eyes, \"Sorry, sorry, to disturb you, this... could you match this, please?\"","\"Your boyfriend has really good taste, you look so elegant in this red dress, and the length of the skirt is just right, just revealing your calves. Such beautiful legs should not be hidden away without a skirt. Pair it with a pair of high heels, and walking among the crowd, you’ll absolutely be the center of attention.\"","Having already bent down to place the high heels on the floor, the salesperson looked forward to Ye Jian trying them on. Seeing that Ye Jian was not accustomed to wearing high heels, the salesperson smiled and said, \"The heel is very low, easy to walk in.\"","\"High heels too?\" She hadn’t even put them on, and Ye Jian’s face was already full of refusal. Wearing a dress was uncomfortable enough, let alone high heels... She refused!","\"Of course, with this dress, you need to pair it with high heels. Don’t worry, these are the lowest, most comfortable heels in our store, just try them.\" After saying that, the salesperson bent down again, took the high heels in hand, ready to help Ye Jian put them on.","Ye Jian, dumbstruck and stepping back, her face filled with panic, unhesitatingly refused, \"I can’t wear high heels, don’t let me try them again...\"","\"Just give them a try. Our shoes here are really comfortable and won’t tire your feet at all, very suitable for a lady who doesn’t often wear high heels. Plus, you can be assured, we women have a knack for high heels, a few rounds and you’ll be accustomed to them.\"","\"I really can’t handle these,\" Ye Jian kept waving her hands in refusal, to ask her to take a couple of turns in high heels was more daunting than asking her to walk barefoot. She turned to her boyfriend for help; what are you waiting for, save me, now!","The salesperson was overly enthusiastic, so much so that she was overwhelmed!","\"Miss, if you’re not accustomed to high heels you can gradually get used to them. When the two of you get married, you’ll definitely need to wear high heels under the wedding dress. If you don’t get used to them now, it will be too late on the wedding day.\" The persistent salesperson counseled Ye Jian, then turned to Xia Jinyuan, \"You can support her and walk around. I really am not deceiving you two, wearing high heels will make you even more graceful. If they don’t look good, you can hit me! I won’t fight back.\"","Ye Jian: \"...\" Girl, she’s just buying clothes, just buying shoes, not hitting people!","Having lived in a sheltered environment for years, once out in society, Ye Jian was so naive that she didn’t know how to refuse others, especially when they were so enthusiastic, leaving her even more confused.","A little more aggressive, a little more domineering, and she would have known how to respond.","This soft approach, she really didn’t know how to refuse."]},{"number":5486,"title":"Chapter 5486: Full of Joy","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan really wanted to help his girlfriend, but the sales associate reminded her that she might need to wear high heels on the wedding day, so why not give it a try?","\"No worries, I will support you. We have plenty of time to shop today, and we can try things you haven’t tried before. Get used to them, and if it doesn’t work out, then don’t wear them, not even on the wedding day.\" Xia Jinyuan whispered in Ye Jian’s ear and slowly took her hand, \"I’m here, just give it a try.\"","Listening to the sales associate talk about getting married, Xia Jinyuan’s heart blossomed with joy. Given that V8 met the parents and discussed marriage, he, as Captain, couldn’t lag behind. This Spring Festival, both families could finalize these matters, and he needed to prepare to submit his marriage report.","With the groom-to-be so proactive, the sales associate was even sweeter in her praises, with compliments pouring out one after another. Ye Jian had always thought that her Captain Xia would not be easily swayed by flattery, but to her utter surprise, Captain Xia was indeed charmed!","\"Yes, miss, rest assured, although our store is mainly about selling clothing, these shoes are also from our brand’s line. We guarantee they’re comfortable. Why not try them on and see for yourself? If they don’t fit well, our store won’t force a sale, right?\"","The sales associate was really capable, which moved Xia Jinyuan, and even Ye Jian herself was tempted!","Thinking about how she hadn’t worn high heels many times in her two lifetimes combined, maybe... maybe she should really give it a try? While she hesitated, Xia Jinyuan didn’t give her the chance to refuse.","\"Come on, try them.\" After speaking, the extremely attractive Xia Jinyuan swept Ye Jian into his arms, stunning the young sales associate with stars in her eyes.","Oh my god, oh my god, oh my god!","So so so incredibly handsome! Ahhhh!","The handsome beyond measure Xia Jinyuan carried Ye Jian and gently placed her on the sofa. At the same time, he managed not to let his girlfriend, who was wearing a skirt, expose herself.","What expression did Ye Jian have?","Well, Ye Jian was frozen, expressionless.","Her face turned so red she could only pretend to be calm and collected, as if she was used to it.","The pursuing sales associate was quite a talent. Being the sales champion was not in vain; she immediately handed the shoes to Xia Jinyuan. At this moment, it was definitely the boyfriend’s turn to personally put on the shoes for his girlfriend!","Comrade Xia, having a strong ability to learn, got the hint the moment he received the shoes.","The tall man got down on one knee, like a prince proposing to his beloved princess, kneeling before her to slip on the high heels for Ye Jian.","With such an affectionate gesture, Ye Jian was so overwhelmed her face turned crimson with shyness, \"Eh, eh, eh, let me do it, I, I, I... I’ll do it myself.\"","She stumbled over her words and raised her hand to stop Xia Jinyuan’s, feeling too shy to do this in front of so many people.","In order to secure this big sale, the sales associate spared no effort in sweet-talking Xia Jinyuan, pampering the patron. In truth, she felt that with the love in this gentleman’s eyes when he looked at the lady, there was no need for all these flattering words—an outsider like her could see love almost spilling over.","But the sales associate had a smooth talker’s natural gift, and with the upper lip touching the lower lip, she effortlessly continued with her flattering remarks, \"During the wedding, when the groom fetches the bride, he has to find the bride’s wedding shoes and put them on her before they can leave the house, so it’s good for the gentleman to practice now.\""]},{"number":5487,"title":"Chapter 5487: Being Beautiful is Good (Ace Military Marriage Renamed)","paragraphs":["Trying on red outfits during the New Year, particularly for young couples, is mostly in preparation for marriage, and the salesperson, seizing the opportunity, eagerly went on about this.","Although Xia Jinyuan was amused by the salesperson’s flattery, he was well aware that the salesperson’s words were somewhat exaggerated. But, he was willing to play along!","\"Right, let me give it a try.\" The smile on Xia Jinyuan’s handsome face was truly impossible to hide. From Ye Jian’s perspective, it looked like... he was eager to get married tomorrow.","Watching Xia Jinyuan like this, Ye Jian just wanted to facepalm and then take a picture to show everyone. But after thinking it over, she couldn’t bear to share—her man was hers alone.","It was the first time Xia Jinyuan was putting shoes on his girlfriend. Holding Ye Jian’s delicate and petite foot, Xia Jinyuan took an extra moment to look and silently compared it in his hand; it was indeed small, just fitting his grasp.","Ye Jian felt a burning heat in his palm, and her leg involuntarily drew back, but the quick-reacting Xia Jinyuan held on tight and slipped on the high heels for her.","\"There, stand up and give it a try.\" Xia Jinyuan stood up, helping Ye Jian to her feet. Despite seeming calm, his heart was tumultuous, badly wanting to carry his girl home and keep her there.","The high heels accentuated the lines of Ye Jian’s legs, making her long legs appear even finer and straighter. Paired with the red dress, her aura was starkly different from when she first walked in.","\"Hold me steady, I need to get up slowly.\" As soon as Ye Jian stood up, she felt unstable. Xia Jinyuan immediately held her tightly, his thin lips turning up gently as he said warmly, \"If you fall, I’ve got your back. Be brave.\"","His girl was truly... adorable to the core. She had never been this nervous on the battlefield – a dress and a pair of high heels had her shaking in her boots.","Ye Jian was genuinely scared.","But the salesperson thought that as long as the person was beautiful, even falling down would look graceful!","\"It’s still not suitable for me.\" Ye Jian looked pathetically at Xia Jinyuan.","\"You’ll get used to it gradually. Take a few steps, I’ll support you.\" Xia Jinyuan was still worried about Ye Jian falling, holding her tightly.","Supported by Xia Jinyuan, Ye Jian took a few steps but felt truly uncomfortable. The heels weren’t even that high, she recalled seeing Du Jiayi at the hospital today, walking as if on flat ground in what must have been ten-centimeter high heels—a truly formidable person.","Ye Jian felt that constantly being supported made her feel disabled; she was still struggling to accept this feeling.","\"I’d better switch to flat shoes. An unstable center of gravity severely affects mobility, and the balance is very poor; a slight mishap could lead to a fall,\" Ye Jian pinpointed the core issue. High heels paired with a red dress indeed looked beautiful, but they really weren’t for her.","However, Xia Jinyuan didn’t see it that way. As he helped Ye Jian outside, two gentlemen sitting on a sofa nearby saw Ye Jian come out. The look of awe was obvious in their eyes as they kept staring at her.","Thus, unbeknownst to Ye Jian, Comrade Xia got jealous again.","Seeing Xia Jinyuan agree, Ye Jian sat down and quickly took off the high heels as if they were hot potatoes.","\"How about trying these clothes?\" Xia Jinyuan pointed to the clothes in the hands of the salesperson next to them and those laid out on the sofa.","\"So many?\" Ye Jian’s courage was faltering. She looked more like she was facing trouble rather than feeling delighted. \"Isn’t it enough to have enough clothes to wear? Besides, so many clothes will end up unworn.\""]},{"number":5488,"title":"Chapter 5488: Winning Favor","paragraphs":["\"Buying it and not wearing it is such a waste!\"","Ye Jian was thrifty. In her past life, because of her impoverished living conditions, she had to learn to be economical. In this life, although she never had to struggle for a living, she still didn’t become restless; she was still the true Ye Jian.","Whether in her past life or this one, Ye Jian never compared her living situation with others. Everyone has their own way of life and their own difficulties. What you see might only be the bright side of others, not their entirety.","Therefore, Ye Jian’s mindset has always been peaceful. No matter the level of poverty or wealth, no matter the quality of life, she has always been Ye Jian, always herself. She never changed and never bowed her head because of it.","She did have a stubborn streak that refused to give up. In her previous life, despite how tough things were, why wouldn’t Ye Ying let her off the hook? Perhaps it was Ye Jian’s stubbornness that made her afraid, that made her uneasy.","People only become fearful and anxious over gains and losses when they are afraid and uneasy. If you can rise steadily without fear of gain or loss, life will lay out a carpet of splendors for you. Even in poverty, you would feel content.","The Ye Jian of today was still the real Ye Jian, who didn’t forget her roots despite the change in her family’s circumstances.","Faced with Xia Jinyuan’s grand gestures, Ye Jian was happy, but she still considered practicality.","A pile of clothes, fancy but impractical, which she wouldn’t really wear very often. The clothes were indeed beautiful, but they were somewhat inconvenient for her activities.","But after all, it was a gift from her boyfriend. No matter how wasteful Ye Jian thought it was, she wouldn’t spoil the moment by criticizing this or that.","However, she still had to say what needed to be said.","\"What’s gotten into you today? Why did you think of buying me so many clothes?\" Ye Jian hooked Xia Jinyuan’s arm, her dark eyes looking up at him with a smile, then narrowed just slightly, her eyes brimming with affection as she gazed at her own boyfriend.","Today’s... Captain Xia was quite off, very off indeed.","\"Isn’t there a ten-day holiday starting today? If you change outfits every day, it’s enough time.\" Inspired, Xia Jinyuan deeply felt he hadn’t treated his girlfriend well enough and intended to make up for his neglect during this short holiday. This made Ye Jian feel that he was very different from usual.","Mainly, in the past, when they had days off, the two hadn’t had the chance to stroll so leisurely.","Probably because Old Master Li had fallen, the Li family was no longer a threat. Lacking this looming presence, the couple finally had the leisure to go out and wander.","\"I just thought since we’re here, it’s rare for us both to shop together.\" Xia Jinyuan coaxed, wanting so badly to buy all the nice things in the shop for Ye Jian. Perhaps feeling that he was acting out of character, Xia Jinyuan simply admitted honestly, \"Last night, I talked with my fifth brother for half the night, and I understood there are many ways to please a girlfriend.\"","\"I, having no experience, always thought that our current mode of dating had no issues. Of course, there aren’t any serious problems, but I need to treat you even better in our daily lives.\"","\"Later, when you return to the military unit, as long as we’re in the army, I am your Captain, not your boyfriend. I will treat everyone equally, not giving you special treatment because you’re my girlfriend.\"","Drawing Ye Jian slowly into his arms, cradling her against his chest, he lowered his head and tenderly kissed the temple of Ye Jian’s head: \"Being so strict with you in the military, if I don’t treat you well in our personal lives as your boyfriend, then I would really become the heartless, black-hearted scoundrel my grandma talks about.\""]},{"number":5489,"title":"Chapter 5489: Intimate People","paragraphs":["After finishing, Xia Jinyuan carefully observed Ye Jian, feeling somewhat uneasy inside. He had only ever dared to demand such strictness from his girlfriend within the army; in everyday life, he wouldn’t dare to clash with her.","It was absolutely a case of his girlfriend pointing east, and he wouldn’t dare point west!","After listening to his explanation, Ye Jian had already blinked several times. Fifth brother, ah, Fifth brother is a successful businessman who has been through many relationships, and you’re taking his advice, Captain Xia?","\"Fifth brother is different from us. Don’t you find it odd?\" Ye Jian also spoke very cautiously. She truly felt that Fifth brother Xia Yunyin’s lifestyle was completely different from theirs. Adopting Fifth brother’s suggestion, Captain Xia, are you sure it’s feasible?","But her boyfriend was trying to please her, so she refrained from objecting. It’s quite rare for her boyfriend to be keen, and it wouldn’t be nice for her to directly refute him; she could only blame Fifth brother Xia Yunyin instead.","While Xia Yunyin, busy sneezing profusely at home, had yet to reach for a tissue to wipe his nose, the Old Madam’s robust voice came from the chamber, \"I told you your clothes are too thin; you’re still stubborn about it, favoring style over warmth. Old Fifth, ah, Old Fifth, you’re not young anymore! You’re in your thirties, a middle-aged man, and soon to be an elderly, do you really think you still have the luxury to be frivolous?\"","Suffering from sneezes and Old Madam’s nagging, Xia Yunyin was nearly crying. Grandma, truly his own grandma, he’s currently in his prime years for a man, but why does she think he’s already middle-aged and soon to be elderly?","He was nearly scared to tears!","Ye Jian, who pulled Fifth brother Xia Yunyin into the argument, silently apologized in her heart and whispered, \"Fifth brother really isn’t much like us. Captain Xia, how did you think to ask Fifth brother for advice?\"","Xia Jinyuan’s eyelids drooped and he gave her a deep, intense look, \"Are you trying to say I’ve lost my mind, picked the wrong person, asked the wrong person?\"","This Little Fox, still trying to be pretentious in front of him. Little one, he saw right through her.","Ye Jian, feeling somewhat sheepish, pretended to touch her bare arm and changed the subject, \"No, no, it’s fine, I think it’s quite good.\"","Hey, it wasn’t her who said it; he said it himself.","The insincere tone nearly made Xia Jinyuan laugh. The curtain was still drawn, and the salesperson kept standing outside without coming in. With a slight shift in his gaze and a hint of mischief in his expression, Xia Jinyuan suddenly straightened Ye Jian’s shoulders to face him directly, and before she could figure out what was happening, her lips were kissed.","Ye Jian’s heart nearly leaped out of her throat in fright, managing only a rushed mumble before she was wholly captured in Xia Jinyuan’s palm, without even a chance to struggle.","There was no need to struggle because as Ye Jian thought about struggling, Xia Jinyuan, with a low chuckle, had already pulled away. The foreplay was intense, she thought it would continue, but it abruptly stopped without deepening the kiss.","Even so, it had made Ye Jian’s cheeks flush red.","But she was also used to Xia Jinyuan’s sudden moves. Besides feeling shy, Ye Jian wouldn’t resist; after all, it’s quite normal for a couple to kiss, and doing so publicly in a large venue is also very normal.","Calm down, Ye Jian, you’re in your twenties, not a fifteen or sixteen-year-old girl. Oh, no, no, teenage girls in cinemas are braver than her, boldly kissing their boyfriends when moved.","And here she was, in her twenties, still shy, still afraid of being discovered. That was surely rather affected!"]},{"number":5490,"title":"Chapter 5490: It Must Be Sweet and Doting","paragraphs":["Ye Jian, who never liked being pretentious, took a deep breath. Then, she transformed into the aggressor, wrapped her arms around Xia Jinyuan’s neck, slightly tilted her head back, and kissed her boyfriend directly on his thin lips.","Xia Jinyuan, wide-eyed with shock, \"...\" His eyes widened in terror, a near thirty-year-old man shocked almost to the point of jumping off the couch.","She she she... kissed kissed kissed... outside... kissed! She kissed him!","Compared to Ye Jian, who was caught off guard and shocked before quickly turning shy, Xia Jinyuan was genuinely terrified, and quite severely at that!","After the kiss, Ye Jian saw him staring dumbfounded, his handsome face frozen in shock, and suddenly understood why he always loved to kiss her when she least expected it.","It turned out, seeing the most beloved person show a side they never show was truly amusing, so amusing that she wanted to try it again.","Who was Xia Jinyuan? Scared as he might have been, it only lasted a few seconds. He wouldn’t give Ye Jian a second chance, especially seeing that Ye Jian wanted to go for another round. His eyes flickered slightly as he maintained a shocked expression, quietly waiting for Ye Jian to fall into the trap.","Consequently, Ye Jian obediently fell into the trap, and oh, how pleased she was with herself.","She kissed him a second time and even used Xia Jinyuan’s favorite move, lightly biting his thin lips with her teeth, then straightening up. At this moment, her eyes were smiling like crescent moons perched on treetops, mischievous and cute, endearing her to his heart.","\"How was that, Captain Xia, wasn’t it wonderful? Why the shock? Didn’t you say it’s normal for lovers to kiss? I also think it’s very normal. Especially after that walk through the cinema, I see it even clearer,\" she said.","While speaking, she nonchalantly raised her hand to pat Xia Jinyuan’s handsome face, her demeanor rather like a cheeky rascal after pulling a trick.","Xia Jinyuan could no longer hold back his laughter, worried about hurting his girlfriend’s pride, he quickly turned his head to the side, laughing until his shoulders shook.","Ye Jian realized instantly that she had been teased again.","How infuriating!","She thought she had made a comeback, but in the end, she was thoroughly outplayed.","Indeed, one should never get too cocky; getting cocky always leads to a setback!","\"Hmph!\" She snorted forcefully, knowing she couldn’t win, Ye Jian straightforwardly took action, reached out and twisted Xia Jinyuan’s waist, twisting hard. Xia Jinyuan immediately stopped shaking with laughter.","\"My fault, my fault, all my fault,\" he quickly turned back and apologized to his girlfriend. But every time he remembered her triumphant air, like a happy hamster that got a nut, he couldn’t help wanting to laugh again.","Ye Jian, embarrassed by his laughter, twisted even harder, \"Fine, fine, keep laughing and I might just eat you up in one bite.\"","There came the commercial catchphrase.","It didn’t stop Xia Jinyuan’s laughter; instead, it made him laugh even louder, \"Alright, alright, I’ll stop laughing, go easy, don’t damage anything. No no no, I’m thick-skinned, just don’t hurt your own hand.\"","He coaxed her, and Ye Jian, not at all angry, also laughed, \"I won’t hurt. It’s you who will be in pain.\"","Soon, both of them were laughing together, so affectionate, so harmonious, that even the salespeople behind the curtain could feel the sweetness between the two.","Sweet is good, sweet is good, the sweeter the better, the more clothes they buy!","Xia Jinyuan loved every aspect of Ye Jian whenever, her strength, coldness, power, gentleness, cunning, decisiveness... Every version of her deeply captivated and enchanted him."]},{"number":5491,"title":"Chapter 5491: Being an Older Brother is Tough","paragraphs":["Once again wrapping his arms around the giggling and blushing Ye Jian, as if she were tipsy, Xia Jinyuan looked at the pile of clothes yet to be tried on and teased again, \"We’ve spent too much time here, darling, try these on. You can’t just hog the space without buying anything, and keep the salesperson waiting.\"","His Little Fox was kind-hearted and wouldn’t let the salesperson’s enthusiasm go to waste.","Ye Jian, also feeling she had taken up too much of the salesperson’s time, looked at the clothes yet to be tried on, slightly furrowed her brows, and asked, \"Do I have to try all these clothes?\"","Xia Jinyuan smiled, \"You can pick and choose.\"","Ye Jian, picking through them, selected all the skirts and sighed, \"Skip the skirts, pants are okay.\"","Chinese New Year was coming, and it seemed she was short on casual clothes for a few years, so since they were out, she might as well buy a few pieces.","Typically, it was the ladies who loved to shop while the gentlemen unenthusiastically accompanied them, but with Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan, the roles were switched—it was Ye Jian who was reluctant, while Xia Jinyuan was excited.","Ye Jian went back into the fitting room with a sigh of headache as she faced the pile of clothes again, and it started all over.","Meanwhile, outside, Xia Jinyuan received a call from Xia Yunyin, who, along with the enthusiastic Old Madam and old master, was staying back at the old mansion.","With the phone on speaker, both elders could hear Xia Jinyuan speak.","\"Not very well, my girlfriend and those gold-digging girlfriends of yours are different. Shopping holds no appeal for her, and any ideas you have in the future, I’ll be ignoring outright.\" Xia Jinyuan spoke indifferently, resolute in not admitting that he was quite interested, while Ye Jian was not very enthusiastic.","Before Xia Yunyin could respond, Old Madam exploded, \"Old Fifth, what kind of absurd plan did you come up with? You’ve made Little Six uncomfortable!\"","Rubbing his sore head, Xia Yunyin felt wronged...","\"All good ideas, I swear on my conscience! Tried and true, never failed!\" Xia Yunyin himself was puzzled, as his usually successful plans seemed off when it came to his younger sister.","Listening by the side, the old master sighed and shook his head, speaking to his grandson on the phone, \"Little Six, Little Ye is different from those scheming girlfriends of Old Fifth, you took her to the wrong place. Go to the racetrack tomorrow, she might like that place, and the shooting range is also good, she might find these places to her liking.\"","\"Old Fifth opened a racetrack and a shooting range, Grandpa has been there twice, not bad, it’s just that it’s a bit of a drive to the suburbs.\"","\"Oh dear, grandma, if you hit me again, I really will end up in the hospital,\" Xia Yunyin nearly cried as his head got hit hard by the Old Madam again.","Was it easy for him?","His brother was in love, but why was it him, the brother, who felt the pain?","It’s not a crime to be a brother!","However, he really hadn’t thought of the racetrack and shooting range because, at such places, girls mostly ended up watching and didn’t play.","Not only did Old Madam bang his head, but she also twisted his ear, \"Tomorrow you bring your brother and sister-in-law to the racetrack and shooting range, do you hear? If you come up with any more terrible ideas, I’ll show you what’s what!\"","\"Yes, yes, absolutely, I will obey,\" Xia Yunyin pleaded continuously, his ear painfully twisted. Tomorrow, he would definitely accompany them all day long, to make Little Six happy, he would call some old friends to join them for a bit of competition too.","Whether sister-in-law likes it or not... that’s for Little Six to handle himself.","Sigh, being a brother is really tiring!","Brother is in love, why drag the other brother into it as a scapegoat?","Xia Yunyin was very frustrated, while Xia Jinyuan was very happy."]},{"number":5492,"title":"Chapter 5492: Unexpected Encounter","paragraphs":["The horse course, fancy shooting, Xia Jinyuan was very interested and believed Ye Jian was just as intrigued. However, he didn’t make a decision right away and needed to ask Ye Jian first.","There was no helping it, his girlfriend preferred to stay at home and accompany Old Man Xia.","Maybe it would be best to bring Old Man Xia along? And invite Grandpa and Grandma as well.","Xia Yunyin said that their family’s Little Six was really good at setting him up. He had wanted to bring a date, but now that the elders were invited, that certainly wasn’t happening.","Grandpa Xia and Old Madam Xia expressed that they were quite willing to come along.","Thus, only Ye Jian’s approval was needed on this end.","Ye Jian was still trying on clothes, patiently finishing her trial of these outfits. As Xia Jinyuan sat on the sofa watching her the entire time, a pleased expression appeared on his face.","\"How do you like them?\" Ye Jian asked after trying on the last outfit.","\"They’re all good. Have them all wrapped up,\" Xia Jinyuan genuinely felt Ye Jian looked good in everything. Moreover, during the fitting, he was thankful for his prudent decision to pull the curtain close beforehand. Each time Ye Jian emerged, no one but him, not even the sales assistant, could see her!","The sales assistant standing outside chuckled continuously. She had not expected such a handsome man to be so narrow-minded, afraid of other men seeing his girlfriend’s beauty.","Inside, Ye Jian’s eyes were also curved in laughter; at that moment, Captain Xia really... looked like a nouveau riche. If it weren’t for his inherent noble demeanor, he would indeed seem like a nouveau riche. No, no, no, it would take a level higher than that.","\"What are you laughing about?\" Xia Jinyuan asked as he noticed her eyes twinkling with amusement.","\"Your tone just now—it sounded like one of those domineering CEOs in TV dramas,\" Ye Jian teased him with a laugh.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t mind and chuckled, \"Even though I’m not some domineering CEO, I still have enough money to buy my wife a few clothes. After all, I can’t let anyone down, especially not my wife, right?\"","Ye Jian initially meant to tease Xia Jinyuan back, but it all ended up back on herself, as cunning as a fox.","The ever-waiting sales assistant couldn’t hold it in any longer and burst out laughing, which made Ye Jian too embarrassed to emerge from the inside.","\"I’ll go change my clothes. You... please, help yourself.\" An embarrassed Ye Jian turned to head back to the dressing room, but Xia Jinyuan quickly stood up and reached out his hand to stop Ye Jian. \"Just wear this one, don’t change.\"","\"You said you can’t wear so many, so start now. Change once a day until the holiday is over.\" Xia Jinyuan promptly found a clerk and gestured for them to remove the tags for Ye Jian.","His decisiveness truly matched his words.","Ye Jian didn’t even get a chance to change back; she was already dressed anew. Thankfully, it was a pants outfit, and Ye Jian quickly adjusted. If it had been a dress, she would have certainly changed again.","In the payment area, a somewhat familiar voice called out uncertainly, \"Little Ye?\"","Ye Jian turned and saw a newly minted couple walking toward her, with V8 trailing half a step behind, giving Ye Jian a knowing look. Ye Jian blinked, signaling that there was no need to avoid them and that it was fine they ran into each other.","Qin Ying’s smile deepened when she saw Ye Jian. \"I knew it was you two. I thought it looked like you when I came in and wasn’t quite sure; thankfully, I didn’t mistake someone else.\"","Qin Ying walked a bit faster than before. She hadn’t been sure earlier and just tentatively called out, but it turned out it really was Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan."]},{"number":5493,"title":"Chapter 5493: Unlovable Boyfriend","paragraphs":["When she first came in, Qin Ying really wasn’t sure and specially asked V8 to check if it was them. V8 said they’d come over and take a look, that it wouldn’t matter if it wasn’t them. With that reassurance, Qin Ying walked over to say hello, and to her surprise, it indeed was the couple.","Trailing half a step behind his girlfriend, V8 had already given Xia Jinyuan two hand signals. The first one, \"Why haven’t you left yet?\" The second, \"He hasn’t said anything.\"","Xia Jinyuan subtly nodded to acknowledge he had received the signals.","V8 was rather helpless. He had taken Qin Ying to browse three or four shops before circling back, thinking their captain would surely have left by then. But the reality slapped him hard across the face. Their captain, who was both cold and cool, pushing them relentlessly in training, was still there.","He, he, he... was accompanying Azure Bird on a shopping spree!","Sigh, he really wanted to save the captain some face, but it wasn’t that he didn’t want to – it was that the captain was making it hard, lingering in the store without leaving.","V8 personally thought that their captain probably wouldn’t want the soldiers to see him acting like a whipped boyfriend while shopping with his girlfriend.","Ye Jian was already chatting with Qin Ying, who glanced at Xia Jinyuan and said to Ye Jian with a smile, \"This time, I’m truly certain that you and Little Six are a couple. A man who’s tall, handsome, and a woman who’s beautiful as a flower. You and he are the most perfect couple I’ve seen. Standing together, you’re like a scenic view, and it makes me want to rush home and grab my camera.\"","As a photographer, Qin Ying had a keen eye for all things beautiful.","Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian indeed appeared to her as the most matched lovers, not just lip service, but her honest opinion.","Of course, none of these were the reason Qin Ying took the initiative to come over. The real reason was that she wanted to confirm if her boyfriend, Yang Xulin, had a good relationship with Xia Jinyuan.","Unfortunately, ever since she saw Xia Jinyuan, despite her covert attention, she didn’t notice any special interactions between the two. They just nodded at each other upon meeting, a nod akin to strangers crossing paths, showing no sign of anything unusual.","Had she overthought it? Perhaps the two didn’t know each other well?","Qin Ying was a forthright person, and after merely a few encounters, Ye Jian had come to like her personality. Thus, even though they weren’t familiar, they were able to chat amiably.","V8 stood honestly beside his girlfriend, not taking the initiative to chat with Xia Jinyuan, until Qin Ying resignedly reminded him to talk to Xia Jinyuan. Then V8 chuckled, \"hehe,\" and honestly moved in to talk.","Seeing this, Qin Ying said to Ye Jian with a smile, \"My boyfriend is a bit dull. I don’t know if it’s from staying in the military for too long, he seems simple-minded but quite adorable to look at.\"","Simple-minded but quite adorable to look at... Ye Jian almost bit her tongue.","V8, oh V8, what trick did you pull behind the scenes to make Qin Ying think you’re simple? Simple? There’s not a single simple soldier in the Snow Region Brigade!","Qin Ying, as clever as she was, turned out to be duped by V8 too!","At this moment, V8 actually had a lot he wanted to talk about with Xia Jinyuan. He had planned to call him later, but unexpectedly bumped into his own captain and Ye Jian while out shopping.","Great, he thought, let’s talk while we can.","He gestured towards the outside and said to Qin Ying, \"You chat here, I’ll wait for you outside. The shop is busy, and standing here, we’re in the way like pillars.\"","After saying that, he asked Xia Jinyuan, \"Shall we go together?\"","Xia Jinyuan glanced at V8 and declined indifferently, \"I’m settling the bill. It’s not convenient for me to go out.\"","Qin Ying retracted the glance she had cast aside and asked Ye Jian with a smile, \"What new clothes did you buy? Did he pick them out for you? Little six from the Xia family should have good taste. As for this guy of mine, I wouldn’t dare let him choose; I don’t even want to ask.\""]},{"number":5494,"title":"Chapter 5494: IQ Emergency","paragraphs":["Suddenly, Qin Ying seemed to ask offhandedly, \"You guys must rarely get to go out shopping in the military, right?\"","\"You guys\" included Xia Jinyuan, Ye Jian, and also V8.","V8 was very calm, his girlfriend was clever, but when it came to King Q and Azure Bird, this kind of probing was child’s play, and it was absolutely impossible to get any information out of them.","Understanding this, Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan exchanged a glance, Ye Jian sighed and said, \"We completely lack time, and you might not believe this, but this is only the second time he and I have gone shopping together, and it’s been almost five years since the last time, right?\"","Almost five years since the last shopping trip?","\"That long? Then you must rarely even meet each other?\" Qin Ying asked in surprise, \"I thought you were all in the same military unit.\"","\"No, there’s some distance between him and me.\" Ye Jian only gave a brief explanation before she stopped talking about the team, instead asking Qin Ying what had caught her eye and what she planned to buy.","Having been ruthlessly rejected when inviting the Captain out, V8 finally stood alongside Xia Jinyuan; seizing the moment when Qin Ying was not paying attention, he quickly said, \"Captain, you’re undermining me. I have something to discuss with you, about your love rival, and yet you still refuse.\"","Previously in the hospital, he noticed that Ye Jian and her future sister-in-law seemed to have an extraordinary relationship, and though he was a man who tended to be thick-skinned, he could still tell that his future brother-in-law’s gaze toward Ye Jian was unusual.","Moreover, when he took his future mother-in-law home early this morning, she repeatedly hinted and asked about Ye Jian on the way, forcing him to respond evasively. When asked about the relationship between Ye Jian and the Captain, he of course praised them continuously. The future mother-in-law also asked if he knew Ye Jian and Xia family’s Little Six, to which he replied with a simple \"I only know of them, not close\" to dismiss the future mother-in-law’s curiosity. Ah, that journey was truly uncomfortable.","Their Captain, it seemed like no one knew he was Special Forces, everyone thought he was a do-nothing scion, even though he had attended a prestigious university, he was now just lazing through life.","It had to be said, the Captain used to be quite the rogue; all these years had passed, and people still thought of him as a profligate.","Xia Jinyuan glanced at V8, unable to stop worrying about his comrade’s intelligence, \"Have you not actually tried to understand Qin Ying? Qin Ying, the legendary figure of The First Experimental High School, even I, three grades below her, knew about her consistently leading performance at school.\"","\"Do you think she’s pretty and treated her like a vase? Trying to be clever under her watch is just asking to be caught.\"","As they stood together, Qin Ying’s gaze swept over them lightly. With a somewhat embarrassed look on his face, V8 chuckled, \"Yeah, I didn’t bring anything when I visited Xiaoying’s house the other day, so we decided to come shopping this evening while we had time.\" He really didn’t expect his luck to be so good; not only did he get to go shopping with his girlfriend, but he also ran into the Captain buying clothes for Ye Jian. He hadn’t expected the Captain to have such a tender side hidden beneath his tough exterior, no, no, no, not tender, but rather, a side of being an eager to please subordinate.","It really wasn’t easy, truly not easy.","In training, he was always extra strict with Ye Jian, but when it came to everyday life, he switched roles, becoming a pushover.","Facing his comrade’s incongruous answers, Xia Jinyuan laughed coldly, \"You really think of Qin Ying as a three-year-old kid. My relationship with you as comrades doesn’t need to be hidden from her, Qin Xiu knows as well, just don’t tell Madam Qin and that’ll do.\""]},{"number":5495,"title":"Chapter 5495: Showing Off Boyfriend","paragraphs":["V8 glared, \"Why didn’t you say so earlier! I’ve been feeling guilty and didn’t dare to confess.\"","\"Are you dumb? How could you expect to hide our relationship from the person you share a pillow with? Bro, at times like these, it should be your other half keeping secrets from the people around you, like that Madam Qin!\"","Xia Jinyuan was tempted to crack open V8’s skull to see if it was stuffed with cotton, \"You can hide from anyone, but you must never hide from Qin Ying. Find an opportunity to tell her yourself. And don’t treat her like an ordinary woman, Qin Ying was raised by Old Madam Qin herself. And Old Madam Qin, a heroine among women, raised her granddaughter. You think she is easy to fool?\"","As far as Xia Jinyuan understood Qin Ying, seeing V8 trying to pull something under her watchful eyes made him want to curse, \"You’ve got some nerve.\"","The sales associate finally sorted out the dozen or so clothes and came over to ask Xia Jinyuan to pay. V8, with a loose tongue, casually asked \"how many pieces were bought.\" The sales associate, who had made quite a sale, sweetly reported a number, leaving V8 utterly shocked.","Holy crap! Sixteen pieces! Was he planning to wear these for years?","Xia Jinyuan didn’t even want to talk to his comrade whose IQ seemed to have suddenly dropped, and said to Ye Jian, \"I’ll go pay. You guys chat with them.\"","V8’s eyes twinkled slyly as he said with a smile, \"Go ahead with peace of mind, Captain. I’ll take good care of the two ladies here.\"","Upon hearing this, Qin Ying \"heh\"ed noiselessly, glaring at V8 openly. She glared so intensely that V8 repeatedly begged for mercy with his eyes, I know I was wrong, Great one, I know I was wrong.","Qin Ying didn’t pay attention to V8. She always trusted her own instincts, and she had sensed that the three of them had a good relationship when she first saw them get out of the car, even though they acted tough in front of her and claimed they were merely acquaintances.","She would have been surprised if that were true!","Indeed, they were acquainted. Little Six from the Xia family turned out to be the Captain of her seemingly honest-looking, yet actually scheming boyfriend!","In public, Qin Ying gave her boyfriend face and did not immediately confront him. Instead, she appraised the outfit Ye Jian was wearing, \"You look quite pretty in that outfit; good choice.\"","It really brought out Ye Jian’s slenderness and tall figure.","Ye Jian, flattered, pursed her lips and smiled, tugging at her clothes as if helpless, \"It was all his selection, I just tried them on.\" After all, Ye Jian didn’t care what she wore; if he thought it looked good, then she wore it.","\"You’re feeding us quite the dose of dog food here. If I were single, you’d have stuffed me full,\" Qin Ying teased. It seemed their relationship was no ordinary one. The deeper it was, the less chance her own brother had with Ye Jian.","Xia Jinyuan, both outstanding and considerate, was truly far better than her own reticent brother.","Xia Jinyuan, who had checked out, came over with four large bags. Seeing Qin Ying and Ye Jian chatting so merrily, he glanced at V8 first and then said to Qin Ying, \"We’re heading to the horse riding club tomorrow. If you two have time, come with us.\"","That was something V8 couldn’t decide, so Xia Jinyuan directly asked Qin Ying.","Qin Ying, also a fan of horseback riding, was interested but still declined, \"The old master is still lying in the hospital; he can’t be discharged until the day after tomorrow. Let’s postpone it, we can arrange another time.\"","\"That’s fine,\" Xia Jinyuan nodded slightly. After another look at V8, his expression suddenly became very solemn, and with great seriousness, he said to Qin Ying, \"Old Yang is a very good person. Due to the special nature of our work, he dares not casually disclose our relationship privately. If he has kept anything from you, it is because of his duty. I hope you can understand.\""]},{"number":5496,"title":"Chapter 5496: Disclosure","paragraphs":["Qin Ying, still on the verge of testing the waters, had not expected Xia Jinyuan to suddenly open up, and for a moment, she was even taken aback.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t want his comrades-in-arms to worry about this later on, so he bluntly spoke up first, saying that it was quite suitable. He could take the responsibility for V8’s secrecy as if it were his own idea, to make Qin Ying feel more at ease.","\"I am his Captain. I joined their team right after graduating from university and have been working with them for nearly seven years. I’ve known him for almost the same length of time. As a person, he’s not what you’d call honest, but he’s absolutely reliable. You can hit him or scold him, and he will definitely not talk back or retaliate.\"","\"With some proper adjustment, he’s sure to be a good husband and a good father in the future.\"","He was so serious that it caught Qin Ying off guard. Clarifying their relationship, she quickly replied, \"He is my boyfriend, and I will naturally be understanding towards him. As long as it’s not something like having an affair, I won’t get angry over work-related secrets.\"","\"Your professions are special, and I’m very aware of that. Take my brother, for example; he works in the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and also has a lot of matters to keep secret. Even my father can’t inquire about them. I’m very clear about this and don’t blame Old Yang.\"","The Captain, Little Six from the Xia family, turns out to be their Old Yang’s Captain!","Qin Ying was saying this, but her heart was already in turmoil.","It’s ironic that her mother had described Xia Jinyuan as the capital city’s number one wastrel, saying whoever ended up with him would suffer, and that he was definitely just playing around and not serious.","On hearing this, her brother’s face had darkened instantly; if it wasn’t their mother, given his nature of not speaking unless necessary, and if he did, it would surely end with someone pinned against the wall – he would have practically plastered their madam to the wall – the kind that would need a shovel to get down!","What wastrel, what nonsense, what playing around, what not serious – she wanted to say, wasn’t her mother misled by someone?","She didn’t understand Xia Jinyuan at all, yet she acted as if she \"knew him very well.\"","Now that Xia Jinyuan had clarified things and Qin Ying had openly spoken her mind, there was no need for V8 to step in; everything between the team and the family was already settled.","V8 was tearfully grateful.","At the critical moment, it was still their King of Q who was reliable!","Qin Ying had questions she wanted to ask V8, guessing that the couple in front of her would probably not want the four of them to travel together. After saying a few more words, Qin Ying took the initiative to say goodbye, \"We’ll go shop around in another store, and not interrupt your shopping. Since you’re both in the capital city recently, let’s get together properly once my old master gets discharged from the hospital. For today, goodbye, and we’ll talk more next time.\"","Arm in arm with V8, she said her polite goodbyes with a touch of intimacy and waved to them.","Ye Jian could feel the intimacy in Qin Ying’s behavior, and her smile deepened a lot, \"Alright, we’ll chat next time.\"","\"Okay, then we’ll be off. See you around.\"","\"See you around.\" Ye Jian waved, watching Qin Ying and V8 leave before turning to Xia Jinyuan with a smile, \"I guess Qin Ying knew from the start that there was something unusual about your relationship with V8. It’s a mystery to me why V8 insisted on keeping it secret.\"","Carrying all the bags in his left hand, Xia Jinyuan laughed along, \"That’s why I hope the two of them can be together for a long time to come, to help improve the single situation in the team.\"","Thinking of the large group of clearly outstanding comrades in the squadron who genuinely didn’t have girlfriends, Ye Jian felt sympathetic. Then, looking at Xia Jinyuan with the urgent look of an old father anxious to solve his single son’s marital issues, she couldn’t help but laugh out loud."]},{"number":5497,"title":"Chapter 5497: Seeking Strategy","paragraphs":["Her Captain Xia was really a busy man, not only busy with training but also needing to sort out his comrade’s lifelong affairs, just like an old father indeed.","\"You worry too much, if it really doesn’t work out, we can solve it by arranging a marriage alliance. Let’s go, and then we head back home,\" said Ye Jian as she took the lead to walk away.","She didn’t ask whether they were really going to the horse farm tomorrow because she thought it was just Xia Jinyuan being polite.","Xia Jinyuan, however, stood still.","\"Why aren’t you walking?\" Ye Jian turned around to look at Xia Jinyuan, then at the bags he was twisting in his hand, and she realized, \"Too many, hard to carry, right?\"","She turned back, pretending to take some of the bags.","Xia Jinyuan lifted his left hand, which was carrying the bags, bent his arm, and slightly raised his eyebrows at Ye Jian.","Now Ye Jian understood what Xia Jinyuan meant; she laced her arm with Xia Jinyuan’s, \"Got it, got it, holding hands or linking arms, right? Did Fifth Brother teach you this? Does Fifth Brother do this too? Unlikely, Fifth Brother seems the type to solve things with money. I don’t think he would carry shopping bags with his girlfriend.\"","Indeed, she wasn’t wrong—Xia Yunyin had never accompanied a girl shopping; he preferred to hand over a card, saving both trouble and time, without needing to put in any effort.","Not meeting the right person, the one you truly like, makes shopping a burden.","\"Fifth Brother likes to use money, while I prefer this way,\" Xia Jinyuan was very pleased with his girlfriend’s quick-wittedness, knowing to come over and link arms immediately, walking out of the store in sync.","As Ye Jian was about to leave the store, she overheard someone say, \"Look at that guy just now, tall, handsome, generous, and so caring for his girlfriend. Who says all you men are unromantic straight guys? Look at him, so attentive and considerate to his girlfriend. I want to find a boyfriend just like him.\"","\"Hehe, that’s quite an ambition, isn’t it? It’s something that can’t be forced. A good man is always someone else’s. The ones at home are always a bit lacking.\"","Because you can’t see the faults in others’ partners, but you tend to magnify the flaws in your own, that’s why they always seem a bit lacking.","When she reached the doorway, she heard a delicate voice behind her saying, \"Look at you compared to that boyfriend just now. It’s really frustrating how people compare! He knows how to make his girlfriend happy. Unlike you, who’s barely willing to accompany me shopping even as the New Year approaches.\"","Ye Jian smiled, her hands still linked with Xia Jinyuan’s arms, her cheeks dimpling deeper with her smile. Her man, naturally, was the best.","\"What’s next for us?\" Ye Jian, beaming with enthusiasm, slapped Xia Jinyuan’s arm and asked, \"Shopping really is a delightful thing. What to do, I still want to continue.\"","\"What’s next?\" Xia Jinyuan stopped in his tracks, his gaze deep as he looked at his girlfriend, who radiated joy. He had just seen the triumphant smile on Ye Jian’s face and wanted to keep teasing her.","\"Before we go to the next stop, doesn’t my excellent boyfriend deserve a kiss as a reward?\" Xia Jinyuan asked with a mischievous smile.","\"A car runs out of gas after too long, a boyfriend gets tired after too much shopping--he needs a kiss from his girlfriend to fuel up.\"","Ye Jian looked around; there were so many people coming and going, it really was a bit embarrassing to kiss here, especially since they had already kissed three times just earlier.","\"What does it matter with so many people around? No one will notice us,\" Xia Jinyuan, his handsome face inching closer, didn’t mind at all, \"I’m not asking for much, just one kiss on each cheek.\""]},{"number":5498,"title":"Chapter 5498: Couple Outfits","paragraphs":["Ye Jian looked around and still felt that kissing him in such a public place... she would need a little courage to do so.","\"If you don’t kiss me now, we’ll really start drawing too much attention standing here,\" Xia Jinyuan said, his eyes brimming with amusement as he looked around, trying to find an opportunity to kiss his girlfriend. \"In the few seconds you’ve hesitated, you could have already kissed me.\"","Ye Jian bit her lip, thinking that whether she leaned in for a kiss or pulled back, a kiss was still needed. She decided to make it quick and not to stand in the middle of the road like a roadblock. After all, she was kissing her own boyfriend, not someone else. What was there to be shy about? There was nothing to be embarrassed about!","Ye Jian tiptoed and quickly gave Xia Jinyuan a kiss, yes, just one kiss. After the kiss, she immediately pretended to be calm and took Xia Jinyuan’s arm, leading him forward: \"Let’s go, let’s keep shopping.\"","Xia Jinyuan let out a delighted laugh, his voice full of indulgence: \"Okay, let’s keep shopping. You’re walking so fast, where are we going next? You lead the way?\"","\"We’re buying you some clothes.\" Ye Jian looked around and thought for a moment, then her eyes lit up as if she’d thought of something, \"I’ve got it, we’re going shopping for your clothes. Do they have couple outfits? Matching colors would also work, we could wear matching outfits!\"","Xia Jinyuan laughed even more, \"We wear matching outfits every day in the team.\"","\"That’s different, we haven’t worn them casually before.\" After saying this, she pulled Xia Jinyuan into the elevator, heading straight for the men’s section upstairs.","\"We should definitely take a good look. On the day of our engagement, we should dress sharp,\" Xia Jinyuan followed Ye Jian’s lead, agreeing thoroughly, \"If the bride is beautiful, the groom can’t be too shabby; too shabby, and my future father-in-law might just regret it on the spot.\"","His future father-in-law was particularly protective of his daughter. He had previously mentioned wanting to keep Ye Jian until she was 27 or 28 before discussing marriage. However, he had proposed an early engagement, already foreseeing how dismayed his future father-in-law’s reaction would be!","He wasn’t joking previously; they needed to get this engagement settled, with the old master, Old Madam, and the whole family eagerly anticipating it.","He could only hope that the old master would agree by then. He would then talk it over properly with his future father-in-law to see if it was feasible. If he really didn’t agree, Xia Jinyuan was willing to wait a bit longer and would talk it over with the elders back home.","\"My family doesn’t even know, so don’t just assume it’s a done deal. Grandpa Gen probably won’t be a big issue, but my father is the real problem,\" Xia Jinyuan said as he mentioned the engagement again, speaking of brides and grooms, which made Ye Jian’s cheeks burn. She said softly, \"It’s all still up in the air, and you’re talking as if it’s already decided. We don’t even know if my father will come back for Spring Festival.\"","Such matters of course required her father’s presence. Grandpa Gen had said that her father would come back, but until he was home, nothing was certain.","Once back, it was still possible that he could be called away at the last minute.","\"Unless something unexpected happens, your father should be coming back this Spring Festival,\" Xia Jinyuan was still quite sure, \"When father comes back, I’ll talk with him and try to gain his approval.\"","\"How do you know?\" Ye Jian asked. Captain Xia would never talk about things he wasn’t sure of, so since he said it, it must be feasible.","\"Your boyfriend has his ways; this little matter won’t be difficult for me.\"","Xia Jinyuan’s smile was filled with deep meaning, which made Ye Jian a bit puzzled. She furrowed her delicate brows, thought for a moment, and just as she was about to ask more, Xia Jinyuan changed the subject: \"You picked out all your clothes earlier, so it’s only right that you pick out mine. Let’s see if you can find some matching outfits for us.\""]},{"number":5499,"title":"Chapter 5499: Good News","paragraphs":["How did he know? Simple, his brother worked on the same base as his future father-in-law, so he must have heard something, right?","Ye Jian hadn’t thought of that yet.","\"Okay.\" Ye Jian nodded in agreement, \"You still haven’t told me how you knew my father was coming back. Did you hide something from me? Did you tell my father ahead of time?\"","Xia Jinyuan raised an eyebrow, \"You help me pick some clothes first. After we’re done, I’ll tell you.\"","\"No going back on your word!\"","\"I won’t go back on my word!\"","Ye Jian thus didn’t continue to press further and went into the men’s clothing store. Suddenly, she experienced the feeling Xia Jinyuan had when he chose a bunch of clothes for her; her boyfriend looked good in anything, given his handsome looks and excellent physique.","Ye Jian picked several clothes for Xia Jinyuan to try on and waited on the couch when suddenly a call came from home.","\"Girl, where are you now?\" The old man’s cheerful voice came from the phone, indicating he was in a good mood, probably having had a delightful chat with Old Master Qin again.","Listening, Ye Jian felt good too and answered with a smile, \"Still out. Is there something at Grandpa’s house? Should I come back now?\"","\"No need, you and Little Six enjoy yourselves out there, no rush to come home. I just got a call from your dad, saying he can come back for the Spring Festival this year. It looks like our family can have a proper reunion dinner.\"","\"Your dad and your brother are both coming back; our family can really celebrate a reunion Spring Festival this year.\" The old man’s words brimmed with joy, making Old Master Qin lying next to him unable to resist being happy for his old friend.","This old friend of his, who was a wealthy young master surrounded by many servants in his first twenty years, waited on hand and foot. But later, he suffered hardships he had never faced before until nearly his forties, despite having numerous children, in the end, he only had his son, Li Jinnian, by his side.","Fortunately, his old friend was open-minded and did not let the hardships crush him.","Now, all the bitter had turned sweet, truly bitter turned sweet.","The old man himself didn’t expect this Spring Festival; his granddaughter could take an extra ten days off to celebrate New Year at home, his son could also come back from the base, and his grandson Li Jinnian said he could come back too. Finally, this year’s New Year’s Eve dinner wouldn’t be spent alone.","Ha ha ha, ha ha ha, just thinking about it made him happy.","Although the old man usually didn’t say much and strongly supported the younger generation’s work, when every household was lit up and reunited during the year, even Uncle Fu would go back home, he felt quite uncomfortable being alone.","When others had their homes filled with family warmth, but his home was cold and empty, just him alone, he had tasted that feeling too much, and had grown accustomed to it over the years.","Although he knew his granddaughter and son were sacrificing their personal lives for the country and for everyone’s sake, being old, he inevitably became a bit selfish, also wishing to experience the joy of family like other elderly people, to live days surrounded by loving grandchildren.","\"My dad is really coming back?! That’s really great!\"","Xia Jinyuan, who had just come out of the changing room, happened to hear Ye Jian’s joyful words.","\"Grandpa, this year both dad and I can accompany you for the Spring Festival.\" She and Chief Engineer Fu had not seen each other for a long time, and a reunion Spring Festival was an extra special occasion for them. She hadn’t expected it this year, so the possibility of celebrating together made Ye Jian incredibly excited.","\"Yes, we can all spend a wonderful New Year together. Your dad even has a seven-day holiday and will arrive home tomorrow afternoon.\" The old man said cheerfully, \"Since you’re still out having fun, Grandpa won’t disturb you further, just don’t come back home too late.\""]},{"number":5500,"title":"Chapter 5500: Unveiling","paragraphs":["Old Man Xia reminded Ye Jian to go back early, he actually didn’t mean anything else, mainly because he was worried about his daughter coming home too late and encountering danger on the road.","Ye Jian felt somewhat guilty and nodded in agreement, her eyes turned to Xia Jinyuan, and her heart began to beat faster again.","Just now, she thought that since her father hadn’t come home, the matter of the engagement mentioned by Captain Xia could probably be postponed; but now that her father was about to return, and also had a seven-day holiday, didn’t that mean there was plenty of time to finalize the engagement?","\"I told you, the future father-in-law would come back.\" Xia Jinyuan stared at Ye Jian, his Little Fox had nothing more to say now, huh?","\"When did you know about it? Where did you find out from? And you’re so sure.\" Ye Jian found it strange, clearly Grandpa had just received a call and found out her father was coming back, but Captain Xia already acted like he had known earlier, she really couldn’t figure it out.","\"Kiss me and get another answer.\" Xia Jinyuan simply wouldn’t tell, as he wanted another kiss from his girlfriend.","The customers in the store heard his words and smiled amicably. A gentleman even joked, \"Young man, you’ve got potential, knowing how to make your girlfriend happy, much better than us back in our day.\"","\"When you were young, you held a guitar and played under my apartment for hours on end, anyone would be better than you.\" A plump middle-aged woman spoke politely, laughing as she revealed her husband’s past embarrassment, making the middle-aged man stare at her in disbelief.","It was all old news, why bring it up again?","\"See, see, you got joked about.\" The thin-faced Ye Jian glared at Xia Jinyuan, \"Addicted to kissing, are you?\"","\"Ah, I can’t help it, my girlfriend is still adjusting. I’m trying to give her a hand.\" Xia Jinyuan, with his hands in his pockets, had a casual demeanor like the most handsome model in a magazine. \"You were doing so well just now; I thought you got used to it.","\"Looks like I still need to finalize my official status quickly though.\" Xia Jinyuan sighed and shook his head, \"Tonight you have to help me pick out the most suitable outfit to meet the future father-in-law. Once it’s official, I think my girlfriend will be a lot more courageous, after all, it’ll be proper.\"","Ye Jian: \"...\"","Captain Xia was really all talk tonight, no matter how you put it, it was always his logic.","Ye Jian helped Xia Jinyuan choose several outfits and picked gifts for the elders of both families. On the way back to Dan Gui Garden with Ye Jian, she still kept wondering why he was so sure Chief Engineer Fu would come home.","\"How did you know about my father coming back sooner than Grandpa?\" Ye Jian just couldn’t figure it out, her dad would definitely not have contacted him in advance.","And his words didn’t seem spontaneous but rather confident. Now, she suspected that the engagement matter might have been discussed with her father by this guy beside her beforehand!","\"Still thinking about that?\" Xia Jinyuan laughed joyfully, \"Sweetheart, stop thinking about it.\"","\"What exactly is going on?\" Ye Jian was indeed curious, \"Did you talk to my dad about it?\"","\"I was actually thinking of mentioning it earlier, but I was worried about the future father-in-law getting distracted from his work.\" Xia Jinyuan drove steadily and answered with a smile, \"Did you forget about my other brother?\"","At the mention of another brother, Ye Jian suddenly remembered, slapped her forehead laughing, \"Right, how could I forget Brother Three, he’s at the same base as my dad.\""]}]);
